msgstr "Huduma ya Routeri"

msgid "Shutdown the router"
msgstr "Sitisha routeri"

msgid "Graceful mode allows your router to honor its participating tunnel commitments before shutting down or restarting."
msgstr "Modi ya taratibu inaruhusu routeri yako kuzingatia ahadi zake za kushiriki katika tuneli kabla ya kuzimwa au kuanzishwa upya."

msgid "Restart the router"
msgstr "Anza upya routeri"

msgid "A restart may be required to update the router, implement a configuration change, or complete installation of a plugin."
msgstr "Uanzishaji upya unaweza kuhitajika ili kusasisha routeri, kutekeleza mabadiliko ya mipangilio, au kumaliza kusanikishwa cha kiendeshaji."

msgid "Launch console at startup"
msgstr "Anza konsola wakati wa kuwasha mfumo"

msgid "Help with configuring I2P to use a non-system default browser"
msgstr "Msaada wa sanidi ya I2P ili kutumia kivinjari si cha default la mfumo"

msgid "Launch I2P Router Console in web browser when I2P starts."
msgstr "Fungua Konsola ya Routeri ya I2P kwenye kivinjari wa tovuti wakati I2P inapozisha."

msgid "Debugging"
msgstr "Uchunguzi"

#, java-format
msgid "To assist in debugging I2P, it may be helpful to generate a thread dump which will be written to the {0}wrapper log{1}."
msgstr "Ili kusaidia kuchungua I2P, inaweza kusaidia kutengeneza dumpli ya nyuzi ambayo itaandikwa kwenye {0}kumbukumbu ya wrapper{1}."

msgid "If I2P appears to be using too much ram, you can force the router to run the garbage collection routine to free up memory."
msgstr "Ikiwa I2P inaonekana kutumia RAM nyingi mno, unaweza kulazimisha routeri iendeshe utaratibu wa kukusanya taka ili kufungua kumbukumbu."

msgid "System Tray Integration"
msgstr "Muunganisho wa Tray ya Mfumo"

msgid "Enable or disable the I2P system tray applet to enable basic service control."
msgstr "Washa au zima kiambatisho cha tray ya mfumo ya I2P ili kuwasha udhibiti wa msingi wa huduma."

msgid "Configure I2P system service"
msgstr "Sanidi Huduma ya Mfumo ya I2P"

msgid "Configure the status of the I2P service at system startup. If disabled, the service can be launched manually."
msgstr "Sanidi hali ya huduma ya I2P wakati wa kuwasha mfumo. Ikiwa imezimwa, huduma inaweza kuanzishwa kwa mkono."

msgid "Install I2P system service"
msgstr "Sakinisha Huduma ya Mfumo ya I2P"

msgid "Install the I2P system service. This is the recommended way to run I2P."
msgstr "Sakinisha huduma ya mfumo ya I2P. Huu ndio njia inayopendekezwa ya kuendesha I2P."

