msgid "A limited selection of stats is enabled by default, required for monitoring router performance. Only stats that have an optional graph are listed here; for a full list of enabled stats, view the <a href=\"/stats\">stats page</a>."
msgstr "Uchaguo mdogo wa takwimu umewashwa kwa default, unaohitajika kufuatilia utendaji wa routeri. Takwimu zilizo zina grafi ya hiari ndizo zilizoorodheshwa hapa; kwa orodha kamili ya takwimu zilizowashwa, angalia <a href=\"/stats\">kurasa ya takwimu</a>."

