msgid "config tunnels"
msgstr "sanidi tuneli"

msgid "Tunnel Options"
msgstr "Vichaguo vya Tuneli"

msgid "The default settings work for most people."
msgstr "Mipangilio ya default inafanya kazi kwa watu wengi."

msgid "There is a fundamental tradeoff between anonymity and performance."
msgstr "Kuna tradeoff ya msingi kati ya usiri na utendaji."

msgid "Tunnels longer than 3 hops (for example 2 hops + 0-2 hops, 3 hops + 0-1 hops, 3 hops + 0-2 hops), or a high quantity + backup quantity, may severely reduce performance or reliability."
msgstr "Tuneli zilizo ndefu zaidi ya hop 3 (kwa mfano hop 2 + hop 0-2, hop 3 + hop 0-1, hop 3 + hop 0-2), au idadi kubwa + idadi ya nakala rudufu, zinaweza kupunguza utendaji au uaminifu kwa kiasi cha kutatanisha."

msgid "High CPU and/or high outbound bandwidth usage may result."
msgstr "Matumizi makubwa ya CPU na/au ya kasi ya kutoka yanaweza kutokea."

msgid "Change these settings with care, and adjust them if you have problems."
msgstr "Badilisha mipangilio haya kwa uangalifu, na uzirekebishe ikiwa una matatizo."

msgid "Exploratory tunnel setting changes are stored in the router.config file."
msgstr "Mabadiliko ya mipangilio ya tuneli za uchunguzi yanayohifadhiwa katika faili ya router.config."

msgid "Client tunnel changes are temporary and are not saved."
msgstr "Mabadiliko ya tuneli ya mteja ni ya muda msimamo na hayawahitaji kuhifadhiwa."

msgid "The default settings are optimized for general usage and normally don't need to be changed."
msgstr "Mipangilio ya default yaboreshwa kwa matumizi ya kawaida na kwa kawaida yahitaji kubadilishwa."

msgid "To modify client tunnel settings, use the <a href=\"/i2ptunnelmgr\">Tunnel Manager</a>, or the <a href=\"/i2psnark/configure\">Configuration page</a> for I2PSnark."
msgstr "Ili kubadilisha mipangilio ya tuneli za mteja, tumia <a href=\"/i2ptunnelmgr\">Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>, au <a href=\"/i2psnark/configure\">kurasa ya Mipangilio</a> kwa I2PSnark."

msgid "To enable session-only changes to the client tunnels, activate the console's <a href=\"/help/advancedsettings\">Advanced mode</a>."
msgstr "Ili kuwasha mabadiliko ya tuneli za mteja ya kipindi hiki pekee, washa <a href=\"/help/advancedsettings\">Modi ya Juu</a> ya konsola."

