msgid "Advanced Router Configuration"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Juu ya Routeri"

msgid "The router configuration options listed below are not available in the user interface, usually because they are rarely used or provide access to advanced settings that most users will not need. This is not a comprehensive list. Some settings will require a restart of the router to take effect. Note that all settings are case sensitive. You will need to edit your <code>router.config</code> file to add options, or, once you have added <code>routerconsole.advanced=true</code> to the router.config file, you may edit settings within the console on the <a href=/configadvanced>Advanced Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Vichaguo vya mipangilio ya routeri vilivyoorodheshwa hapa chini havipatikani kwenye kiolesura cha mtumiaji, kwa kawaida kwa sababu havitumiki mara kwa mara au vinatoa ufikiaji wa mipangilio ya juu ambayo watumiaji wengi hawahitaji. Huu si orodha kamili. Baadhi ya mipangilio yatahitaji uanzishaji upya wa routeri ili kutumika. Kumbuka kwamba mipangilio yote yanatofautisha herufe. Utahitaji kuhariri faili yako ya <code>router.config</code> ili kuongeza vichaguo, au, baada ya kuongeza <code>routerconsole.advanced=true</code> kwenye faili ya router.config, unaweza kuhariri mipangilio ndani ya konsola kwenye <a href=/configadvanced>kurasa ya Mipangilio za Juu</a>."

msgid "When set to true, additional functionality will be enabled in the console and the user will be able to edit settings directly on the <a href=/configadvanced>Advanced Configuration page</a>. Extra display options are provided in the <a href=/netdb>Network Database section</a>, including the <a href='/netdb?show=sybils'>Sybil Analysis tool</a>, and there are additional configuration options on the <a href=/configclients>Clients Configuration page</a>. This will also enable the installation of unsigned updates, manual configuration of the news URL, and additional sections on the sidebar."
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, shughuli za ziada zitawezishwa ndani ya konsola na mtumiaji atakuwa na uwezo wa kuhariri mipangilio moja kwa moja kwenye <a href=/configadvanced>kurasa ya Mipangilio za Juu</a>. Vichaguo vya ziada vya kuonyesha vinatolewa katika <a href=/netdb>sehemu ya Kanzidata ya Mtandao</a>, ikiwa ni pamoja na <a href='/netdb?show=sybils'>zana ya Uchambuzi wa Sybil</a>, na kuna vichaguo vya ziada vya mipangilio kwenye <a href=/configclients>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Wateja</a>. Hii pia itawasha uwezekano wa kusakinisha sasisho zisizosainiwa, usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa URL ya habari, na sehemu za ziada kwenye sidebar."

msgid "Plugins signed with the cryptographic key of the developer are the recommended format, but if you wish to install unsigned plugins (.zip) you can set this to true. Note that you may still encounter issues attempting to install an unsigned plugin if the developer has included additional checks in the plugin build process."
msgstr "Kiendeshaji kikichosainiwa kwa ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi cha mwandishi ndio muundo unaopendekezwa, lakini ikiwa ungependa kusakinisha kiendeshaji kisichosainiwa (.zip) unaweza kuweka hiki kuwa true. Kumbuka kwamba bado unaweza kukutana na matatizo unapotarajika kusakinisha kiendeshaji kisichosainiwa ikiwa mwandishi ameweka ukaguzi wa ziada katika mchakato wa ujenzi wa kiendeshaji."

msgid "This setting allows the manual selection of the browser which I2P will launch on startup (if the console is <a href=/configservice#browseronstart>configured</a> to launch a browser on startup), overriding the OS default browser. For more information, see the <a href=#alternative_browser>FAQ entry</a> above."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii huruhusu uteuzi wa mkono wa kivinjari ambacho I2P kitalanza wakati mfumo unapowasha (ikiwa konsola <a href=/configservice#browseronstart>imesanidiwa</a> kuzungusha kivinjari wakati mfumo unapowasha), likichiba na kivinjari cha default wa OS. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=#alternative_browser>ingizo la Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara</a> hapo juu."

msgid "When set to true, this enables gzip compression for the router console and default web applications. [Enabled by default]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, hii inawasha ukandamishaji wa gzip kwa konsola ya routeri na programu za tovuti za default. [Imewashwa kwa default]"

msgid "When set to true, this enables plugin installation on the <a href=/configplugins>Plugin Configuration page</a>. [Enabled by default]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, hii inawasha kusanikishwa wa kiendeshaji kwenye <a href=/configplugins>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Kiendeshaji</a>. [Imewashwa kwa default]"

msgid "When set to true, this setting enables reverse DNS lookups for peers, triggered when displaying the country flag of a peer or when the hostname or domain is explicitly displayed in the console, or when the peer's RouterInfo is written to disk. In order to avoid repeat lookups, it's recommended to configure a generous caching policy for DNS lookups of 10 minutes or more, and to configure a privacy respecting DNS server in your operating system. [Disabled by default, restart required]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, mipangilio hii inawasha utatuzi wa DNS wa majibu kwa peer, unaotengenezwa wakati kuonyesha bendera ya nchi ya peer au wakati jina la mashine au domaini kuonyeshwa wazi wazi kwenye konsola, au wakati RouterInfo ya peer kuandikwa kwenye diski. Ili kuepuka utafutaji unaorudiwa, inavyopendekezwa kusanidia sera ya cache ya utafutaji wa DNS ya dakika 10 au zaidi, na kusanidia seva ya DNS inayoheshimu usiri katika mfumo wako wa uendeshaji. [Imezimwa kwa default, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting permits a custom text prefix to be set for the page title on router console pages, potentially useful when you have multiple consoles open on browser tabs and want an easy method to differentiate between them."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii huruhusu kianzishi cha maandishi maalum kiwekwe kwa jina la kurasa kwenye kurasa za konsola ya routeri, ambacho inaweza kuwa na manufaa unapopata konsola nyingi zilizo wazi katika tabo za kivinjari na unapotaka njia rahisi ya kutofautisha kati yao."

msgid "When set to true, accessing the router console via http:// when https:// is enabled will automatically redirect to https. To configure router console access, edit the settings in your <code>clients.config</code> file in your profile directory (<i>not</i> the application installation directory). [Enabled by default]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, kufikia konsola ya routeri kupitia http:// wakati https:// imewashwa kutaelekeza kwa moja kwa moja kwenye https. Ili kusanidia ufikiaji wa konsola ya routeri, hariri mipangilio katika faili yako ya <code>clients.config</code> kwenye katalogi yako ya wasifu (<i>si</i> katalogi ya kusakinisha programu). [Imewashwa kwa default]"

msgid "This setting, when set to true, will display a Peer Test Average readout in the Congestion section of the sidebar, calculated by adding the successful peer test average and the average excess time taken by failed tests. The average value may be used as a guide to determine the optimal <code>router.peerTestTimeout</code> value. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, ukisawazishwa kuwa true, itaonyesha kiasho cha Wastani wa Jaribio la Peer katika sehemu ya msongamano ya sidebar, kikichatwa kwa kuongeza wastani wa jaribio la peer lililofanikiwa na wastani wa muda wa ziada uliotolewa na majaribio yaliyoshindwa. Thamani ya wastani inaweza kutumika kama mwongozo wa kubainisha thamani bora ya <code>router.peerTestTimeout</code>. [Default ni false]"

msgid "This setting, when set to true, will display the <i>Sites of Interest</i> links on <a href=/sitemap>the sitemap</a>. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, ukisawazishwa kuwa true, itaonyesha viungo vya <i>Maeneo ya Kupendezwa</i> kwenye <a href=/sitemap>sitemap</a>. [Default ni false]"

msgid "This setting, when set to true, will present the standard sidebar on the homepage, enabling configuration via <a href=/configsidebar>. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, ukisawazishwa kuwa true, itaonyesha sidebar ya kawaida kwenye ukurasa mkuu, ikiruhusu usanidi kupitia <a href=/configsidebar>. [Default ni false]"

msgid "When set to true, the router console will require login authentication. If no password is set, you will be required to set one on the login page. When set to false, the console is accessible without login if no passwords are configured. [Default is false, will be enabled by default in a future release for CSRF defense]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, konsola ya routeri itahitaji uthibitishaji wa kuingia. Ikiwa hakuna nenosiri lililosetwa, utahitajika kuweka mmoja kwenye kurasa ya kuingia. Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, konsola inapatikana bila kuingia ikiwa hakuna nenosiri lililosanidiwa. [Default ni false, itawashwa kwa default katika toleo lijalo kwa ulinzi wa CSRF]"

msgid "When set to true, the sidebar bandwidth graph uses the legacy RRD4J SVG renderer. When set to false, the new dual-baseline canvas renderer is used, with gradient fills, glow effects, and a split inbound/outbound display. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, grafi ya kasi ya sidebar hutumia renderer ya RRD4J SVG ya zamani. Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, renderer mpya wa canvas wenye msingi mbili hutumika, wenye michazo ya gradient, efekti ya kuwaka, na onyesho la kuingia/kutoka lililotengwa. [Default ni false]"

msgid "The time period, in minutes, displayed in the sidebar bandwidth graph. Values outside the valid range (2–30) are clamped. [Default is 20]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha muda, kwa dakika, kinachonyeshwa kwenye grafi ya kasi ya sidebar. Thamani zilizo nje ya kiwango halali (2–30) zinakomeshwa. [Default ni 20]"

msgid "When set to true (the default), inbound and outbound traffic are displayed in a split view with a center baseline, with outbound spikes upward and inbound spikes downward. When set to false, both lines are displayed in overlay mode from the top of the graph with a configurable composite blend. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true (default), trafiki ya kuingia na ya kutoka inaonyeshwa kwenye onyesho lililotengwa lenye msingi wa kati, ikiwa vishale vya kutoka vinalelekezwa juu na vishale vya kuingia vinalelekezwa chini. Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, mistari yote miwili inaonyeshwa katika modi ya kulazwa juu ya grafi yenye mchanganyiko wa composite unaoweza kubadilishwa. [Default ni true]"

msgid "Sets the render direction for the sidebar bandwidth graph. When set to rtl (the default), the graph renders right-to-left with newest data on the right. When set to ltr, the graph renders left-to-right with newest data on the left. [Default is rtl]"
msgstr "Inaweka mwelekeo wa kuonyesha kwa grafi ya kasi ya sidebar. Ukisawazishwa kuwa rtl (default), grafi inaonyeshwa kutoka kulia kwenda kushoto huku data mpya ikiwa kulia. Ukisawazishwa kuwa ltr, grafi inaonyeshwa kutoka kushoto kwenda kulia huku data mpya ikiwa kushoto. [Default ni rtl]"

msgid "This setting determines whether or not the router should use the provided <i>blocklist.txt</i> file and any user configured blocklists to enable banning of routers by hash or ip address. Ranges and net masks are supported for IPv4 but not IPv6. See the <i>blocklist.txt</i> in your I2P+ application directory for more info. [Enabled by default, restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua kama routeri inapaswa kutumia faili ya <i>blocklist.txt</i> iliyotolewa na orodha nyeusi zozote zilizosanidiwa na mtumiaji ili kuwasha banzi ya routeri kwa hash au anwani ya IP. Masafa na vichiko vya neti vinatumiwa kwa IPv4 lakini si IPv6. Angalia <i>blocklist.txt</i> kwenye katalogi yako ya programu ya I2P+ kwa taarifa zaidi. [Imewashwa kwa default, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting permits an expiry time to be configured (in seconds) for bans enforced via blocklists. By default bans persist for the duration of the router session. [Restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii huruhusu muda wa kumalika kusaniwiwa (kwa sekunde) kwa banzi zinazotumika kwa orodha nyeusi. Kwa default banzi zinadumu kwa muda wa kipindi cha routeri. [Uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting, when configured with a path pointing at a valid blocklist file, enables an additional, user-configured blocklist to be loaded at router startup. [Disabled by default, restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, ikiwa imesanidiwa kwa njia inayopeleka kwenye faili halali ya orodha nyeusi, inawasha orodha nyeusi ya ziada iliyosanidiwa na mtumiaji kupakiwa wakati mfumo unapowasha. [Imezimwa kwa default, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting determines whether or not the router should use the provided <i>blocklist_tor.txt</i> file in your I2P+ application directory to enable banning of routers operating from Tor exit node ip addresses. [Enabled by default, restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua kama routeri inapaswa kutumia faili ya <i>blocklist_tor.txt</i> iliyotolewa kwenye katalogi yako ya programu ya I2P+ ili kuwasha banzi ya routeri zinazofanya kazi kutoka kwa anwani za IP za nodi za kutoka za Tor. [Imewashwa kwa default, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting enables requests from routers in the specified countries to be blocked and banned as soon as a direct tunnel request is made. Countries must be specified as two letter country codes, separated with commas. e.g. router.blockCountries=cn,ru"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inawasha maombi kutoka kwa routeri katika nchi zilizotolewa kuzuiwa na kuzibanzwa mara tu ombi la tuneli moja kwa moja limefanywa. Nchi lazima zitolewe kama msimbo za nchi za herufe mbili, zikizitwa kwa koma. k.v. router.blockCountries=cn,ru"

msgid "The maximum number of session banlog archive files to keep. When exceeded, older archives are deleted. [Default is 5]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya faili za kumbukumbu za banzi za kipindi hiki. Ikizidiwa, kumbukumbu za zamani zinafutwa. [Default ni 5]"

msgid "This setting, when set to true, will block direct communication from all X tier routers that publish a G congestion cap and are neither reachable or unreachable, adding them to the session banlist. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, ukisawazishwa kuwa true, itazuia mawasiliano ya moja kwa moja kutoka kwa routeri zote za ngazi X zinazochapisha kikomo cha msongamano G na ambazo hazipatikani wala kutoshaipatikana, na kuziongeza kwenye orodha ya banzi za kipindi hiki. [Default ni false]"

msgid "This setting, when set to true, will block direct communication from all LU tier routers (low bandwidth, unreachable, or firewalled), adding them to the session banlist. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, ukisawazishwa kuwa true, itazuia mawasiliano ya moja kwa moja kutoka kwa routeri zote za ngazi LU (kasi ndogo, hazipatikani, au zilizofungiwa kwa firewall), na kuziongeza kwenye orodha ya banzi za kipindi hiki. [Default ni true]"

msgid "The frequency in milliseconds to scan for suspicious hash patterns (potential Sybil attacks). Set to 0 to disable. [Default is 3600000]"
msgstr "Mara kwa kila milisekunde ya kuchunguza mifumo ya hash ya wasiliani (mashambulizi ya Sybil yanayowezekana). Weka kuwa 0 ili kuzima. [Default ni 3600000]"

msgid "When set to false, the router will not block tunnel build requests from slower or unreachable routers running older versions. [Default is true, restart required]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, routeri haitaizuia maombi ya kujenga tuneli kutoka kwa routeri polepole au hazipatikani zinazoendesha toleo la zamani. [Default ni true, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "Allocate number of processor threads for building tunnels. If your processor supports hyperthreading or simultaneous multithreading, you may multiply the number of processor cores by 2 to get the maximum number of threads to allocate, otherwise number of processor cores = maximum number of threads available. Note that you may wish to allocate less than the theoretical maximum to ensure you have headroom for other tasks."
msgstr "Gawanya idadi ya nyuzi za kiprocessor kwa kujenga tuneli. Kama kiprocessor chako kinasaidia hyperthreading au multithreading ya wakati mmoja, unaweza kuzidisha idadi ya viakili vya kiprocessor kwa 2 ili kupata idadi kubwa zaidi ya nyuzi za kugawanywa, vinginevyo idadi ya viakili vya kiprocessor = idadi kubwa zaidi ya nyuzi zinapatikana. Kumbuka kwamba unaweza kupewa chini ya kiakili cha kiprocessor kuhakikisha una nafasi ya kutosha kwa kazi nyingine."

msgid "This setting (in milliseconds) determines how long a packet may stay in the CoDel queue before it is dropped. Default is 1000ms. [Restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii (kwa milisekunde) inaamua muda gani pakiti inaweza kukaa kwenye foleni ya CoDel kabla ya kuangushwa. Default ni 1000ms. [Uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting determines the maximum number of messages in the outbound queue before it is marked as full. [Default is 768]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua idadi kubwa zaidi ya ujumbe kwenye foleni ya kutoka kabla ya kuwekwa alama kuwa imejaa. [Default ni 768]"

msgid "This setting determines the maximum number of messages above the maximum queue value before further messages are dropped. [Default is 128]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua idadi kubwa zaidi ya ujumbe juu ya thamani kubwa zaidi ya foleni kabla ya ujumbe zaidi kuwaangushwa. [Default ni 128]"

msgid "This setting (in milliseconds) allows you to manually configure the queue delay target value for the CoDel queue management system. Default is 50ms. [Restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii (kwa milisekunde) inakuwezesha kusanidia kwa mkono thamani ya lengo la muda wa kusubiri kwa mfumo wa kusimamia foleni ya CoDel. Default ni 50ms. [Uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting, in milliseconds, overrides the default message processing time limit (indicated as <i>Message Delay</i> in the Congestion sidebar section) before the router is determined to be congested and transit tunnel requests are rejected. [Default is 750ms or 1500ms if the router is flagged as slow]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, kwa milisekunde, inachiba na kikomo cha default cha muda wa kusindika ujumbe (kinachodhibitishwa kama <i>Ucheleweshaji wa Ujumbe</i> katika sehemu ya msongamano ya sidebar) kabla ya routeri kuinishwa kuwa ina msongamano na maombi ya tuneli za transit zakatazwa. [Default ni 750ms au 1500ms ikiwa routeri imeainishwa kuwa polepole]"

msgid "Periodically test tunnels to determine the average lag, and display the results in the Congestion sidepanel section. To enable, set this value to false. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Jaribu tuneli kwa vipindi ili kubainisha ucheleweshaji wa wastani, na uonyeshe matokeo katika sehemu ya paneli ya kando ya msongamano. Ili kuwasha, weka thamani hii kuwa false. [Default ni false]"

msgid "When set to true, the router will change its identity and UDP port every time the router restarts. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, routeri itabadilisha utambulisho wake na bandari yake ya UDP kila wakati routeri inapanzishwa upya. [Default ni false]"

msgid "When set to false, the router will not throttle tunnel build requests from other routers, and should be used with caution. [Default is true, restart required]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, routeri haitatadhibi maombi ya kujenga tuneli kutoka kwa routeri nyingine, na inapaswa kutumika kwa uangalifu. [Default ni true, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting determines which <a href=/profiles#profile_defs>peer capabilities</a> will not be used to build your router's tunnels. e.g. <code>router.excludePeerCaps=LMN</code>"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua ni sifa zipi za <a href=/profiles#profile_defs>peer</a> hazitatumika kwa kujenga tuneli za routeri yako. k.v. <code>router.excludePeerCaps=LMN</code>"

msgid "When set to false, unreachable peers may be selected as hops for inbound exploratory tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer hazipatikani zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za uchunguzi za kuingia. [Default ni true]"

msgid "When set to false, unreachable peers may be selected as hops for outbound exploratory tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer hazipatikani zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za uchunguzi za kutoka. [Default ni true]"

msgid "When set to false, unreachable peers may be selected as hops for inbound client tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer hazipatikani zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za mteja za kuingia. [Default ni true]"

msgid "When set to false, unreachable peers may be selected as hops for outbound client tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer hazipatikani zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za mteja za kutoka. [Default ni true]"

msgid "When set to false, slow peers (high tunnel test times) may be selected as hops for inbound exploratory tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer polepole (muda wa jaribio la tuneli mkubwa) zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za uchunguzi za kuingia. [Default ni true]"

msgid "When set to false, slow peers may be selected as hops for outbound exploratory tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer polepole zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za uchunguzi za kutoka. [Default ni true]"

msgid "When set to false, slow peers may be selected as hops for inbound client tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer polepole zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za mteja za kuingia. [Default ni true]"

msgid "When set to false, slow peers may be selected as hops for outbound client tunnels. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa false, peer polepole zinaweza kuchaguliwa kama hop za tuneli za mteja za kutoka. [Default ni true]"

msgid "This setting (in hours) determines how old a RouterInfo in the NetDb is (its last known publication date) before it's classified as stale and deleted. [Default is 28 hours unless the router is a Floodfill, in which case the default is 8 hours]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii (kwa saa) inaamua RouterInfo ya umri gani kwenye NetDb (tarehe yake ya mwisho ya kuchapishwa) kabla ya kuainishwa kuwa ya zamani na kufutwa. [Default ni saa 28 isipokuwa routeri ni Floodfill, katika hali hiyo default ni saa 8]"

msgid "This setting determines the number of peers to explore in parallel when the Peer Exploration Job runs [default is 1 peer at a time when more than 3000 peers are known]. Note that increasing this value will increase the bandwidth requirements for the exploration, and setting this value too high may cause excessive message delay and interfere with other services, so use with caution!"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua idadi ya peer za kuchunguzi kwa pamoja kipindi kazi ya Uchunguzi wa Peer inapokwenda [default ni peer 1 kwa wakati mmoja zaidi ya peer 3000 zinazozikwa]. Kumbuka kwamba kuongeza thamani hii itaongeza mahitaji ya kasi kwa uchunguzi, na kuweka thamani hii juu sana inaweza kusababisha ucheleweshaji mkubwa wa ujumbe na kuingatia huduma nyingine, kwa hivyo tumia kwa uangalifu!"

msgid "This setting determines the number of NetDb DHT buckets the Peer Exploration Job will reference when run. By default, the number of buckets to explore will vary depending on whether the router has been running for over an hour, if the router is hidden or in the 'K' bandwidth tier, and the number of known routers."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua idadi ya bucket za DHT za NetDb ambazo Kazi ya Uchunguzi wa Peer itarejelea inapokwenda. Kwa default, idadi ya bucket za kuchunguzia hutatofautika kulingana na kama routeri imeendesha kwa zaidi ya saa moja, ikiwa routeri ni ya siri au katika ngazi ya kasi 'K', na idadi ya routeri zinazozikwa."

msgid "This setting (in seconds) allows you to override the delay between runs of the Peer Exploration Job which attempts to locate new peers to add to the NetDb. The job will run every 80 seconds by default, or if the router is experiencing job or message lag, every 3 minutes. If the size of the NetDb reaches 4000 peers, the pause will increase to 15 minutes. You may wish to increase the delay if your NetDb is well-populated (over 2000 peers), or if you wish to reduce overall bandwidth usage. Note: For Floodfill routers, this job does not run."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii (kwa sekunde) inakuwezesha kuvuka muda wa kusubiri kati ya mipangilio ya Kazi ya Uchunguzi wa Peer inayotafuta peer mpya za kuongeza kwenye NetDb. Kazi hitaendesha kila sekunde 80 kwa default, au ikiwa routeri inaona ucheleweshaji wa kazi au ujumbe, kila dakika 3. Ikiwa ukubwa wa NetDb ufikia peer 4000, kusubiri kutaongezeka hadi dakika 15. Unaweza kwa kubeba kuongeza muda wa kusubiri ikiwa NetDb yako imejaa peer (zaidi ya peer 2000), au ikiwa ungependa kupunguza matumizi ya kasi jumla. Kumbuka: Kwa routeri za Floodfill, kazi hii haifanyiki."

msgid "This setting determines the maximum number of peer hashes to queue for exploration. In I2P the maximum is 128, and in I2P+ the default value is 512."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua idadi kubwa zaidi ya hash za peer za kuewekwa foleni kwa uchunguzi. Katika I2P kubwa zaidi ni 128, na katika I2P+ thamani ya default ni 512."

msgid "This setting determines whether a router acting as a floodfill will explore the NetDb to learn about new peers. [Default is false, restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua kama routeri inayofanya kazi kama floodfill itachunguza NetDb ili kujifunza kuhusu peer mpya. [Default ni false, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting, when set to true, prevents a router from directly communicating with other routers, forcing the use of introducers. [Default is false unlesss router is in hidden mode]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii, ukisawazishwa kuwa true, inazuia routeri kuzungusha moja kwa moja na routeri nyingine, ikifanya matumizi ya watumabulishaji. [Default ni false isipokuwa routeri iko katika hali ya siri]"

msgid "When set to true, if your router is serving as a floodfill for the network, your <a href=/configadvanced#ffconf>floodfill participation</a> will be hidden from other routers."
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, ikiwa routeri yako inahudumia kama floodfill kwa mtandao, <a href=/configadvanced#ffconf>ushiriki wako wa floodfill</a> utafichwa kutoka kwa routeri nyingine."

msgid "Defines the maximum number of parallel <a href=/jobs>jobs</a> that can be run. The default value is determined by the amount of memory allocated to the JVM via <code>wrapper.config</code>, and is set at 3 for less than 64MB, 4 for less than 256M, or 5 for more than 256MB. Note: A change to this setting requires a restart of the router."
msgstr "Inaamua idadi kubwa zaidi ya <a href=/jobs>kazi</a> za pamoja zinazoweza kuendeshwa. Thamani ya default inatokana na kiwango cha kumbukumbu kilichotengwa kwa JVM kupitia <code>wrapper.config</code>, na inaweka 3 kwa chini ya 64MB, 4 kwa chini ya 256M, au 5 kwa zaidi ya 256MB. Kumbuka: Mabadiliko ya mipangilio hii yanahitaji uanzishaji upya wa routeri."

msgid "Defines the minimum number of parallel <a href=/jobs>job runners</a>. The router will not scale down below this number. Default is 4, minimum is 1. This setting is dynamic and takes effect without restart."
msgstr "Inaamua idadi ya chini ya <a href=/jobs>waendeshi wa kazi</a> za pamoja. Routeri haitasawazishwa chini ya idadi hii. Default ni 4, chini ni 1. Mipangilio hii ni ya gua na huanza kutumika bila uanzishaji upya."

msgid "Enable dynamic scaling of job runners based on queue load. When enabled, the router automatically scales the number of job runner threads up or down based on ready job count and lag. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Washa kusawazisha kwa gua kwa waendeshi wa kazi kulingana na mzigo wa foleni. Ukishwa, routeri husawazisha kiotomatiki idadi ya nyuzi za waendeshi wa kazi juu au chini kulingana na idadi ya kazi tayari na ucheleweshaji. [Default ni true]"

msgid "The job queue lag threshold in milliseconds that triggers scaling up job runners. When max lag exceeds this value, additional runners are started. [Default is 1]"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha ucheleweshaji wa foleni ya kazi kwa milisekunde kinachosababisha kusawazishwa kwa juu kwa waendeshi wa kazi. Ucheleweshaji mkubwa unapozidi thamani hii, waendeshi zaidi huanzishwa. [Default ni 1]"

msgid "The job queue lag threshold in milliseconds that allows scaling down job runners. When max lag stays below this value, excess runners are stopped. [Default is 1]"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha ucheleweshaji wa foleni ya kazi kwa milisekunde kinachoruhusu kusawazishwa chini kwa waendeshi wa kazi. Ucheleweshaji mkubwa unapobaki chini ya thamani hii, waendeshi wa ziada husitishwa. [Default ni 1]"

msgid "The ratio of ready jobs to active runners that triggers scaling up. If readyJobs > activeRunners * ratio, additional runners are started. [Default is 1.2]"
msgstr "Uwiano wa kazi tayari kwa waendeshi zinavyofanya kazi unaosababisha kusawazishwa kwa juu. Ikiwa readyJobs > activeRunners * ratio, waendeshi zaidi huanzishwa. [Default ni 1.2]"

msgid "The interval in milliseconds between job runner scaling checks. [Default is 1000]"
msgstr "Kipindi kwa milisekunde kati ya ukaguzi wa kusawazisha wa waendeshi wa kazi. [Default ni 1000]"

msgid "The cooldown period in milliseconds between scale operations. [Default is 5000]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha kusubiri kwa milisekunde kati ya shughuli za kusawazisha. [Default ni 5000]"

msgid "Enable the feedback mechanism that automatically rolls back ineffective scale-up operations. If lag increases after adding runners, they will be removed. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Washa utaratibu wa maelezo unaorudisha nyuma kwa moja kwa moja shughuli za kusawazishwa kwa juu zisizo na faida. Ikiwa ucheleweshaji unaongezeka baada ya kuongeza waendeshi, wataondolewa. [Default ni true]"

msgid "The maximum number of waiting jobs in the queue before aggressive job dropping is triggered. When exceeded, non-critical jobs are dropped to reduce queue pressure. [Default is 48]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya kazi zinazosubiri kwenye foleni kabla ya kuangushwa kwa nguvu kazi kusababishwe. Ikizidiwa, kazi zisizo muhimu zinaangushwa ili kupunguza shinikizo la foleni. [Default ni 48]"

msgid "Maximum number of pending tunnel build jobs in the BuildHandler queue. When the queue exceeds this limit, new build requests are rejected to prevent job queue overload. [Default is 256]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya kazi za kujenga tuneli zinazosubiri kwenye foleni ya BuildHandler. Foleni ikizidi kikomo hiki, maombi mapya ya ujenzi zatapiliwa mbali ili kuzuia mzigo wa foleni ya kazi. [Default ni 256]"

msgid "Multiplier applied to the base tunnel build concurrency. The effective concurrency is baseBuildRate * multiplier, clamped by maxConcurrentBuilds. Higher values accelerate pool recovery but increase network load. [Default is 1.0]"
msgstr "Kiziozi kinachotumika kwenye ushirikishaji wa msingi wa kujenga tuneli. Ushirikishaji halisi ni baseBuildRate * multiplier, ukikomeshwa na maxConcurrentBuilds. Thamani kubwa huenda haraka za kuponya kundi lakini huongeza mzigo wa mtandao. [Default ni 1.0]"

msgid "Determines the maximum number of participating tunnels the router can build. To disable participation completely, set to 0. [Default is 8000, or 2000 if running on Arm or Android]"
msgstr "Inaamua idadi kubwa zaidi ya tuneli zinazoushiri routeri inaweza kujenga. Ili kuzima ushiriki kwa ukamili, weka kuwa 0. [Default ni 8000, au 2000 ikiwa inaendesha kwenye Arm au Android]"

msgid "Defines the maximum percentage of active local tunnels (client and exploratory) that a peer will be used for. [Default is 10% in I2P+, 33% in I2P]"
msgstr "Inaamua asilimia kubwa zaidi ya tuneli za ndani zinavyofanya kazi (za mteja na za uchunguzi) ambayo peer moja itatumika. [Default ni 10% katika I2P+, 33% katika I2P]"

msgid "This setting allows you to configure the minimum number of hosted participating tunnels before the router starts to reject tunnel requests based on anticipated bandwidth requirements. [Default is 100 if system is running Android, 800 if system is running on ARM and less than 4 cores available, 1200 if system is running on ARM and 4 or more cores available, otherwise 2500]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inakuwezesha kusanidia idadi ya chini ya tuneli zinazohostiwa zinazoushiri kabla ya routeri kuanza kutupilia mbali maombi ya tuneli kulingana na mahitaji ya kasi yaliyotarajiwa. [Default ni 100 ikiwa mfumo unakendesha Android, 800 ikiwa mfumo unakendesha kwenye ARM na viakili vicho vya 4 au kidogo vinapatikana, 1200 ikiwa mfumo unakendesha kwenye ARM na viakili 4 au zaidi vinapatikana, vinginevyo 2500]"

msgid "This setting allows you to exclude older routers from your NetDb. Routers older than the default or the value you set will be deleted from the NetDb and banned for the duration of the router session. By default, routers older than 0.9.20 are excluded. Note: starting with I2P+ version 0.9.46+, only routers running very recent versions are used for building local tunnels. [Restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inakuwezesha kutoa routeri za zamani kwenye NetDb yako. Routeri za zamani zaidi ya default au thamani uliyoweka zitafutwa kwenye NetDb na kuzibanzwa kwa muda wa kipindi cha routeri. Kwa default, routeri za zamani zaidi ya 0.9.20 hazihusishwi. Kumbuka: kuanzia na toleo la I2P+ 0.9.46+, ni routeri tu zinazoendesha toleo la hivi karibuni sana zinazotumika kwa kujenga tuneli za ndani. [Uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "When set to true, the router info files stored in your profile's netDB directory will not be split into 64 sub-directories. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, faili za taarifa za routeri zilizohifadhiwa kwenye katalogi yako ya netDB hazitagawanywa katika katalogi ndogo 64. [Default ni false]"

msgid "When set to true, your router will not be classified as slow, regardless of the specifications of your host system. Ordinarily, routers running on hosts with the following characteristics will be classified as slow, and various performance-related router options will be modified accordingly:"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, routeri yako haitaainishwa kuwa polepole, bila kujali sifa za mfumo wako wa mashine. Kwa kawaida, routeri zinazoendesha kwenye mashine zenye sifa zifuatazo zitaainishwa kuwa polepole, na vichaguo mbalimbali vya routeri vinavyohusiana na utendaji vitabadilishwa kwa kulingana na hivyo:"

msgid "Host OS running Android"
msgstr "Mfumo wa Mashine Unakendesha Android"

msgid "Host OS running on ARM (MacOS excepted)"
msgstr "Mfumo wa Mashine Unakendesha ARM (MacOS pekee)"

msgid "32bit host OS running with less than 4 detected cores"
msgstr "Mfumo wa Mashine wa biti 32 unaendesha kwa viakili vicho vya 4 au kidogo vilivyogunduliwa"

msgid "64bit host OS running with 1 detected core and less than 384MB allocated to the JVM"
msgstr "Mfumo wa Mashine wa biti 64 unaendesha kwa kiakili kimoja kilichogunduliwa na chini ya 384MB zilizotengwa kwa JVM"

msgid "Less than 256MB allocated to the JVM"
msgstr "Chini ya 256MB zilizotengwa kwa JVM"

msgid "Router running a non-native, software emulated version of the Java BigInteger library"
msgstr "Routeri inayoendesha toleo la asili la maktaba ya Java BigInteger lililosimuliwa kwa programu"

msgid "This setting determines the number of peer tests to run concurrently, used to determine peer latency. When tunnel build success drops below 50%, concurrency is halved to avoid adding load during a failure cascade. [Default varies: 1 on slow systems, 2 on single/dual-core, 4 otherwise]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua idadi ya jaribio la peer linaloendesha kwa pamoja, linalotumika kubainisha latensi ya peer. Ujenzi wa tuneli unapofanikika chini ya 50%, ushirikishaji hupunguzwa nusu ili kuepuka kuongeza mzigo wakati wa kushindwa kwa kujumilia. [Default hutofautika: 1 kwenye mfumo polepole, 2 kwenye kiakili kimoja/kiwili, 4 vinginevyo]"

msgid "This setting determines the delay between peer test jobs, configured in milliseconds. [Default is 30000 (30s), or 45000 (45s) on slow systems]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua muda wa kusubiri kati ya kazi za jaribio la peer, uliosanidiwa kwa milisekunde. [Default ni 30000 (30s), au 45000 (45s) kwenye mfumo polepole]"

msgid "To determine peer latency, this setting allocates the maximum time a peer test should take before being considered a failure, configured in milliseconds. In the event that the timeout is configured lower than the average successful test, the average successful test value will be used. [Default is 5000]"
msgstr "Ili kubainisha latensi ya peer, mipangilio hii inagawa muda mkubwa zaidi ambao jaribio la peer linapaswa kuchukua kabla ya kuhesabiwa kuwa limefaili, uliosanidiwa kwa milisekunde. Ikiwa muda wa kusubiri umesanidiwa chini ya wastani wa jaribio lililofanikiwa, thamani ya wastani wa jaribio lililofanikiwa itatumiwa. [Default ni 5000]"

msgid "Minimum number of peers to retain in the fast tier during profile reorganization. A higher value ensures more peers are available for tunnel building, at the cost of potentially including slower peers. If more than 3000 routers are known, the default scales to <code>knownRouters / 15</code>. [Default is 400]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya peer za kuhifadhiwa katika tabaka la haraka wakati wa upanguzi upya wa wasifu. Thamani kubwa inahakikisha kuwa peer zaidi zinapatikana kwa kujenga tuneli, kwa gharama ya kujumuisha peer polepole. Ikiwa kuna routeri zaidi ya 3000 zinazozikwa, default inasawazishwa kuwa <code>knownRouters / 15</code>. [Default ni 400]"

msgid "Minimum number of peers to retain in the high-capacity tier. These are the peers with the highest measured throughput and greatest ability to relay traffic. If more than 3000 routers are known, the default scales to <code>knownRouters / 15</code>. [Default is 500]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya peer za kuhifadhiwa katika tabaka la uwezo mkubwa. Hizi ni peer zenye kasi ya juu zaidi iliyopimwa na uwezo mkubwa zaidi wa kuelekeza trafiki. Ikiwa kuna routeri zaidi ya 3000 zinazozikwa, default inasawazishwa kuwa <code>knownRouters / 15</code>. [Default ni 500]"

msgid "Maximum number of peer profiles to retain in memory. Older, inactive profiles are expired first when this limit is reached. Values below 100 are clamped to 100. [Default is 8000, or 800 on slow systems]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya wasifu wa peer wa kuhifadhiwa kumbukumbu. Wasifu wa zamani, wasio wa matumizi, viondolewa kwanza ukifika kikomo hiki. Thamani zilizo chini ya 100 zinakomeshwa kuwa 100. [Default ni 8000, au 800 kwenye mfumo polepole]"

msgid "Maximum age of a RouterInfo (in hours) for a peer to be considered selectable for tunnel building. Peers with RouterInfos older than this threshold are excluded from selection unless they have an active connection. This is particularly relevant for floodfill routers that do not actively explore the NetDB, as their RouterInfos may become stale without periodic refresh. [Default is 3]"
msgstr "Umri mkubwa zaidi wa RouterInfo (kwa saa) ili peer ionzekane kuwa inaweza kuchaguliwa kwa kujenga tuneli. Peer zenye RouterInfo za zamani zaidi ya kizingiti hiki hutenguliwa na uteuzi isipokuwa zina muunganisho unaofanya kazi. Hii ni muhimu hasa kwa routeri za floodfill ambazo hazichunguzi NetDB kwa shughuli, kwani RouterInfo zao zinaweza kuwa za zamani bila onyesho upya la kipindi. [Default ni 3]"

msgid "This setting determines whether stats about our router are sporadically published to the NetDb. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua kama takwimu kuhusu routeri yetu zinachapishwa kwa mara kwa mara kwenye NetDb. [Default ni false]"

msgid "This setting configures the initial size of the outbound message queue. [Default is 64]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inasanidia ukubwa wa awali wa foleni ya ujumbe wa kutoka. [Default ni 64]"

msgid "This setting configures the maximum number of inbound messages queued per cycle (pump). [Default is 24]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inasanidia idadi kubwa zaidi ya ujumbe wa kuingia unaowekwa foleni kwa kila mzunguko (pump). [Default ni 24]"

msgid "This setting configures the maximum size of the inbound message queue. [Default is 1024]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inasanidia ukubwa mkubwa zaidi wa foleni ya ujumbe wa kuingia. [Default ni 1024]"

msgid "This setting configures the maximum number of outbound messages queued per cycle (pump). [Default is 64]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inasanidia idadi kubwa zaidi ya ujumbe wa kutoka unaowekwa foleni kwa kila mzunguko (pump). [Default ni 64]"

msgid "When set to true, the router will change its identity and UDP port when the router restarts and then delete the key from router.config to prevent further changes. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, routeri itabadilisha utambulisho wake na bandari yake ya UDP inaporouteri inapanzishwa upya kisha kufuta ufafanuzi kutoka router.config ili kuzuia mabadiliko zaidi. [Default ni false]"

msgid "This setting (in milliseconds) allows you to manually configure the delay between router refresh updates run by the Refresh Routers Job. By default the pause between refreshes is determined by the size of the NetDb, and introduces some randomness in the timing to mitigate traffic analysis. For values lower than 2000 milliseconds, increasing the value of <code>router.refreshTimeout</code> is recommended. Note that setting this value below 2000 milliseconds will increase your network traffic and may introduce job lag, and is not recommended for sustained use."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii (kwa milisekunde) inakuwezesha kusanidia kwa mkono muda wa kusubiri kati ya onyesho upya za routeri zinazofanywa na Kazi ya Kuonyesha Upya Routeri. Kwa default, kusubiri kati ya onyesho upya hunkutokana na ukubwa wa NetDb, na kuleta nasibu fuluri katika muda ili kupunguza uchambuzi wa trafiki. Kwa thamani zilizo chini ya milisekunde 2000, inavyopendekezwa kuongeza thamani ya <code>router.refreshTimeout</code>. Kumbuka kwamba kuweka thamani hii chini ya milisekunde 2000 kutaongeza trafiki yako ya mtandao na kunaweza kuleta ucheleweshaji wa kazi, na hakupendekezwi kwa matumizi ya muda mrefu."

msgid "This setting (in hours) allows you to manually configure how old a RouterInfo is in order for it to be checked by the Refresh Routers Job. By default, the age of a RouterInfo before a refresh is intitiated scales according to the size of the NetDb, increasing as the NetDb grows in size. A value of 0 will force the Router Refresh Job to check every router in the NetDb, regardless of age."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii (kwa saa) inakuwezesha kusanidia kwa mkono umri gani wa RouterInfo ili kukaguliwa na Kazi ya Kuonyesha Upya Routeri. Kwa default, umri wa RouterInfo kabla ya onyesho upya kuanzishwa unalingana na ukubwa wa NetDb, ukiongeka NetDb inapopanda. Thamani ya 0 italazimisha Kazi ya Onyesho Upya ya Routeri ikague kila routeri kwenye NetDb, bila kujali umri."

msgid "This setting (in seconds) allows you to manually configure the amount of time to wait before an attempt to refresh a router is determined to have failed. [The default is 20 seconds]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii (kwa sekunde) inakuwezesha kusanidia kwa mkono muda wa kusubiri kabla ya jaribio la kuonyesha upya routeri kubahitishwa kuwa umeshindwa. [Default ni sekunde 20]"

msgid "This setting determines whether routers classified as uninteresting (K or L tier, unreachable or older than 0.9.50) are checked during the refresh router process after 1 hour of uptime. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaamua kama routeri zilizowainishwa kuwa hazina mvuto (ngazi K au L, hazipatikani au za zamani zaidi ya 0.9.50) hukaguliwa wakati wa mchakato wa kuonyesha upya routeri baada ya saa 1 wa muda wa kuendeshwa. [Default ni false]"

msgid "When set to true, this setting will relax the conditions required for your router to publish congestion caps, specifically when it's determined that your bandwidth usage is high. Other conditions, such as high job lag or a router classified as slow, will still cause caps to be published. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, mipangilio hii italegeza masharti yanayohitajika ili routeri yako ichapishe vikomo vya msongamano, hasa pale inapoamua kuwa matumizi yako ya kasi ni makubwa. Masharti mengine, kama ucheleweshaji mkubwa wa kazi au routeri iliyowainishwa kuwa polepole, bado yatasababisha vikomo vya msongamano vychapishwe. [Default ni false]"

msgid "The period in milliseconds to check for idle tunnels. Tunnels with no traffic for this period may be dropped. [Default is 60000]"
msgstr "Kipindi kwa milisekunde cha kuangalia tuneli zisizo zinavyotumika. Tuneli zenye trafiki bila ya mzunguko huu zinaweza kuangushwa. [Default ni 60000]"

msgid "The minimum number of messages a tunnel must have processed in the detection period to be considered active. Tunnels below this threshold are candidates for removal. [Default is 3]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya ujumbe ambayo tuneli lazima iusindie katika kipindi cha utambuzi ili kuhesabiwa kuwa inavyofanya kazi. Tuneli zilizo chini ya kizingiti hiki zinawezekana kufutwa. [Default ni 3]"

msgid "The interval in milliseconds between scans for idle transit tunnels. [Default is 180000]"
msgstr "Kipindi kwa milisekunde kati ya mchunguzi wa tuneli za transit zisizo zinavyotumika. [Default ni 180000]"

msgid "If you wish to install unsigned (.zip) I2P updates, this should be added to your <code>router.config</code> file unless you have already configured <code>routerconsole.advanced=true</code>, in which case this option is already provisioned. Note: as of I2P+ 0.9.48+, installation of <a href=/configupdate#i2pupdates>unsigned updates</a> is enabled by default."
msgstr "Ukiwa unataka kusakinisha sasisho za I2P zisizosainiwa (.zip), hii inapaswa kuongezwa kwenye faili yako ya <code>router.config</code> isipokuwa umeweka <code>routerconsole.advanced=true</code> tayari, ambapo chaguo hiki tayari kimesanidiwa. Kumbuka: kuanzia I2P+ 0.9.48+, kusakinisha <a href=/configupdate#i2pupdates>sasisho zisizosainiwa</a> kumewashwa kwa default."

msgid "This setting allows you to configure the update url for the unsigned update feature, if enabled. The url should end with <code>/i2pupdate.zip</code>. Note: do not install unsigned updates unless you trust the source of the update!"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya hukuruhusu kusanidi url ya sasisho kwa ajili ya utendaji wa sasisho zisizosainiwa, ikiwa umewashwa. Url inapaswa kumalika na <code>/i2pupdate.zip</code>. Kumbuka: usakinishe sasisho zisizosainiwa isipokuwa unaamini chanzo cha sasisho!"

msgid "This setting (in minutes) allows you to manually configure how long to wait after startup before RouterInfos in the NetDb are checked for validity, after which point only valid routers will be accepted for inclusion. When the validation occurs, expired RouterInfos and unresponsive peers only accessible via SSU will be removed from the NetDb. [Default is 60 minutes] Note: This setting has no bearing on older routers (older than 0.9.29 by default) which are removed from the NetDb and banned for the router session as soon as a NetDb store is attempted."
msgstr "Mipangilio haya (kwa dakika) hukuruhusu kusanidiawa mwawe muda wa kusubiri baada ya kuanza kabla ya RouterInfos katika NetDb vikaguliwe kwa uadilifu, baada ya wakati huo routeri zilizo halali tu ndizo zitakazo kubaliwa kwa kuingia. Ukaguzi ukifanyika, RouterInfos zilizopitwa na wakati na peer zisizopashwa majibu ambazo zinapatikana tu kupitia SSU zitaondolewa katika NetDb. [Default ni dakika 60] Kumbuka: Mipangilio haya hayana athari kwa routeri za zamani (zazalishwa kabla ya 0.9.29 kwa default) ambazo huondolewa katika NetDb na kuzenzwa kwa muda wa kipindi cha routeri mara tu inaposhughulishwa NetDb."

msgid "When configured, this sets a hard limit for the number of tunnels the router is permitted to build concurrently. By default the router uses the average build time and current outbound bandwidth to determine the optimum build rate. This setting is dynamic and takes effect without restart."
msgstr "Ikiwa imesanidiwa, hii inaweka kikomo kikali cha idadi ya tuneli ambazo routeri inaruhusu kuzijenga kwa pamoja. Kwa default routeri inatumia muda wa wastani wa ujenzi na kasi ya sasa ya kutoka kubainiwa kiwango bora cha ujenzi. Mipangilio haya ni ya kudumu na hutumika bila kuanzishaji upya."

msgid "When set to true, the router uses the older peer selection algorithm when building tunnels (prefer fast peers directly, without the multi-tier HighCap → Fast → Active fallback chain). May be useful for troubleshooting peer selection issues. [Default is false. This setting is dynamic and takes effect immediately.]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, routeri inatumia algorithmu ya zamani ya uteuzi wa peer wakati wa kujenga tuneli (inapenda peer zenye haraka moja kwa moja, bila mnyororo wa tabaka nyingi HighCap → Fast → Active). Inaweza kuwa na manufaa kwa kutatua matatizo ya uteuzi wa peer. [Default ni false. Mipangilio haya ni ya kudumu na hutumika mara moja.]"

msgid "Growth factor used by the router's transit tunnel throttle. Higher values make the router accept tunnel build requests more aggressively relative to the 10-minute average. Lower values make it probabalistically reject sooner when tunnel counts are rising rapidly. [Default is 2.0]"
msgstr "Kizidishi cha kukuaji kinachotumika na kizuizi cha tuneli za transit cha routeri. Thamani kubwa zinafanya routeri ikubali maombi ya kujenga tuneli kwa ujaso zaidi ikilinganishwa na wastani wa dakika 10. Thamani ndogo zinafanya ikatae kwa nasibu mapema zaidi idadi ya tuneli ikibwa haraka. [Default ni 2.0]"

msgid "Growth factor for tunnel test time acceptance rate limiting. If the 1-minute average test time exceeds the 1-hour average multiplied by this factor, the router begins probabalistically rejecting. [Default is 1.5]"
msgstr "Kizidishi cha kukuaji kwa kizuizi cha kiwango cha ukubali wa muda wa jaribio la tuneli. Ikiwa wastani wa jaribio wa dakika 1 unazidi wastani wa saa 1 uliotengenezwa kwa kizidishi hiki, routeri inanza kukataa kwa nasibu. [Default ni 1.5]"

msgid "Controls the steepness of the rejection probability curve when bandwidth usage approaches capacity. Lower values give a smoother transition (less aggressive rejection at moderate load). [Default is 10]"
msgstr "Inadhibi ukali wa mstari wa uwezekano wa kukataa matumizi ya kasi inapelekea kwenye uwezo. Thamani ndogo zinatoa mabadiliko laini (ukatao usizo mkali wakati wa mzigo wa wastani). [Default ni 10]"

msgid "Penalty multiplier applied to a peer's capacity value when the peer publishes a 'D' congestion cap (moderate congestion). Higher values reduce the peer's effective capacity more aggressively. [Default is 2.5]"
msgstr "Kizidishi cha adhabu kinachotumika kwenye thamani ya uwezo wa peer pale peer inapochapisha kikomo cha msongamano 'D' (msongamano wa wastani). Thamani kubwa zinapunguza uwezo halisi wa peer kwa ujaso zaidi. [Default ni 2.5]"

msgid "Penalty multiplier applied to a peer's capacity value when the peer publishes an 'E' congestion cap (severe congestion). [Default is 4.75]"
msgstr "Kizidishi cha adhabu kinachotumika kwenye thamani ya uwezo wa peer pale peer inapochapisha kikomo cha msongamano 'E' (msongamano mkubwa). [Default ni 4.75]"

msgid "Time in milliseconds before expiration when pruned tunnels are marked for early expiry, giving replacement tunnels time to build. Higher values allow more overlap between old and new tunnels. [Default is 120000 (2 minutes)]"
msgstr "Muda kwa ms kabla ya kumalika ambapo tuneli zilizokatwa zinawekewa alama ya kumalika mapema, zikitoa muda kwa tuneli mbadala kujengwa. Thamani kubwa zinaruhusu mwingiliano zaidi kati ya tuneli za awali na mpya. [Default ni 120000 (2 dakika)]"

msgid "The latency threshold in milliseconds for removing slow tunnels from <a href=/tunnels>local tunnel pools</a>. Tunnels with latency above this threshold will be removed if the pool exceeds the minimum tunnel count. Set to 0 to use 1 second or the lowest recorded latency from all pools, whichever is higher. [Default is 0]"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha latensi kwa ms kwa kuondoa tuneli polepole kutoka kwenye <a href=/tunnels>makundi ya tuneli za ndini</a>. Tuneli zenye latensi juu ya kizingiti hiki zitaondolewa ikiwa kundi limezidi idadi ya chini ya tuneli. Weka kuwa 0 ili kutumia sekunde 1 au latensi ndogo zaidi iliyorekodiwa kutoka kwenye makundi yote, yaliyokuwa mkubwa zaidi. [Default ni 0]"

msgid "The minimum number of tunnels to keep in each pool when removing slow tunnels (minimum 2), overriding the configured tunnel quantity. Set to 0 to use the configured quantity per pool. [Default is 0]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya tuneli za kubaki katika kila kundi pale tuneli polepole zinapoondolewa (chini ya 2), ikichagua zaidi idadi ya tuneli iliyosanidiwa. Weka kuwa 0 ili kutumia idadi iliyosanidiwa kwa kila kundi. [Default ni 0]"

msgid "The interval in milliseconds between runs of the Remove Slow Tunnels job. Higher values reduce tunnel churn but may keep slow tunnels longer. [Default is 90000 (90s), or 120000 (120s) if under load]"
msgstr "Kipindi kwa ms kati ya mienezi ya kazi ya Ondoa Tuneli Polepole. Thamani kubwa zinapunguza kubadilika kwa haraka kwa tuneli lakini zinaweza kuzalisha tuneli polepole kwa muda mrefu zaidi. [Default ni 90000 (90s), au 120000 (120s) ikiwa kuna mzigo]"

msgid "The time in milliseconds before expiration to mark tunnels for early expiry when the Remove Slow Tunnels job prunes slow or excess tunnels. Higher values allow more time for new tunnels to build. [Default is 30000]"
msgstr "Muda kwa ms kabla ya kumalika wa kuweka alama kwenye tuneli za kumalika mapema kazi ya Ondoa Tuneli Polepole ikipunguza tuneli polepole au zinazowekana. Thamani kubwa zinaruhusu muda mrefu zaidi kwa tuneli mpya kujengwa. [Default ni 30000]"

msgid "Hard limit on total tunnel test jobs (queued + active). Prevents runaway test backlogs from causing job queue lag. Once reached, no new tests are scheduled until the count drops. [Default is 128 (96 on slower systems)]"
msgstr "Kikomo kikali kwa jumla ya kazi za jaribio la tuneli (zilizo kwenye foleni + zinazofanya kazi). Inazuia magengo ya jaribio yasiyodhibitiwa kusababisha ucheleweshaji wa foleni ya kazi. Ukifika kikomo hiki, hakuna jaribio jipya linalopangwa hadi idadi itashuka. [Default ni 128 (96 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Base adaptive queue limit for tunnel test jobs. The router scales this up/down by 2-3x based on job queue lag and failure rates. [Default is 48 (32 on slower systems)]"
msgstr "Kikomo cha msingi cha foleni za kazi za jaribio la tuneli. Routeri inapima hiki juu/chini kwa mara 2-3 kulingana na ucheleweshaji wa foleni ya kazi na viwango vya kushindwa. [Default ni 48 (32 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Maximum number of tunnel tests that can execute simultaneously. Caps concurrent test throughput to prevent overwhelming the router. [Default is 64 (32 on slower systems)]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya majaribio ya tuneli ambayo yanaweza kutekelezwa kwa pamoja. Inakomoza uwezo wa majaribio yanayofanywa kwa pamoja ili kuzuia kupendezwa kwa routeri. [Default ni 64 (32 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Maximum consecutive client tunnel build timeouts before forcing exploratory tunnels for build reply delivery. Higher values keep the router trying paired tunnels longer; lower values fall back to exploratory sooner. [Default is 3]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya muda wa kusubiri wa ujenzi wa tuneli za mteja unaoendelea kabla ya kulazimisha tuneli za uchunguzi kwa usambazaji wa majibu ya ujenzi. Thamani kubwa zinawafanya routeri ijaribu tuneli zilizopatanishwa kwa muda mrefu zaidi; thamani ndogo zinarejelea kwenye uchunguzi mapema zaidi. [Default ni 3]"

msgid "How long to wait for a tunnel build reply before trying a different pool or different peers. The BuildExecutor adaptively increases this when success rates are low. [Default is 5000 (5s), 10000 (10s) on slow systems]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri majibu ya kujenga tuneli kabla ya kujaribu kundi tofauti au peer tofauti. BuildExecutor inaongeza kwa kurekebisha wakati viwango vya mafanikio ni vya chini. [Default ni 5000 (5s), 10000 (10s) kwenye mifumo polepole]"

msgid "Timeout in milliseconds for the first-hop OutNetMessage before firing TunnelBuildFirstHopFailJob. Should be >= requestTimeout for proper sequencing. [Default is 10000 (10 seconds)]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri kwa ms kwa OutNetMessage ya hop ya kwanza kabla ya kuanzisha TunnelBuildFirstHopFailJob. Inapaswa kuwa >= requestTimeout kwa mpangilio sahihi. [Default ni 10000 (sekunde 10)]"

msgid "Timeout in milliseconds for RouterInfo lookup of the next hop during tunnel build processing. If the lookup times out, the build request is rejected. [Default is 8000 (8 seconds)]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri kwa ms kwa utafutaji wa RouterInfo wa hop inayofuata wakati wa kushughulishwa kujenga tuneli. Ikiwa utafutaji unashindwa, ombi la kujenga hukataliwa. [Default ni 8000 (sekunde 8)]"

msgid "Backoff delay in milliseconds between exploratory tunnel build retries. Higher values reduce build request rate during failures; lower values retry faster. [Default is 200]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri kwa ms kati ya majaribio ya kujenga tuneli za uchunguzi. Thamani kubwa zinapunguza kiwango cha maombi ya kujenga wakati wa kushindwa; thamani ndogo zinajaribu kwa haraka zaidi. [Default ni 200]"

msgid "Backoff delay in milliseconds between client tunnel build retries. Lower values rebuild failed client tunnels faster. [Default is 50]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri kwa ms kati ya majaribio ya kujenga tuneli za mteja. Thamani ndogo zinajenga upya tuneli za mteja zilizoshindwa kwa haraka zaidi. [Default ni 50]"

msgid "Grace period in milliseconds to accept late tunnel build replies after the router has given up waiting. Prevents wasting valid tunnel builds that arrive just after timeout. [Default is 60000 (60 seconds)]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha huruma kwa ms cha kukubali majibu ya kujenga tuneli yaliyokelewa baada ya routeri kujali kusubiri. Inazuia upotevu wa majenzi ya tuneli halali yanayokuja baada tu ya muda wa kusubiri. [Default ni 60000 (sekunde 60)]"

msgid "Minimum target tunnels per pool before triggering urgent rebuild logic. When the number of good tunnels drops below this threshold, the pool escalates to urgent rebuild mode. [Default is 2]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya tuneli lengwa kwa kila kundi kabla ya kuchochea mantiki ya kujenga upya kwa haraka. Ikiwa idadi ya tuneli nzuri ikishuka chini ya kizingiti hiki, kundi linaingia kwenye hali ya kujenga upya kwa haraka. [Default ni 2]"

msgid "Floor on concurrent next-hop RouterInfo lookups during tunnel build processing. Ensures a minimum level of lookup concurrency even when few tunnels are participating. [Default is 10 (4 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha chini kabisa cha utafutaji wa RouterInfo wa hop inayofuata unaofanywa kwa pamoja wakati wa kushughulishwa kujenga tuneli. Inahakikisha kiwango cha chini cha utafutaji unaofanywa kwa pamoja hata pale tuneli chache zinashiriki. [Default ni 10 (4 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Ceiling on concurrent next-hop RouterInfo lookups during tunnel build processing. Slots count distinct next hops, not individual requests: builds sharing a next hop reuse one search. Not cores-scaled; lookups are network-bound waits. [Default is 64 (32 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha juu kabisa cha utafutaji wa RouterInfo wa hop inayofuata unaofanywa kwa pamoja wakati wa kushughulishwa kujenga tuneli. Nafasi zinahesabiwa kulingana na hop tofauti, si maombi mmoja mmoja: majenzi yanayoshiriki hop inayofuata hutumia utafutaji mmoja. Hayatengenezwi kwa cores; utafutaji unasubiri mtandao. [Default ni 64 (32 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Percentage of current participating tunnels used to scale the concurrent lookup limit after startup. The effective limit is clamped between minLookupLimit and maxLookupLimit. [Default is 40 (15 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Asilimia ya tuneli zinazoshiriki za sasa inayotumika kukipima kikomo cha utafutaji unaofanywa kwa pamoja baada ya kuanza. Kikomo halisi kinafungwa kati ya minLookupLimit na maxLookupLimit. [Default ni 40 (15 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Depth of the queue holding tunnel builds whose next hop is being resolved while all lookup slots are busy. Sized so a full queue drains within the originator's build timeout; entries older than that budget are discarded as stale regardless of depth. [Default is 256]"
msgstr "Urefu wa foleni inayoshikilia majenzi ya tuneli ambayo hop yao inayofuata inatathuliwa wakati nafasi zote za utafutaji zikiwa zinafanya kazi. Inapangwa ili foleni kamili ikamilike ndani ya muda wa kusubiri wa ujenzi wa mtumaji wake; maingizo yaliyo ya zamani kuliko muda huo yanatupwa kama ya zamani bila kujali urefu wake. [Default ni 256]"

msgid "Maximum allowable future skew for tunnel build request timestamps. Requests with timestamps farther in the future than this are rejected as potential replay attacks. [Default is 300000 (5 minutes)]"
msgstr "Ukingo mkubwa zaidi wa ulegevu kwa muda wa baadaye wa muhuda wa wakati wa maombi ya kujenga tuneli. Maombi yenye muhuda wa wakati ulio mbele zaidi kuliko huu yanatiliwa kama mashambulizi ya uchezeaji tena. [Default ni 300000 (5 dakika)]"

msgid "Maximum age in milliseconds for tunnel build requests (ElGamal). Requests older than this are rejected as potential replay attacks. Must be >1 hour due to rounding in the protocol. [Default is 3900000 (65 minutes)]"
msgstr "Umri mkubwa zaidi kwa ms wa maombi ya kujenga tuneli (ElGamal). Maombi ya zamani kuliko huu yanatiliwa kama mashambulizi ya uchezeaji tena. Lazima iwe zaidi ya saa 1 kwa sababu ya kuzungusha katika mkataba. [Default ni 3900000 (65 dakika)]"

msgid "Maximum age in milliseconds for tunnel build requests (ECIES). ECIES timestamps are rounded to minutes so the tolerance is tighter. [Default is 480000 (8 minutes)]"
msgstr "Umri mkubwa zaidi kwa ms wa maombi ya kujenga tuneli (ECIES). Mihuda ya wakati ya ECIES huzungushwa kwa dakika hivyo uvumilivu ni mkali zaidi. [Default ni 480000 (8 dakika)]"

msgid "Job lag threshold in milliseconds that triggers tunnel build limiting. When router job lag exceeds this value, tunnel build requests are throttled to reduce queue pressure. [Default is 800 (500 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha ucheleweshaji wa kazi kwa ms kinachochochchea kizuizi cha kujenga tuneli. Ucheleweshaji wa kazi wa routeri unapozidi thamani hii, maombi ya kujenga tuneli yakinguzwa ili kupunguza shinikizo la foleni. [Default ni 800 (500 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Minimum delay in milliseconds before scheduling a tunnel test. The router will not test a tunnel that was recently tested within this window. [Default is 30000 (30 seconds)]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri wa chini kwa ms kabla ya kupanga jaribio la tuneli. Routeri haitajaribu tuneli iliyokuwa ikijaribiwa hivi karibuni ndani ya muda huu. [Default ni 30000 (sekunde 30)]"

msgid "Maximum delay in milliseconds before scheduling a tunnel test. The router will not defer a tunnel test beyond this limit. [Default is 90000 (90 seconds)]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri mkubwa zaidi kwa ms kabla ya kupanga jaribio la tuneli. Routeri haitaahili jaribio la tuneli zaidi ya kikomo hiki. [Default ni 90000 (sekunde 90)]"

msgid "Maximum concurrent tunnel test jobs per exploratory pool. Caps how many exploratory tunnels are tested simultaneously. [Default is 12]"
msgstr "Kikomo cha kazi za jaribio la tuneli zinazofanywa kwa pamoja kwa kila kundi cha uchunguzi. Inakomoza idadi ya tuneli za uchunguzi zinazopewa majibu kwa wakati mmoja. [Default ni 12]"

msgid "Maximum concurrent tunnel test jobs per client pool. Caps how many client tunnels are tested simultaneously. [Default is 24]"
msgstr "Kikomo cha kazi za jaribio la tuneli zinazofanywa kwa pamoja kwa kila kundi cha mteja. Inakomoza idadi ya tuneli za mteja zinazopewa majibu kwa wakati mmoja. [Default ni 24]"

msgid "Ratio of tunnels tested vs total pool size that triggers pool coverage heuristics. When fewer than this fraction of tunnels have recent test results, the pool prioritises testing over building. [Default is 0.95]"
msgstr "Ulinganisho wa tuneli zilizopewa majibu dhidi ya ukubwa wa jumla wa kundi linalochochchea mbinu za kukadiria kundi. Pale tuneli zilizo na hapa chini ya sehemu hiki hazina matokeo ya majaribio ya hivi karibuni, kundi linaipa kipaumbele cha kujaribia kuliko kujenga. [Default ni 0.95]"

msgid "Cooldown period in milliseconds for client peer selection. Peers selected for a client tunnel are excluded from selection in other client pools for this duration, ensuring peer diversity. [Default is 15000 (15 seconds)]"
msgstr "Mara ya kusubiri kwa ms ya uteuzi wa peer wa mteja. Peer zilizochaguliwa kwa tuneli ya mteja zinafanywa kuzvigwa katika uteuzi katika makundi mengine ya wateja kwa muda huu, kuhakikisha utofauti wa peer. [Default ni 15000 (sekunde 15)]"

msgid "Client peer selection strategy: 'default' (balanced, preferred), 'reliability' (prioritise proven peers with high tunnel acceptance ratio), or 'diversity' (lower cooldowns, explores broader peer set). Changes apply dynamically. [Default is 'default']"
msgstr "Mkakato wa uteuzi wa peer wa mteja: 'default' (wa kati, unayopendekezwa), 'reliability' (hapa kipaumbele peer zilizothibitishwa zenye kiwango kikubwa cha ukubali wa tuneli), au 'diversity' (mara ya kusubiri ndogo, hutafuta seti pana za peer). Mabadiliko yanatumika kwa kudumu. [Default ni 'default']"

msgid "Tunnel lifetime in milliseconds. Tunnels expire after this period and are replaced with fresh builds. Lower values increase churn but may improve freshness; higher values reduce build overhead but may accumulate stale tunnels. [Default is 600000 (10 minutes)]"
msgstr "Muda wa maisha ya tuneli kwa ms. Tuneli zinamalika baada ya muda huu na zinabadilishwa na majenzi mapya. Thamani ndogo zinaongeza kubadilika kwa haraka lakini zinaweza kuboresha upya; thamani kubwa zinapunguza mzigo wa ujenzi lakini zinaweza kukusanya tuneli za zamani. [Default ni 600000 (10 dakika)]"

msgid "Startup suppression period in milliseconds. Warnings and tunnel reduction logic are suppressed during initial router startup to avoid premature decisions. [Default is 300000 (5 minutes)]"
msgstr "Muda wa kunyamaza kuanzia kwa ms. Onyo na mantiki ya kupunguza tuneli hazitathmini wakati wa kuanza cha routeri ili kuepuka maamuzi ya mapema. [Default ni 300000 (5 dakika)]"

msgid "Minimum interval in milliseconds between LeaseSet publishes. Prevents rapid publish storms during tunnel churn. [Default is 120000 (2 minutes)]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha chini kwa ms kati ya machapisho ya LeaseSet. Inazuia dhoruba za haraka za uchapishaji wakati wa kubadilika kwa haraka kwa tuneli. [Default ni 120000 (2 dakika)]"

msgid "Minimum interval in milliseconds between LeaseSet object builds. Prevents unnecessary LeaseSet object churn on every tunnel add/remove. [Default is 120000 (2 minutes)]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha chini kwa ms kati ya majenzi ya vitu vya LeaseSet. Inazuia kubadilika bila kutarajiwa kwa vitu vya LeaseSet kila ongezeko/kuondolewa kwa tuneli. [Default ni 120000 (2 dakika)]"

msgid "Maximum lease duration in milliseconds for published LeaseSets. Lease end dates are capped to this value from now, so peers re-fetch sooner when set shorter than the tunnel lifetime. The gateway still processes messages for the full tunnel lifetime; only the cached LeaseSet on the requesting side expires earlier, triggering a re-fetch of the latest version. Default is auto-computed from i2p.netdb.republishInterval + 60 seconds (6 minutes with standard settings)."
msgstr "Muda mkubwa zaidi wa kudumu kwa ms kwa LeaseSets zilizochapishwa. Tarehe za mwisho za Lease zinafungwa kwa thamani hii kuanzia sasa, hivyo peer zinajipenga upya mapema zaidi pale thamani ikichukua muda mrefu kuliko wa muda wa tuneli. Lango bado linashughulisha ujumbe kwa muda wote wa muda wa tuneli; kile LeaseSet kilichohifadhiwa upande wa mwombaji ndicho kinamalika mapema, kikiua upya kutafuta toleo jipya. Default ni hesabiwa kiotomatiki kutoka i2p.netdb.republishInterval + sekunde 60 (dakika 6 kwa mipangilio ya kawaida)."

msgid "Maximum number of concurrent tunnel builds per direction. Higher values accelerate pool recovery but may overload the network. [Default is 6]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya majenzi ya tuneli yanayofanywa kwa pamoja kwa kila upande. Thamani kubwa zinafungua upya kundi kwa haraka zaidi lakini zinaweza kupendezwa kwa mtandao. [Default ni 6]"

msgid "If exploratory tunnel build success rate falls below 1 in this many attempts, tunnel quantity is reduced. Higher values make quantity reduction less likely. [Default is 12]"
msgstr "Ikiwa kiwango cha mafanikio cha kujenga tuneli za uchunguzi kikishuka chini ya 1 katika majaribio haya mengi, idadi ya tuneli inapunguzwa. Thamani kubwa zinafanya kupunguzwa kwa idadi kutarudiwa kidogo. [Default ni 12]"

msgid "Extra tunnels to maintain beyond the configured pool quantity. A positive value keeps spare tunnels ready so the pool doesn't drain when tunnels expire simultaneously. [Default is 0]"
msgstr "Tuneli za ziada za kudumishwa zaidi ya idadi ya kundi iliyosanidiwa. Thamani chanya zinaweka tuneli za akiba tayari ili kundi lisitwe pale tuneli zinapotimalika kwa pamoja. [Default ni 0]"

msgid "Minimum interval in milliseconds between GOOD-tunnel deficit rebuilds for non-critical pools. Prevents rapid build-retry loops when the pool has enough FAILING tunnels to satisfy the numerical target. [Default is 30000 (30 seconds)]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha chini kwa ms kati ya majenzi ya upya ya upungufu wa tuneli za GOOD kwa makundi yasiyo muhimu. Inazuia mizigo ya haraka ya majenzi na majaribio pale kundi likina tuneli za FAILING zinazotosha kufikia lengo la namba. [Default ni 30000 (sekunde 30)]"

msgid "Minimum tunnel test period in milliseconds. Tunnel tests always wait at least this long for a reply before timing out. [Default is 45000 (45 seconds)]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha chini cha jaribio la tuneli kwa ms. Majaribio ya tuneli daima husubiri angalau muda huu kupata jibu kabla ya kushindwa. [Default ni 45000 (sekunde 45)]"

msgid "Maximum tunnel test period in milliseconds. Tunnel tests never wait longer than this for a reply, even on high-latency paths. [Default is 50000 (50 seconds)]"
msgstr "Kipindi cha kubwa cha jaribio la tuneli kwa ms. Majaribio ya tuneli hayasubiri kwa muda mrefu kuliko huu kupata jibu, hata kwenye njia za latensi kubwa. [Default ni 50000 (sekunde 50)]"

msgid "Number of tunnel build timeouts before a peer is marked as a ghost (blacklisted for tunnel participation). Higher values tolerate more transient failures. [Default is 3]"
msgstr "Idadi ya muda wa kusubiri wa kujenga tuneli kabla ya peer kuwekewa alama ya mzimu (kuwekwa kwenye orodha nyeusi kwa ushiriki wa tuneli). Thamani kubwa zinakubali mishindwa ya muda mwingi zaidi. [Default ni 3]"

msgid "Cooldown period in milliseconds before a ghost-marked peer can be considered for tunnel participation again. Shorter values allow faster peer reuse. [Default is 180000 (3 minutes)]"
msgstr "Mara ya kusubiri kwa ms kabla ya peer iliyowekewa alama ya mzimu kuweza kuzgunosha tena kwa ushiriki wa tuneli. Thamani fupi zinaruhusu matumizi mapya ya peer kwa haraka zaidi. [Default ni 180000 (3 dakika)]"

msgid "Cooldown period in milliseconds for ghost-marked peers during attack mode. Longer cooldowns limit exposure to potentially malicious peers during high-stress periods. [Default is 300000 (5 minutes)]"
msgstr "Mara ya kusubiri kwa ms kwa peer zilizowekewa alama ya mzimu wakati wa hali ya mashambulizi. Mara ndefu za kusubiri zinapunguza hatari kwa peer zinazoweza kuwa hasidi katika vipindi vya shinikizo kubwa. [Default ni 300000 (5 dakika)]"

msgid "Minimum number of incoming tunnel build requests accepted per peer per clean window. Prevents starving peers during low-traffic periods. [Default is 10]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya maombi ya kujenga tuneli yanayoingia yakikaribishwa kwa kila peer kwa kila dirisha safi. Inazuia peer kuzongwa wakati wa vipindi vya trafiki ndogo. [Default ni 10]"

msgid "Maximum number of incoming tunnel build requests accepted per peer per clean window. Caps request volume to prevent DoS. [Default is 300]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya maombi ya kujenga tuneli yanayoingia yakikaribishwa kwa kila peer kwa kila dirisha safi. Inakomoza kiasi cha maombi ili kuzuia DoS. [Default ni 300]"

msgid "Number of tunnel build requests from a single peer in 1 second that triggers an immediate ban. Protects against rapid-fire DoS attacks. [Default is 10]"
msgstr "Idadi ya maombi ya kujenga tuneli kutoka kwa peer moja ndani ya sekunde 1 inayochochchea kuzenzwa mara moja. Inaulinda dhambi za DoS zinazokuwa za haraka. [Default ni 10]"

msgid "Percentage of participating tunnels used to dynamically scale the per-peer request throttle limit. The effective maxLimit is adjusted based on this percentage of current participating tunnel count. [Default is 20]"
msgstr "Asilimia ya tuneli zinazoshiriki inayotumika kukipima kwa kudumu kikomo cha kuzuia maombi kwa kila peer. Kikomo halisi cha maxLimit hubadilishwa kulingana na asilimia hii ya idadi ya sasa ya tuneli zinazoshiriki. [Default ni 20]"

msgid "Minimum number of participating tunnel build requests accepted per clean window. Ensures a baseline acceptance rate even when the router is under load. [Default is 80 (40 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya maombi ya kujenga tuneli yanayoshiriki yakikaribishwa kwa kila dirisha safi. Inahakikisha kiwango cha chini cha ukubali hata pale routeri ikiwa chini ya mzigo. [Default ni 80 (40 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Maximum number of participating tunnel build requests accepted per clean window. Caps acceptance to prevent overload. [Default is 300 (150 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya maombi ya kujenga tuneli yanayoshiriki yakikaribishwa kwa kila dirisha safi. Inakomoza ukubali ili kuzuia kupendezwa. [Default ni 300 (150 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Percentage of current participating tunnels used to scale the participating throttle limits. Higher values allow more build requests relative to tunnel count. [Default is 10]"
msgstr "Asilimia ya tuneli zinazoshiriki za sasa inayotumika kukipima vikomo vya kuzuia vinavyoshirikiwa. Thamani kubwa zinaruhusu maombi mengi zaidi ya kujenga kuhusiana na idadi ya tuneli. [Default ni 10]"

msgid "Minimum percentage of non-failing peer profiles required before the router broadens exploratory peer selection. When below this threshold, only the most reliable peers are used. [Default is 15]"
msgstr "Asilimia ya chini ya wasifu wa peer wasiooshindwa inayohitajika kabla ya routeri kupanua uteuzi wa peer wa uchunguzi. Chini ya kizingiti hiki, peer zenye kuaminika zaidi pekee ndizo zinazotumika. [Default ni 15]"

msgid "Minimum number of active (non-failing) peers required for normal exploratory peer selection. Below this threshold, selection logic becomes more permissive. [Default is 12]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya peer zinazofanya kazi (zisizooshindwa) inayohitajika kwa uteuzi wa kawaida wa peer wa uchunguzi. Chini ya kizingiti hiki, mantiki ya uteuzi inakuwa huruma zaidi. [Default ni 12]"

msgid "Minimum number of active peers required during router startup before restricting exploratory peer selection. During early startup the router is more lenient about peer quality. [Default is 6]"
msgstr "Idadi ya chini ya peer zinazofanya kazi inayohitajika wakati wa kuanza cha routeri kabla ya kuzuia uteuzi wa peer wa uchunguzi. Wakati wa kuanza mapema routeri ni huruma zaidi kuhusu ubora wa peer. [Default ni 6]"

msgid "Maximum time in milliseconds a received SYN may wait in the accept queue before accept() pulls it. If accept() is delayed (busy hosted server) the connection is refused after this window, so a higher value tolerates brief stalls. The configured value is applied without a restart. [Default is 60000 (60 seconds)]"
msgstr "Muda mkubwa zaidi kwa ms ambao SYN iliyopokelwa inaweza kusubiri kwenye foleni ya kukubali kabla ya accept() kuichukua. Ikiwa accept() imechelewa (seva inayohostiriwa inafanya kazi), muunganisho hukataliwa baada ya muda huu, hivyo thamani kubwa zinatahili kusimama kwa muda mfupi. Thamani iliyosanidiwa hutumika bila kuanzishaji upya. [Default ni 60000 (sekunde 60)]"

msgid "This tunnel-specific setting allows you to enable or disable replies to pings sent to servers hosted by the router. To disable pings, you must add the line <code>i2p.streaming.answerPings=false</code> to the <i>Custom Options</i> section for the server's configuration in the Tunnel Manager."
msgstr "Mipangilio haya ya tuneli maalum hukuruhusu kuwasha au kuzima majibu ya ping zinazotumwa kwa seva zinazohostiriwa na routeri. Kuzima ping, lazima uongeze mstari <code>i2p.streaming.answerPings=false</code> kwenye sehemu ya <i>Vichaguo Maalum</i> ya mipangilio ya seva ndani ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli."

msgid "Default maximum stream delay in milliseconds when no explicit connect timeout is set. [Default is 10000 (10 seconds)]"
msgstr "Muda mkubwa zaidi wa default wa muda wa stream kwa ms pale hakuna muda maalum wa kusubiri wa muunganisho. [Default ni 10000 (sekunde 10)]"

msgid "Cooldown period in milliseconds between connection attempts to the same unreachable destination. Prevents hammering unreachable peers. [Default is 5000 (5 seconds)]"
msgstr "Mara ya kusubiri kwa ms kati ya majaribio ya muunganisho kwa lengo lisilofikika. Inazuia kuvuruganya peer zisizofikika. [Default ni 5000 (sekunde 5)]"

msgid "The TIME-WAIT duration in milliseconds after a streaming connection disconnects, during which late packets are still acknowledged. Increase for high-latency paths where final ACKs may be delayed. [Default is 120000 (2 minutes)]"
msgstr "Muda wa TIME-WAIT kwa ms baada ya muunganisho wa streaming kukatika, wakati ambao pakiti zilizokelewa bado zinakubaliwa. Ongeza kwa njia za latensi kubwa ambapo ACK za mwisho zinaweza kuchelewa. [Default ni 120000 (2 dakika)]"

msgid "Number of times to respond to a throttled destination before silently dropping excess packets. Prevents connection storms from overwhelming the router. [Default is 3]"
msgstr "Idadi ya mara za kujibu lengo lililofungwa kabla ya kutupa pakiti nyingi bila ujumbe. Inazuia dhoruba za muunganisho kupendezwa kwa routeri. [Default ni 3]"

msgid "This setting, when enabled, introduces a random pong delay of up to 50ms for all ping-enabled servers hosted by the router. Default is disabled. Applied immediately to new pongs, no restart required."
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwashwa, yanaingiza muda wa kusubiri wa nasibu wa pong hadi 50ms kwa seva zote zenye ping zilizowashwa zenye kuhostiriwa na routeri. Default ni kuzimwa. Inatumika mara moja kwa pong mpya, uanzishaji upya hauhitajiki."

msgid "Initial congestion window size (in packets) for new streaming connections. A larger window starts connections faster but may cause more retransmissions on congested paths. [Default is 64]"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa awali wa dirisha la msongamano (kwa pakiti) kwa muunganisho mpya wa streaming. Dirisha kubwa linaanza muunganisho kwa haraka zaidi lakini linaweza kusababisha kutuma tena zaidi kwenye njia zenye msongamano. [Default ni 64]"

msgid "The upper bound clamp on streaming connect timeout. Prevents per-connection timeouts from exceeding this ceiling. Increase for very high-latency remote access. May be overridden on a per-connection basis by setting the same property in a client tunnel's advanced client options (e.g. the IRC client tunnel defaults to 300000). [Default is 75000 (75 seconds)]"
msgstr "Kizuizi cha juu kwenye muda wa kusubiri wa muunganisho wa streaming. Inazuia muda wa kusubiri wa kila muunganisho kuzidi kizingiti hiki cha juu. Ongeza kwa ufikiaji wa mbali wenye latensi kubwa sana. Inaweza kubatilishwa kwa kila muunganisho kwa kuweka kiambishi sawa kwenye vichaguo vya juu vya mteja vya tuneli ya mteja (kwa mfano tuneli ya mteja ya IRC ina thamani ya 300000 kwa default). [Default ni 75000 (sekunde 75)]"

msgid "Maximum time in milliseconds to wait for a pong reply when pinging a peer. [Default is 300000 (5 minutes)]"
msgstr "Muda mkubwa zaidi kwa ms wa kusubiri jibu la pong unapopiga peer. [Default ni 300000 (5 dakika)]"

msgid "This setting, when enabled, modifies the maximum additional random pong delay introduced for ping-enabled servers, if <code>i2p.streaming.enablePongDelay</code> is also enabled. Unless explicitly set, the default value of 50ms will be used."
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwashwa, yabadilisha muda mkubwa zaidi wa ziada wa kusubiri wa nasibu wa pong unaoingizwa kwa seva zenye ping zilizowashwa, ikiwa <code>i2p.streaming.enablePongDelay</code> pia imewashwa. Isipokuwa imewekwa wazi, thamani ya default ya 50ms itatumiwa."

msgid "Maximum number of pending connections (SYNs and partial packets) in the server accept queue. When full, new SYNs are sent a RESET (the client may retry) rather than silently dropped, which keeps the client informed of the refusal. [Default is 256 (128 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya muunganisho unasubiri (SYN na pakiti za sehemu) kwenye foleni ya kukubali ya seva. Ikiwa imejaa, SYN mpya hupelekewa RESET (mteja anaweza kujaribu tena) badala ya kutupwa bila ujumbe, hivyo mteja anajulisha kuhusu kukataliwa. [Default ni 256 (128 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "The maximum retransmission delay in milliseconds. Retransmit interval will not exceed this value regardless of backoff. Increase to allow longer between retries on congested paths. [Default is 30000 (30s)]"
msgstr "Muda mkubwa zaidi wa kusubiri kwa ms kabla ya kutuma tena. Kipindi cha kutuma tena hakitaruhusu kuzidi thamani hiki bila kujali backoff. Ongeza ili kuruhusu muda mrefu kati ya majaribio kwenye njia zenye msongamano. [Default ni 30000 (30s)]"

msgid "Maximum number of packet retransmissions before giving up on a connection. Higher values improve reliability on lossy links but delay failure detection. [Default is 32]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya kutuma tena pakiti kabla ya kujali muunganisho. Thamani kubwa zinaboresha uaminifu kwenye viungo vinavyopoteza pakiti lakini huchelewesha utambuzi wa kushindwa. [Default ni 32]"

msgid "The maximum Retransmission TimeOut in milliseconds after exponential backoff (doubling). Caps how long the sender waits before attempting retransmission during severe congestion. [Default is 30000 (30s)]"
msgstr "Kikomo cha juu zaidi cha muda wa kusubiri upya (Retransmission TimeOut) kwa ms baada ya backoff ya kielezo (doubling). Inakomoza muda ambao mtumaji anasubiri kabla ya kujaribu kutuma tena wakati wa msongamano mkubwa. [Default ni 30000 (30s)]"

msgid "Maximum round-trip time in milliseconds for streaming connections. Caps the computed RTT to prevent pathological timeout values after network disturbances. [Default is 10000 (10 seconds)]"
msgstr "Muda mkubwa zaidi wa safari kamili ya kurudi kwa ms kwa muunganisho wa streaming. Inakomoza RTT iliyohesabiwa ili kuzuia thamani za muda wa kusubiri zisizo za kawaida baada ya mkatizo wa mtandao. [Default ni 10000 (sekunde 10)]"

msgid "Maximum slow start window size for streaming connections. Caps the congestion window during slow start to prevent overwhelming the network. [Default is 256 (32 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Ukubwa mkubwa zaidi wa dirisha la kuanza polepole kwa muunganisho wa streaming. Inakomoza dirisha la msongamano wakati wa kuanza polepole ili kuzuia kupendezwa kwa mtandao. [Default ni 256 (32 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "Maximum congestion window size (in packets) for streaming connections. Caps the maximum throughput of a single stream. [Default is 512 (384 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Ukubwa mkubwa zaidi wa dirisha la msongamano (kwa pakiti) kwa muunganisho wa streaming. Inakomoza uwezo mkubwa zaidi wa stream moja. [Default ni 512 (384 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "The minimum retransmission delay in milliseconds. Packets will not be resent faster than this interval. Lower values allow faster recovery on lossy connections. [Default is 100ms]"
msgstr "Muda wa chini wa kusubiri kwa ms kabla ya kutuma tena. Pakiti hazitatumwa tena kwa kasi zaidi kuliko kipindi hiki. Thamani ndogo zinaruhusu kuponya haraka zaidi kwenye muunganisho unaopoteza pakiti. [Default ni 100ms]"

msgid "Duration in minutes for a temporary autoban imposed on remote destinations that exceed the stream request thresholds below. Banned destinations are refused all new inbound connections for the ban period. The sweeper re-reads this value every 60 seconds, so it may be changed at runtime via the <a href=/configadvanced>Advanced Configuration page</a>. Set to 0 to disable the autoban entirely. [Default is 5 (5 minutes)]"
msgstr "Muda kwa dakika wa kuzenzwa kwa muda mfupi kwa malengo ya mbali yanayozidi vizingiti vya maombi ya stream vilivyotangulia hapa chini. Malengo yaliyozenzwa hukataliwa miunganisho yote mpya ya kuingia kwa muda wa kuzenzwa. Kisafishi kinasoma thamani hiki upya kila sekunde 60, kwa hivyo inaweza kubadilishwa wakati mfumo unafanya kazi kupitia <a href=/configadvanced>kurasa ya Mipangilio za Juu</a>. Weka kuwa 0 ili kuzima kuzenzwa kiotomatiki kabisa. [Default ni 5 (5 dakika)]"

msgid "Maximum number of inbound SYN refusals from a single remote destination within a rolling window before the autoban is triggered. The refusal counter decays by half every 60 seconds (rather than resetting), so isolated bursts fade while sustained floods accumulate. [Default is 100]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya vikataliwa vya SYN za kuingia kutoka kwa lengo moja la mbali ndani ya dirisha kinachosogeza kabla ya kuzenzwa kiotomatiki. Kihesabia cha vikataliwa kinapungua nusu kila sekunde 60 (badala ya kuweka upya), hivyo mlipuko wa pekee unayeyoma hukuzimwa wakati mafuriko yaendelevu yanajilimbikiza. [Default ni 100]"

msgid "Maximum number of inbound SYNs permitted from a single remote destination within the <code>tempBanSynRate</code> window before a burst strike is recorded. A first strike only logs a warning; a second strike within 60 seconds triggers the autoban. This two-strike gate lets a legitimate page-load burst through while still catching sustained connection floods that would otherwise overwhelm the refusal counter. [Default is 40]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya SYN za kuingia zinazoruhusiwa kutoka kwa lengo moja la mbali ndini ya dirisha la <code>tempBanSynRate</code> kabla ya kuhesabiwa hatsara ya mlipuko. Hatsara ya kwanza tu inarekodi onyo; hatsara ya pili ndini ya sekunde 60 huanzisha kuzenzwa kiotomatiki. Lango la hatsara mbili hili huruhusu mlipuko halali wa kupakia kurasa kupita huku pia kikiwa kinashika mafuriko yaendelevu ya muunganisho ambayo yingegeuza kihesabia cha vikataliwa. [Default ni 40]"

msgid "Time window in milliseconds for the SYN burst check. If more than <code>tempBanSynBurst</code> SYNs are received from a single destination within this window, a burst strike is recorded; a second strike within 60 seconds triggers an autoban. [Default is 1000 (1 second)]"
msgstr "Dirisha la muda kwa ms kwa ukaguzi wa mlipuko wa SYN. Ikiwa zaidi ya <code>tempBanSynBurst</code> SYN zimepokelwa kutoka kwa lengo moja ndini ya dirisha hili, hatsara ya mlipuko huhesabiwa; hatsara ya pili ndini ya sekunde 60 huanzisha kuzenzwa kiotomatiki. [Default ni 1000 (sekunde 1)]"

msgid "Upper ceiling for the Tuner's reactive concurrent-stream cap. The router's Tuner automatically adjusts the per-destination concurrent stream limit based on demand, refusals, and router health, but can never raise a destination above its own per-tunnel <code>i2p.streaming.maxConcurrentStreams</code> setting. This value bounds how high the Tuner is allowed to push the override. Increase this if you host high-traffic services and the Tuner cannot scale the cap high enough. [Default is 1024, range 64–8192, restart required]"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha juu kabisa cha kikomo cha stream zinazofanywa kwa pamoja kinachorekebishwa na Tuner. Tuner ya routeri inarekebisha kiotomatiki kikomo cha stream za kwa pamoja kwa kila lengo kulingana na mahitaji, vikataliwa na afya ya routeri, lakini haiwezi kamwe kupandisha lengo juu ya mpangilio wake wa <code>i2p.streaming.maxConcurrentStreams</code> kwa kila tuneli. Thamani hii inaweka mpaka wa juu kwa Tuner kuruhusu kulazimisha kikomo. Ongeza thamani hii ikiwa unahosti huduma za trafiki nzito na Tuner haiwezi kupandisha kikomo kiasi cha kutosha. [Default ni 1024, masafa 64–8192, uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "Interval in milliseconds between automated LeaseSet republishes. Higher values reduce netdb traffic but may cause stale lease info. [Default is 300000 (5 minutes)]"
msgstr "Kipindi kwa ms kati ya machapisho tena ya LeaseSet yaliyoautomatiiki. Thamani kubwa zinapunguza trafiki ya netdb lakini zinaweza kusababisha taarifa za lease za zamani. [Default ni 300000 (5 dakika)]"

msgid "Threshold in milliseconds for proactive LeaseSet republish. If a lease is expiring within this window, the LeaseSet is republished immediately rather than waiting for the next periodic cycle. [Default is 180000 (3 minutes)]"
msgstr "Kizingiti kwa ms kwa uchapishaji tena wa LeaseSet wa mapema. Ikiwa lease ikikaribia kumalika ndani ya dirisha hili, LeaseSet inapachishwa upya mara moja badala ya kusubiri kipindi kijacho. [Default ni 180000 (3 dakika)]"

msgid "The maximum number of simultaneous I2CP client sessions the router will accept. [Default is 1536 (768 on slow systems)]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya vipindi vya mteja vya I2CP vinavyofanywa kwa pamoja ambavyorouteri itakubali. [Default ni 1536 (768 kwenye mifumo polepole)]"

msgid "When set to true, disables local-local loopback delivery and forces all traffic through tunnels (outbound tunnel → network → inbound tunnel → local destination). Useful for testing tunnel routing behavior when the source and destination are on the same router. [Disabled by default]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, inazima utoaji wa loopback wa ndani-kwa-ndani na inalazimisha trafiki yote kupitia tuneli (tuneli ya kutoka → mtandao → tuneli ya kuingia → lengo la ndani). Inasaidia kujaribu tabia ya uelekezaji wa tuneli pale chanzo na lengo vikiwa kwenye routeri moja. [Imezimwa kwa default]"

msgid "This setting, when set to true, will block direct communication from all routers in your own country and add them to your banlist until your router restarts. [Default is false, or true if router is in hidden mode]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwa yameswekwa kuwa true, yatazuia mawasiliano ya moja kwa moja kutoka kwa routeri zote nchini mako na kuzongeza kwenye orodha yako ya kuzenzwa hadi routeri yako ianzishwe upya. [Default ni false, au true ikiwa routeri iko katika hali ya siri]"

msgid "This setting permits disabling SSU tests to determine if your router is firewalled and can be enabled for routers that are definitely not firewalled but are experiencing intermittent firewalling issues. In the event that testing is disabled, both SSU and NTCP should report your current public ip address on <a href=/info>the router info page</a>. [Restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya huruhusu kuzima majaribio ya SSU ya kubaini ikiwa routeri yako iko nyuma ya firewall na inaweza kuwashwa kwa routeri zinazojiamini kuwa haziko nyuma ya firewall lakini zina tatizo la firewall linaloenda na kuja. Ikiwa majaribio yamezimwa, SSU na NTCP zote zinapaswa kuripoti anwani yako ya sasa ya IP ya umma kwenye <a href=/info>kurasa ya taarifa za routeri</a>. [Uanzishaji upya unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting determines which transport takes priority when communicating with peers. By default, NTCP is favored over UDP (SSU). By setting the value to true, UDP will be favored unless a pre-existing NTCP connection exists; when set to always, UDP will always be used regardless of any pre-existing NTCP connection. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inaamua usafiri gani una kipaumbele wakati wa kawasiliana na peer. Kwa default, NTCP inapendekezwa kuliko UDP (SSU). Kwa kuweka thamani kuwa true, UDP itapendekezwa isipokuwa kuna muunganisho wa NTCP uliopo tayari; ukisawazishwa kuwa always, UDP itatumiwa daima bila kujali muunganisho wowote wa NTCP uliopo tayari. [Default ni false]"

msgid "The connect timeout in milliseconds for eepget HTTP requests (time to wait for initial response headers). Increase for high-latency remote access scenarios. [Default is 90000 (90s)]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri wa muunganisho kwa ms kwa maombi ya HTTP ya eepget (muda wa kusubiri vichwa vya jibu la awali). Ongeza kwa hali za ufikiaji wa mbali zenye latensi kubwa. [Default ni 90000 (90s)]"

msgid "Default number of retries for eepget when the <code>-n</code> flag is not specified. [Default is 10]"
msgstr "Idadi ya default ya majaribio kwa eepget pale kipengele cha <code>-n</code> hakispecifiwi. [Default ni 10]"

msgid "The inactivity timeout in milliseconds for eepget transfers (max idle time during data phase). Increase for slow connections experiencing stalls. [Default is 300000 (5min)]"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri wa kutokwa na shughuli kwa ms kwa uhamisho wa eepget (muda mkubwa zaidi wa kutulia wakati wa hatua ya data). Ongeza kwa muunganisho polepole unaopata matatizo ya kusimama. [Default ni 300000 (5min)]"

msgid "Maximum number of consecutive zero-data transfer failures before eepget gives up, even if retries remain. Increase if transfers fail without receiving any data. [Default is 20]"
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya mishindwa ya uhamisho wa data bila kitu inayofuata kabla ya eepget kujali, hata bado majaribio yako. Ongeza ikiwa uhamisho unashindwa bila kupokea data yoyote. [Default ni 20]"

msgid "Fixed delay in milliseconds between eepget retry attempts. Use -1 for a jittered delay (base 5s plus up to 10s of jitter) to spread load on a flaky source. Values of 0 cause an immediate retry. [Default is -1]"
msgstr "Muda wa kudumu kwa ms kati ya majaribio ya eepget. Tumia -1 kwa muda wenye mtikiko (msingi 5s hadi 10s za mtikiko) kusambaza mzigo kwenye chanzo kinachotatua. Thamani za 0 husababisha jaribio la awali. [Default ni -1]"

msgid "When enabled, eepget resolves hostnames for HTTPS fetches via DNS-over-HTTPS, protecting lookups from local snooping. Bypassed when fetching through a proxy or when the host is an IP address. [Default is true]"
msgstr "Ukisawashwa, eepget hutatua majina ya mashine kwa ajili ya vipakuliwa vya HTTPS kupitia DNS-over-HTTPS, ikilinda utafutaji kushikiliwa karibu. Huzirukwa unapopakua kupitia proksi au pale mashine ni anwani ya IP. [Default ni true]"

msgid "This setting defines the maximum number of torrents whose storage is checked at the same time, when several torrents start or are rechecked together, bounding the disk I/O storm on startup or after a crash. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is 4, restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inaamua idadi kubwa zaidi ya torrents ambazo hifadhi yao hukaguliwa kwa wakati mmoja, pale torrents nyingi zinaanza au hukaguliwa pamoja, ikifunga dhoruba ya diski I/O wakati wa kuanza au baada ya kuzoroga. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni 4, uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting allows configuration of the maximum number of files per torrent I2PSnark will permit, when downloading or creating a torrent. Note that substantially increasing this value from the default of 2000 files may require additional configuration on the host system to increase the maximum number of open files the operating system will permit (e.g. <code>ulimit -n</code> on Linux). To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code> or set on the I2PSnark configuration page; applies to torrents added afterwards."
msgstr "Mipangilio haya hukuruhusu kusanidi idadi kubwa zaidi ya faili kwa kila torrent ambayo I2PSnark itaruhusu, unapopakua au kutengeneza torrent. Kumbuka kwamba kuongeza thamani hii kwa kiasi kutoka default ya faili 2000 inaweza kuhitaji mipangilio ya ziada kwenye mfumo wa mashine ili kuongeza idadi kubwa zaidi ya faili zilizo wazi ambazo mfumo wa uendeshaji huruhusu (kwa mfano <code>ulimit -n</code> kwenye Linux). Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code> au weka kwenye kurasa ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark; inatumika kwa torrents zinazoongezwa baadaye."

msgid "This setting, when enabled, periodically restarts all running torrents so their destinations rotate to fresh identities, breaking long-lived linkage between the router's IP address and the torrents' destinations at trackers and in the DHT. The cycle runs every 3 hours plus a random delay of 1 to 60 minutes, is skipped while any torrent is actively downloading, and restarts only the torrents that were running. Destinations are temporary and change on every restart anyway; this extends that to within a run. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is true, restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwashwa, yanaanzisha upya kwa vipindi torrents zote zinazofanya kazi ili malengo yao yabadilike na kupewa utambulisho mpya, yakivunja uhusiano wa muda mrefu kati ya anwani ya IP ya routeri na malengo ya torrents kwenye tracker na kwenye DHT. Mzunguko huu unafanyika kila saa 3 zaidi ya muda wa kusubiri wa nasibu wa dakika 1 hadi 60, hupunguzwa wakati wowote torrent inapakua kwa nguvu, na huanzisha upya tu torrents zilizokuwa zinafanya kazi. Malengo ya muda msimamo na hubadilika kila kitu anapouanzisha upya; hii inaongeza hilo ndani ya kipindi. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni true, uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting controls client identity spoofing: the tracker peer ID and User-Agent, the BitTorrent handshake peer ID, the extension handshake client name, and web seed fetches all present as the selected well-known client instead of I2PSnark. In multi-destination mode each destination pool is assigned its own random client by default; in single-destination mode I2PSnark identifies as itself unless a client name or \"random\" is set. Set to \"random\" to force random selection in all modes, \"i2psnark\" to keep the classic identity even in multi-destination mode, or to a client name to always impersonate that client. Version strings are pinned to current upstream releases and are consistent across the peer ID, User-Agent and extension handshake. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is random per pool in multi-destination mode; applies to torrents started afterwards]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inadhibi udanganyifu wa utambulisho wa mteja: kitambulisho cha peer na User-Agent cha tracker, kitambulisho cha peer cha handshake ya BitTorrent, jina la mteja cha handshake ya kiendeshaji, na vipakuliwa vya web seed vyote vinaonekana kama mteja maarufu uliyochaguliwa badala ya I2PSnark. Katika hali ya malengo mengi kila kundi la malengo linapewa mteja wake wa nasibu kwa default; katika hali ya lengo moja I2PSnark inajitambulisha kama yenyewe isipokuwa jina la mteja au \"random\" limewekwa. Weka \"random\" ili kulazimisha uteuzi wa nasibu katika hali zote, \"i2psnark\" ili kuweka utambulisho wa awali hata katika hali ya malengo mengi, au jina la mteja ili kuigeleza mteja huyo kila wakati. Nyirairi za toleo zinasimamishwa kwenye matoleo ya sasa ya upstream na zinalindana kati ya kitambulisho cha peer, User-Agent na handshake ya kiendeshaji. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni random kwa kila kundi katika hali ya malengo mengi; inatumika kwa torrents zinazoanza baadaye]"

msgid "This setting optionally restricts the clients chosen by random selection for <code>i2psnark.clientId</code> to a comma-separated subset of known client names; unknown names are ignored and an empty value selects from all supported clients. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is unset, applies to torrents started afterwards]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya kwa hiari yunalenga wateja waliochaguliwa kwa nasibu kwa <code>i2psnark.clientId</code> kwa sehemu ndogo yenye majina ya wateja yanayojulikana, yaliyotenganishwa kwa koma; majina hayujulikani hayaachwa, na thamani tupu inachagua kutoka kwa wateja wote wanaotumika. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni haijasetwa, inatumika kwa torrents zinazoanza baadaye]"

msgid "This setting, when enabled, preallocates the full file sizes on disk when a download starts, to reduce fragmentation. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is true, restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwashwa, yanatenga nafasi ya ukubwa kamili wa faili kwenye diski mwanzo wa kupakua kutokea, ili kupunguza kugawanyika. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni true, uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting, when enabled, adds BEP 47 padding files to new torrents created by I2PSnark, so each file except the last ends on a piece boundary. Downloading and verifying padded torrents is unaffected. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is false; the configuration file is re-read every 30 seconds and changed settings are applied without a restart]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwashwa, yanaongeza faili za kujaza za BEP 47 kwenye torrents mpya zinazoundwa na I2PSnark, ili kila faili isipokuwa ya mwisho ikamilike kwenye mpaka wa kipande. Kupakua na kuthibitisha torrents zilizojazwa hakubadilishwi. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni false; faili ya mipangilio husomwa upya kila sekunde 30 na mipangilio iliyobadilishwa inatumika bila kuanzishaji upya]"

msgid "This setting, when enabled, sorts torrent names using the configured language for correct alphabetical order. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is false, restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwashwa, yanapanga majina ya torrents kwa kutumia lugha iliyosanidiwa ili kupata mpangilio sahihi wa alfabeti. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni false, uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting defines a comma-separated list of tracker announce URLs treated as private trackers; torrents using them are not shared with other peers via DHT or PEX. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inaamua orodha ya URL za kutangaza za tracker, iliyotenganishwa kwa koma, inazotendwa kama tracker za faragha; torrents zinazozitumia hazishirikiwi na peer nyingine kupitia DHT au PEX. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting defines comma-separated name,url pairs for the default tracker list shown for new torrents, overriding the built-in list. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inaamua jozi za majina,url zilizotenganishwa kwa koma kwa orodha ya default ya tracker inayoonyeshwa kwa torrents mpya, ikichagua juu ya orodha iliyojijengwa. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting, when enabled, bans peers that cancel most of what they request. Once a peer has requested and cancelled at least 5 MB in total, a cancel ratio above 90% of the bytes it requested gets the peer banned (rejected on both incoming and outgoing connections) for <code>i2psnark.banDiscardPeriod</code> minutes. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is true, restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya, yakiwashwa, yanabanza peer zinazoghairi mengi ya kile wanachotaka. Mara tu peer ameomba na kughairi angalau 5 MB kwa jumla, uwiano wa kughairi zaidi ya 90% ya bytes aliyoomba hupelekea peer kuzenzwa (kukataliwa kwenye muunganisho wa kuingia na wa kutoka) kwa dakika za <code>i2psnark.banDiscardPeriod</code>. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni true, uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting defines the duration in minutes of the ban applied to peers with an excessive discard ratio. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is 60, restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inaamua muda kwa dakika wa kuzenzwa kwa peer zenye uwiano wa kughairi kupita kiasi. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni 60, uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting defines the maximum number of messages kept in the I2PSnark web interface message area. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is 50, restart of I2PSnark required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inaamua idadi kubwa zaidi ya ujumbe unaohifadhiwa katika eneo la ujumbe la kiolesura cha tovuti ya I2PSnark. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni 50, uanzishaji mpya wa I2PSnark unahitajika]"

msgid "This setting defines the number of worker threads used to verify pieces in parallel during a full storage check of a single torrent, e.g. when resuming or rechecking. When unset, the thread count scales with the CPU count, at least 4. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default is max(cores / 4, 4); read per check, so no restart required]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya inaamua idadi ya nyuzi wa wafanyakazi wanaotumika kuthibitisha vipande kwa pamoja wakati wa ukaguzi kamili wa hifadhi ya torrent moja, kwa mfano unapoendeleza au unapokaguliwa upya. Pale haikusetwi, idadi ya nyuzi inapimwa kulingana na idadi ya CPU, angalau 4. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code>. [Default ni max(cores / 4, 4); husomwa kwa kila ukaguzi, kwa hivyo uanzishaji upya hauhitajiki]"

msgid "When set to a directory path, incomplete downloads are written to a staging folder in this directory instead of the data directory, and each file is copied into the data directory only when all of its pieces have been downloaded. This is useful for keeping partial downloads off the main data volume (for example on a separate, faster or less heavily used disk). The staging directory must have enough free space to hold the largest in-progress downloads. When unset or empty, downloads are written directly to the data directory as before. To change, add to I2PSnark's configuration file <code>i2psnark.config</code> or set on the I2PSnark configuration page; applies to torrents added afterwards. [Disabled by default]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa njia ya katalogi, vipakuliwa visivyokamilika hiviandikwa kwenye folda ya kusubiri katika katalogi hii badala ya katalogi ya data, na kila faili hukopishwa kwenye katalogi ya data tu pale vipande vyake vyote vimepakuliwa. Hii inasaidia kuweka vipakuliwa vingi vya sehemu mbali na diski kuu ya data (kwa mfano kwenye diski tofauti, ya haraka zaidi au inayotumika kidogo). Katalogi ya kusubiri lazima iwe na nafasi ya kutosha ya kushikilia vipakuliwa vyikubwa vinavyotendelea. Pale haikusetwi au ni tupu, vipakuliwa hiviandikwa moja kwa moja kwenye katalogi ya data kama ilivyo kuwa awali. Kubadilisha, ongeza kwenye faili ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark <code>i2psnark.config</code> au weka kwenye kurasa ya mipangilio ya I2PSnark; inatumika kwa torrents zinazoongezwa baadaye. [Imezimwa kwa default]"

msgid "miscellaneous"
msgstr "Mbalimbali"

msgid "If set to true, this option will place an icon in the system tray / notification area, with basic service control options. [Disabled by default]"
msgstr "Ikiwa imewekwa kuwa true, chaguo hiki litaweka aikoni kwenye tray ya mfumo / eneo la arifa, chenye vichaguo vya kudhibiti huduma za msingi. [Imezimwa kwa default]"

msgid "When set to true, I2P runs without network connectivity, which is helpful if you are constantly restarting the router to test code updates as this prevents network disruption."
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, I2P inafanya kazi bila muunganisho wa mtandao, jambo lililo muhimu ikiwa unaanzisha upya routeri mara kwa mara ili kujaribu sasisho za msimbo kwa kuwa hii inazuia kukatika kwa mtandao."

msgid "When set to true, the current log file and any rotated archives are made readable and writable by the group that the router runs under (mode 660), so that users who are members of that group can inspect the logs. The files are never made world-readable. [Default is false]"
msgstr "Ukisawazishwa kuwa true, faili ya sasa ya kumbukumbu na kumbukumbu zozote zilizozungushwa zinafanywa kuwa zinazoweza kusomwa na kuandikwa na kundi ambacho routeri inafanyia kazi (mode 660), ili watumiaji walio wa kundi hilo waweze kuangalia kumbukumbu. Faili hazifanywi kamwe kuwa zinazoweza kusomwa na wote. [Default ni false]"

msgid "This setting permits the configuration of alternative NTP servers required to ensure that your router maintains accurate clock time. [Default is 0.pool.ntp.org,1.pool.ntp.org,2.pool.ntp.org]"
msgstr "Mipangilio haya huruhusu kusanidi seva mbadala za NTP zinazohitajika ili kuhakikisha routeri yako inabeba muda sahihi wa saa. [Default ni 0.pool.ntp.org,1.pool.ntp.org,2.pool.ntp.org]"

msgid "Recent I2P+ Changes"
msgstr "Mabadiliko ya Karibunu ya I2P+"

msgid "View the full change log"
msgstr "Tazama kitanzi cha mabadiliko kamili"

msgid "While I2P will work fine behind most firewalls, your speeds and network integration will generally improve if the I2P port is forwarded for both UDP and TCP."
msgstr "Ingawa I2P itafanya kazi vizuri nyuma ya firewall nyingi, kasi yako na muunganisho wako wa mtandao kwa kawaida utaboreshwa ikiwa bandari ya I2P imeelekezwa kwa UDP na TCP."

msgid "If you can, please poke a hole in your firewall to allow unsolicited UDP and TCP packets to reach you."
msgstr "Ukiwezeza, tafadhali fungua shimo kwenye firewall yako ili kuruhusu pakiti za UDP na TCP zisizoombwa zipate uliyo."

msgid "If you can't, I2P supports UPnP (Universal Plug and Play) and UDP hole punching with \"SSU introductions\" to relay traffic."
msgstr "Ukiwa huwezi, I2P inasaidia UPnP (Universal Plug and Play) na hole punching kwa UDP kwa kutumia \"SSU introductions\" kupeleka trafiki."

msgid "Most of the options on the Network Configuration page are for special situations, for example where UPnP does not work correctly, or a firewall not under your control is doing harm."
msgstr "Chaguo nyingi kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao ni kwa hali maalum, kwa mfano pale UPnP haifanyi kazi vizuri, au firewall isiyokuwa chini ya udhibiti wako inasababisha madhara."

msgid "Certain firewalls such as symmetric NATs may not work well with I2P."
msgstr "Baadhi ya firewall kama NAT za tabasamu huenda zisingiwezekane vizuri na I2P."

msgid "UPnP is used to communicate with Internet Gateway Devices (IGDs) to detect the external IP address and forward ports."
msgstr "UPnP hutumika kwa kawasiliana na vifaa vya Lango la Internet (IGDs) ili kubaini anwani ya IP ya nje na kuelekeza bandari."

msgid "UPnP support is beta, and may not work for any number of reasons"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa UPnP ni wa beta, na huenda usiwe kufanya kazi kwa sababu nyingi"

msgid "No UPnP-compatible device present"
msgstr "Hakuna kifaa kinachohimiana na UPnP kilichopo"

msgid "UPnP disabled on the device"
msgstr "UPnP imezimwa kwenye kifaa"

msgid "Software firewall interference with UPnP"
msgstr "Mwingiliano wa firewall ya programu na UPnP"

msgid "Bugs in the device's UPnP implementation"
msgstr "Hitilafu katika utekelezaji wa UPnP wa kifaa"

msgid "Multiple firewall/routers in the internet connection path"
msgstr "Firewall/routeri nyingi katika njia ya muunganisho wa Internet"

msgid "UPnP device change, reset, or address change"
msgstr "Badiliko la kifaa cha UPnP, kuweka upya, au badiliko la anwani"

msgid "UPnP may be enabled or disabled on the Network Configuration page, but a change requires a router restart to take effect."
msgstr "UPnP inaweza kuwashwa au kuzimwa kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao, lakini badiliko linahitaji kuanzishaji upya kwa routeri ili kutumika."

msgid "Review the UPnP status here."
msgstr "Pitia hali ya UPnP hapa."

msgid "Also, <b>do not enter a private IP address</b> like 127.0.0.1 or 192.168.1.1."
msgstr "Pia, <b>usiiingize anwani ya IP ya faragha</b> kama 127.0.0.1 au 192.168.1.1."

msgid "If you specify the wrong IP address, or do not properly configure your NAT or firewall, your network performance will degrade substantially."
msgstr "Ukiwa anwani uliyoipa ni ya IP isiyo sahihi, au hukusanyi NAT au firewall yako ipasavyo, utendaji wako wa mtandao utashuka sana."

msgid "When in doubt, leave the settings at the defaults."
msgstr "Unapo shaka, acha mipangilio kwa default zake."

msgid "Web Browser Configuration"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Kivinjari cha Tovuti"

msgid "In order to access websites hosted on I2P, and optionally use the default outproxy to connect to websites on clearnet, you will need to configure your browser to use the I2P HTTP proxy, by default running on <code>127.0.0.1 port 4444</code>. Most browsers offer an option to configure your proxy; in this mini-tutorial we'll focus on Firefox."
msgstr "Ili kufikia tovuti zilizohostiriwa kwenye I2P, na kwa hiari kutumia outproxy ya default kuunganisha kwenye tovuti za clearnet, mnahitaji kusanidi kivinjari chenu kutumia proksi ya HTTP ya I2P, ambayo kwa default inafanya kazi kwenye <code>127.0.0.1 port 4444</code>. Kivinjari nyingi hutoa chaguo la kusanidi proksi yako; katika mwongozo huu mdogo tutazingatia Firefox."

msgid "Open the Preferences page in Firefox and scroll to the bottom of the General section."
msgstr "Fungua kurasa ya Mapendeleo kwenye Firefox na uendelee hadi mwisho wa sehemu ya Jumla."

msgid "In the Network Settings sub-section, hit the <i>Settings</i> button."
msgstr "Katika sehemu ndogo ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao, bofya kitufe cha <i>Mipangilio</i>."

msgid "Under <i>Configure Proxy Access to Internet</i> select the <i>Manual proxy configuration</i> option."
msgstr "Chini ya <i>Sanidi Ufikiaji wa Proksi kwa Internet</i> chagua chaguo la <i>Mipangilio ya proksi ya mikono</i>."

msgid "Enter <code>127.0.0.1</code> in the <i>HTTP Proxy</i> field, and <code>4444</code> in the <i>Port</i> field."
msgstr "Weka <code>127.0.0.1</code> katika uwanja wa <i>Proksi ya HTTP</i>, na <code>4444</code> katika uwanja wa <i>Bandari</i>."

msgid "Tick the box marked <i>Use this proxy server for all protocols</i> to avoid requests escaping the proxy."
msgstr "Weka alama kwenye sanduku lililoandikwa <i>Tumia seva hii ya proksi kwa protokoli zote</i> ili kuepuka maombi kutoka kwenye proksi."

msgid "In the box marked <i>No Proxy for</i> add the line <code>127.0.0.1,localhost</code> to ensure the I2P console and other locally hosted websites are still available."
msgstr "Katika sanduku lililoandikwa <i>Hakuna Proksi kwa</i> ongeza mstari <code>127.0.0.1,localhost</code> ili kuhakikisha konsola ya I2P na tovuti nyingine zilizohostiriwa ndani bado zinapatikana."

msgid "Tick the box marked <i>Proxy DNS when using SOCKS v5</i> to prevent DNS leaks."
msgstr "Weka alama kwenye sanduku lililoandikwa <i>Endesha DNS kupitia proksi unapotumia SOCKS v5</i> ili kuzuia kuvuja kwa DNS."

msgid "Hit the <i>OK</i> button and test the proxy is working by visiting <a href=http://planeta.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>planeta.i2p</a> and <a href=https://www.myip.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>www.myip.com</a>."
msgstr "Bofya kitufe cha <i>OK</i> na jaribu kuona kama proksi inafanya kazi kwa kutembelea <a href=http://planeta.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>planeta.i2p</a> na <a href=https://www.myip.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>www.myip.com</a>."

msgid "Note: To enhance your security when browsing .i2p sites, you may wish to consider installing an addon to prevent Javascript from running in the browser such as <a href=https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/noscript/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>NoScript</a>, though it's recommended to whitelist the address I2P+ is running on to enable various router console enhancements. In addition, an addon that prevents requests to offsite resources is also recommended, for example <a href=https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/umatrix/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>uMatrix</a>."
msgstr "Kumbuka: Ili kuongeza usalama wako unapotembelea tovuti za .i2p, unaweza kuzingatia kusakinisha kiambatisho kinachozuia Javascript isiruke kwenye kivinjari kama <a href=https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/noscript/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>NoScript</a>, ingawa inavyopendekezwa kuweka kwenye orodha ya kuruhusu anwani I2P+ inayoendesha ili kuwasha mbinu mbalimbali za konsola ya routeri. Zaidi ya hayo, pia inavyopendekezwa kiambatisho kinachozuia maombi ya vyakati vya nje, kwa mfano <a href=https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/umatrix/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>uMatrix</a>."

msgid "For a more extensive guide to configuration for various browsers, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/about/browser-config target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>browser configuration guide</a>."
msgstr "Kwa mwongozo zaidi kamili wa mipangilio kwa kivinjari mbalimbali, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/about/browser-config target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>mwongozo wa mipangilio ya kivinjari</a>."

msgid "The Tunnel Manager"
msgstr "Msimamizi wa Tuneli"

msgid "The Tunnel Manager enables configuration of local services provided by your router."
msgstr "Ndani ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli unaweza kusanidi huduma za ndani zinazotolewa na routeri yako."

msgid "You can determine which services automatically start when the router starts, manage tunnel allocation to optimize for high usage services or to minimize the the cpu and memory overhead, add server and client tunnels to host or access services on the network, set rate limiting or tunnel filtering for your server tunnels and more."
msgstr "Unaweza kubainua huduma zipi zinaanza kiotomatiki mwanzo routeri inapowasha, kusimamia ugawaji wa tuneli ili kuboresha huduma za matumizi makubwa au kupunguza mzigo wa CPU na kumbukumbu, kuongeza tuneli za seva na za mteja ili kuhosti au kufikia huduma kwenye mtandao, kweka kikomo cha kasi au kuchuja tuneli za tuneli zako za seva, na mengine mengi."

msgid "By default, most of your client services (mail, http proxy, IRC) will share the same set of tunnels (for performance reasons) and be listed as <i>Shared Clients</i> and <i>Shared Clients(DSA)</i> in the sidebar under Service Tunnels and on the <a href=/tunnels>Tunnels page</a>."
msgstr "Kwa default, huduma nyingi za mteja (barua pepe, proksi ya http, IRC) zinashiriki seti moja ya tuneli (kwa sababu za utendaji) na zinaorodheshwa kama <i>Wateja wa Kushiriki</i> na <i>Wateja wa Kushiriki(DSA)</i> kwenye sidebar chini ya Tuneli za Huduma na kwenye <a href=/tunnels>kurasa ya Tuneli</a>."

msgid "However, if you experience a tunnel failure, all your services will go offline at the same time, so in some scenarios you may wish to configure client services to use their own set of tunnels."
msgstr "Hata hivyo, ikiwa unapata kushindwa kwa tuneli, huduma zako zote zitaenda nje ya mtandao kwa wakati mmoja, hivyo katika hali fulani unaweza kusanidi huduma za mteja zitumie seti yao ya tuneli."

msgid "This can be done by unchecking the <i>Share tunnels with other configured clients</i> option listed under <i>Shared Client</i> on the configuration page of the relevant client service, after which you will need to restart the client service from the <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Tunnel Manager index page</a>."
msgstr "Hii inaweza kufanywa kwa kuondoa alama kwenye chaguo la <i>Shiriki tuneli na wateja wengine waliosanidiwa</i> lililomoorodheshwa chini ya <i>Mteja wa Kushiriki</i> kwenye kurasa ya mipangilio ya huduma inayohusika ya mteja, baadaye kisha utahitaji kuanzisha upya huduma ya mteja kutoka <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>kurasa ya kwanza ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>."

msgid "Note: Most of the options in the Tunnel Manager have tooltips; be sure to check those before you change settings you don't fully understand!"
msgstr "Kumbuka: Chaguo nyingi za Msimamizi wa Tuneli zina maelezo mafupi; hakikisia kuyapitia kabla ya kubadilisha mipangilio usiyoyelewa vizuri!"

msgid "Abridged I2P FAQ"
msgstr "Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara ya I2P Iliyofupishwa"

msgid "This is a shortened version of the official FAQ. For the full version, please visit <a href=https://geti2p.net/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>https://geti2p.net/faq</a> or <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>http://i2p-projekt.i2p/faq</a>."
msgstr "Hii ni toleo lililofupishwa la Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara rasmi. Kwa toleo kamili, tafadhali tembelea <a href=https://geti2p.net/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>https://geti2p.net/faq</a> au <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>http://i2p-projekt.i2p/faq</a>."

msgid "My router has been up for several minutes and has zero or very few connections"
msgstr "Routeri yangu imekaa kwa dakika nyingi na ina muunganisho zero au wachache sana"

msgid "If after a few minutes of uptime your router is indicating 0 Active Peers and 0 Known Peers, with a notification in the sidebar that you need to check your network connection, verify that you can access the internet. If your internet connection is functional, you may need to unblock Java in your firewall. Otherwise, you may need to reseed your I2P router. Visit the <a href=/configreseed#reseedconfig>Reseed Configuration page</a> and click the <i>Save Changes and Reseed Now</i> button. For more information, see the <a href=#reseedhelp>Reseed help section</a> above."
msgstr "Ikiwa baada ya dakika chache za muda wa kuendeshwa routeri yako inaonyesha 0 Peer zinazofanya kazi na 0 Peer Zinazozulikana, pamoja na arifa kwenye sidebar ikisema unapaswa kuangalia muunganisho wako wa mtandao, hakikisha unaweza kufikia Internet. Ikiwa muunganisho wako wa Internet unafanya kazi, huenda utahitaji kuruhusu Java kwenye firewall yako. Vinginevyo, huenda utahitaji kufanya reseed ya routeri yako ya I2P. Tembelea <a href=/configreseed#reseedconfig>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Reseeding</a> na bofya kitufe cha <i>Hifadhi Mabadiliko na Fanya Reseed Sasa</i>. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=#reseedhelp>sehemu ya msaada wa reseed</a> hapo juu."

msgid "My router has very few active peers, is this OK?"
msgstr "Routeri yangu ina peer zinazofanya kazi wachache sana, je hii ni vizuri?"

msgid "If your router has 10 or more active peers, everything is fine. The router should maintain connections to a few peers at all times. The best way to stay \"better-connected\" to the network is to <a href=/config>share more bandwidth</a>."
msgstr "Ikiwa routeri yako ina peer 10 au zaidi zinazofanya kazi, kila kitu kiko vizuri. Routeri inapaswa kudumisha muunganisho na peer kidogo wakati wote. Njia bora ya kuwa \"better-connected\" zaidi na mtandao ni <a href=/config>kushiriki kasi zaidi</a>."

msgid "I'm missing lots of hosts in my addressbook. What are some good subscription links?"
msgstr "Ninakosewa mashine nyingi katika kitabu changu cha anwani. Ni viungo gani vizuri vya usajili?"

msgid "The default subscription is to <code>http://i2p-projekt.i2p/hosts.txt</code> which is seldom updated. If you don't have another subscription, you may often have to use \"jump\" links which is much slower but ensures that your addressbook is only populated by sites you use (in addition to the default subscription addresses). To speed up browsing on I2P, it's a good idea to add some addressbook subscriptions."
msgstr "Usajili wa default ni <code>http://i2p-projekt.i2p/hosts.txt</code> ambao hausasishwi mara kwa mara. Ikiwa huna usajili mwingine, mara nyingi utalazimika kutumia viungo vya \"jump\" ambavyo ni polepole zaidi lakini huhakikisha kwamba kitabu chako cha anwani kinajazwa tu na tovuti unazotumia (zaidi ya anwani za usajili wa default). Ili kuisogeza kivinjari kwenye I2P, ni wazo zuri kuongeza baadhi ya usajili wa kitabu cha anwani."

msgid "Here are some other public addressbook subscription links. You may wish to add one or two to your <a href='/dns?subscriptions' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>susidns subscription list</a>. In the event that addresses conflict in the subscriptions, the lists placed at the top of your susidns configuration will take precedence over those placed further down."
msgstr "Hapa kuna viungo vingine vya umma vya usajili wa kitabu cha anwani. Huenda ungependa kuongeza kimoja au viwili kwenye <a href='/dns?subscriptions' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>orodha yako ya usajili ya susidns</a>. Ikiwa anwani zinagharimu ndani ya usajili, orodha zilizowekwa juu ya mipangilio yako ya susidns zitakuwa na kipaumbele kuliko zilizowekwa chini zaidi."

msgid "Note that subscribing to a hosts.txt service is an act of trust, as a malicious subscription could give you incorrect addresses, so be careful subscribing to lists from unknown sources. The operators of these services may have various policies for listing hosts. Presence on this list does not imply endorsement."
msgstr "Kumbuka kwamba kujisajili kwenye huduma ya hosts.txt ni kitendo cha kuamini, kwa kuwa usajili mbaya unaweza kukupa anwani zisizo sahihi, kwa hivyo angalia unapojisajili kwenye orodha kutoka vyanzo havijulikani. Wawazidi wa huduma hizi wanaweza kuwa na sera mbalimbali za kuorodhesha mashine. Kuwa kwenye orodha hii hakubadilishi kuwa umeidhinisha."

msgid "How do I access IRC, BitTorrent, or other services on the regular Internet?"
msgstr "Niunganeze IRC, BitTorrent, au huduma nyingine kwenye Internet ya kawaida?"

msgid "Unless an outproxy has been set up for the service you want to connect to, this is not possible, with the exception of BitTorrent (see below). There are only three types of outproxies running right now: HTTP, HTTPS, and email. Note that there is currently no publicly listed SOCKS outproxy. If this type of service is required, try <a href=https://torproject.org/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Tor</a>."
msgstr "Isipokuwa outproxy imeanzishwa kwa huduma unayotaka kuunganisha, hii haiwezekani, isipokuwa kwa BitTorrent (tazama hapa chini). Kuna aina tatu tu za outproxy zinazofanya kazi kwa sasa: HTTP, HTTPS, na barua pepe. Kumbuka kwamba kwa sasa hakuna outproxy ya SOCKS iliyoorodheshwa hadhara. Ikiwa aina hii ya huduma inahitajika, jaribu <a href=https://torproject.org/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Tor</a>."

msgid "Can I download torrents from non-I2P trackers?"
msgstr "Je, naweza kupakua torrents kutoka tracker za nje ya I2P?"

msgid "Until the advent of I2P integration in <a href=http://www.vuze.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Vuze</a>, it wasn't possible to download torrents that weren't hosted on the I2P network. However, now that Vuze (and latterly <a href=https://www.biglybt.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Bigly</a>) allow users to share non-I2P torrents on I2P, non-I2P torrents can be downloaded over I2P if Vuze/Bigly users have chosen to make content available to the I2P network. Popular torrents with a large number of peers are more likely to be accessible via I2P; to determine if the content is available, add the torrent link, magnet or infohash to your I2P-enabled BitTorrent client."
msgstr "Mpaka ilipokuwa I2P ilijishughulisha ndani ya <a href=http://www.vuze.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Vuze</a>, ilikuwa haiwezekani kupakua torrents ambazo hazikuwa zinahostiriwa kwenye mtandao wa I2P. Hata hivyo, sasa kwamba Vuze (na hivi karibuni <a href=https://www.biglybt.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Bigly</a>) zinaruhusu watumiaji kushiriki torrents za nje ya I2P kwenye I2P, torrents za nje ya I2P zinaweza kupakuliwa kupitia I2P ikiwa watumiaji wa Vuze/Bigly wamechagua kufanya maudhui kupatikana kwenye mtandao wa I2P. Torrents maarufu zenye peer nyingi zina uwezekano mkubwa wa kupatikana kupitia I2P; ili kubaini kama maudhui yanaweza kupatikana, ongeza kiungo cha torrent, magnet au infohash kwenye mteja wako wa BitTorrent uliosanidiwa kwa I2P."

msgid "How do I configure I2P to open at startup in a specific web browser?"
msgstr "Niunganeze I2P ili ifunguke mwanzo kwenye kivinjari maalum cha tovuti?"

msgid "By default, I2P will use the system configured default browser to launch at startup. If you wish to nominate an alternative browser, you will need to edit your router.config file (or the <a href=/configadvanced>Advanced Configuration page</a> if you have enabled advanced console mode) and add a new configuration line <code>routerconsole.browser=/path/to/browser</code> or <code>routerconsole.browser=\\path\\to\\browser.exe</code> if using Windows, replacing <code>\\path\\to\\browser</code> with the location of the browser you wish to use. Note: If the path to your chosen browser contains spaces, you may need to encase the path in quotes e.g. <code>routerconsole.browser=\"C:\\Program Files\\Mozilla\\Firefox.exe\"</code>"
msgstr "Kwa default, I2P itatumia kivinjari cha default kilichosanidiwa na mfumo kufungua mwanzo. Ikiwa ungependa kupendekeza kivinjari mbadala, utahitaji kuhariri faili yako ya router.config (au <a href=/configadvanced>kurasa ya Mipangilio za Juu</a> ikiwa umewasha hali ya juu ya konsola) na kuongeza mstari mpya wa mipangilio <code>routerconsole.browser=/path/to/browser</code> au <code>routerconsole.browser=\\path\\to\\browser.exe</code> ikiwa unatumia Windows, ukibadilisha <code>\\path\\to\\browser</code> na mahali kivinjari kinachotaka kutumia. Kumbuka: Ikiwa njia ya kivinjari kilichochagua ina nafasi, huenda utahitaji kuweka njia ndani ya nukuu za masomo kwa mfano <code>routerconsole.browser=\"C:\\Program Files\\Mozilla\\Firefox.exe\"</code>"

msgid "How do I configure my browser to access .i2p websites?"
msgstr "Niunganeze kivinjari changu ili kufikia tovuti za .i2p?"

msgid "You will need to configure your browser to use the HTTP proxy server (by default on host: <code>127.0.0.1</code> port: <code>4444</code>). See the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/about/browser-config target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Browser Proxy Configuration Guide</a> for a more detailed explanation."
msgstr "Utaahitaji kusanidi kivinjari chako kutumia seva ya proksi ya HTTP (kwa default kwenye mashine: <code>127.0.0.1</code> bandari: <code>4444</code>). Angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/about/browser-config target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Mwongozo wa Mipangilio ya Proksi ya Kivinjari</a> kwa maelezo zaidi."

msgid "What is an eepsite?"
msgstr "Eepsite ni nini?"

msgid "An eepsite is a website that is hosted anonymously on the I2P network - you can access it by configuring your web browser to use I2P's HTTP proxy (see above) and browsing to the <code>.i2p</code> suffixed website (e.g. <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>http://i2p-projekt.i2p</a>). Also ensure your browser is configured to resolve DNS remotely when using the proxy to avoid DNS leaks."
msgstr "Eepsite ni tovuti inayohostiriwa kwa usiri kwenye mtandao wa I2P - unaweza kufikia kwa kusanidi kivinjari chako cha tovuti kutumia proksi ya HTTP ya I2P (tazama hapo juu) na kutembelea tovuti inayomalizwa na <code>.i2p</code> (kwa mfano <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>http://i2p-projekt.i2p</a>). Pia hakikisha kivinjari chako kimeosanidiwa kutatua DNS kijijini unapotumia proksi ili kuepuka kuvuja kwa DNS."

msgid "Most of the eepsites are down?"
msgstr "Je, eepsites nyingi zimeanguka?"

msgid "If you consider every eepsite that has ever been created, yes, most of them are down. People and eepsites come and go. A good way to get started in I2P is check out a list of eepsites that are currently up. <a href=http://notbob.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>http://notbob.i2p</a> tracks active eepsites."
msgstr "Ikiwa unahesabi kila eepsite iliyotengenezwa kamwe, ndiyo, nyingi yake zimeanguka. Watu na eepsites huja na huenda. Njia nzuri ya kuanza kwenye I2P ni kuangalia orodha ya eepsites zilizo sasa zikiwa zinafanya kazi. <a href=http://notbob.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>http://notbob.i2p</a> hufuatilia eepsites zinazofanya kazi."

msgid "Where are my I2P configuration files stored?"
msgstr "Faili zangu za mipangilio ya I2P zimehifadhiwa wapi?"

msgid "Configuration files for the router, installed plugins, and router logs are stored in the following location:"
msgstr "Faili za mipangilio za routeri, viendeshaji vilivyosanidiwa, na kumbukumbu za routeri zinahifadhiwa katika mahali yafuatayo:"

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "OS X"
msgstr "OS X"

msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

msgid "Standard Java Installation"
msgstr "Sakinisho la Kawaida la Java"

msgid "Package / repository installation"
msgstr "Usakinishaji wa kifurushi / kanzidata"

msgid "How do I enable https:// access for the router console?"
msgstr "Niunganeze ufikiaji wa https:// kwa konsola ya routeri?"

msgid "Locate the configuration file: <code>00-net.i2p.router.web.RouterConsoleRunner-clients.config</code> in the <code>clients.config.d</code> folder in your I2P settings directory, and then edit accordingly:"
msgstr "Pata faili ya mipangilio: <code>00-net.i2p.router.web.RouterConsoleRunner-clients.config</code> kwenye folda ya <code>clients.config.d</code> katika katalogi yako ya mipangilio ya I2P, kisha hariri ipasavyo:"

msgid "For both non-SSL and SSL"
msgstr "Kwa zote bila-SSL na SSL"

msgid "For SSL only"
msgstr "Kwa SSL pekee"

msgid "How can I configure the console and web services to be accessible on my local network?"
msgstr "Niunganeze konsola na huduma za tovuti ili zipatikane kwenye mtandao wangu wa ndani?"

msgid "To make your console accessible on your local network, edit the configuration file 00-net.i2p.router.web.RouterConsoleRunner-clients.config in the clients.config.d folder of your I2P settings directory. Update or add the necessary IP addresses to the existing localhost (127.0.0.1) mapping. Use the -s switch for HTTPS access."
msgstr "Ili kufanya konsola yako ipatikane kwenye mtandao wako wa ndani, hariri faili ya mipangilio 00-net.i2p.router.web.RouterConsoleRunner-clients.config katika folda ya clients.config.d ya katalogi yako ya mipangilio ya I2P. Sasisha au ongeza anwani za IP zinazohitajika kwenye ramani ya localhost iliyopo (127.0.0.1). Tumia swichi ya -s kwa ufikiaji wa HTTPS."

msgid "Example: To allow access from both localhost and 192.168.1.10 over HTTP and HTTPS:"
msgstr "Mfano: Ili kuruhusu ufikiaji kutoka localhost na 192.168.1.10 kupitia HTTP na HTTPS:"

msgid "For most client services, change the listening address for the relevant service in the Tunnel Manager's configuration section using the <i>reachable by</i> dropdown."
msgstr "Kwa huduma nyingi za mteja, badilisha anwani ya kusikilizwa ya huduma inayohusika katika sehemu ya mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli kwa kutumia kitufe kushuka cha <i>Inapatikana kwa</i>."

msgid "How do I connect to IRC within I2P?"
msgstr "Niunganeze IRC ndani ya I2P?"

msgid "A tunnel to the main IRC server network within I2P, Irc2P, is created when I2P is installed (see the <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Tunnel Manager</a>), and is automatically started when the I2P router starts. To connect to it, tell your IRC client to connect to server: <code>127.0.0.1</code> port: <code>6668</code>."
msgstr "Tuneli kwa mtandao mkuu wa seva za IRC ndani ya I2P, Irc2P, hutengenezwa I2P inaposanidiwa (tazama <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>), na huanzishwa kiotomatiki mwanzo routeri ya I2P inapowasha. Ili kuunganisha nayo, mwambie mteja wako wa IRC aunganishe kwa seva: <code>127.0.0.1</code> bandari: <code>6668</code>."

msgid "XChat-like client users can create a new network with the server <code>127.0.0.1/6668</code> (remember to tick <i>Bypass proxy server</i> if you have a proxy server configured), or you can connect with the command <code>/server 127.0.0.1 6668</code>. Different IRC clients may vary the syntax."
msgstr "Watumiaji wa mteja kama XChat wanaweza kuunda mtandao mpya kwa seva <code>127.0.0.1/6668</code> (kumbuka kuweka alama kwenye <i>Bypass proxy server</i> ikiwa umesanidi seva ya proksi), au unaweza kuunganisha kwa amri <code>/server 127.0.0.1 6668</code>. Mteja tofauti wa IRC anaweza kubadilisha sintaksia."

msgid "My IRC client keeps disconnecting from the network, is there anything I can do?"
msgstr "Mteja wangu wa IRC anaendelea kukatika muunganisho kutoka kwenye mtandao, kuna chochote ninachoweza kufanya?"

msgid "Some IRC clients are configured to disconnect from the server if there's been no communication with the server for a period of time, which can sometimes be problematic for I2P IRC if the <i>ping timeout</i> value is set too low. Setting the ping timeout value in your client to a high value (e.g. 320 seconds) will often result in a more robust connection to the network. In hexchat you can configure the value by typing <code>/set net_ping_timeout 320</code>. This will write the value to your <code>hexchat.conf</code> file."
msgstr "Baadhi ya wateja wa IRC wamesanidiwa kukatika muunganisho kutoka kwenye seva ikiwa hakuna mawasiliano na seva kwa muda fulani, jambo ambalo linaweza kuleta matatizo kwa IRC ya I2P ikiwa thamani ya <i>ping timeout</i> imewekwa chini sana. Kuweka thamani ya ping timeout katika mteja wako kuwa thamani kubwa (kwa mfano sekunde 320) mara nyingi huwa na muunganisho thabiti zaidi kwenye mtandao. Katika hexchat unaweza kusanidi thamani kwa kuandika <code>/set net_ping_timeout 320</code>. Hii itaandika thamani kwenye faili yako ya <code>hexchat.conf</code>."

msgid "What ports does I2P use?"
msgstr "Bandari zipi zinazotumika na I2P?"

msgid "LOCAL PORTS"
msgstr "BANDARI ZA NDANI"

msgid "These are the local I2P port mappings, listening only to local connections by default, except where noted. Unless you require access from other machines, they should only be accessible from localhost."
msgstr "Haya ni ramani za bandari za ndani za I2P, zikisikiliza tu muunganisho wa ndani kwa default, isipokuwa pale inapotajwa. Isipokuwa unahitaji ufikiaji kutoka kwa mashine nyingine, zinapaswa kupatikana tu kutoka kwa localhost."

msgid "Function"
msgstr "Kazi"

msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Maelezo"

msgid "UPnP SSDP UDP multicast listener"
msgstr "Msikilizaji wa multicast ya UPnP SSDP UDP"

msgid "Cannot be changed. Binds to all interfaces. Can be disabled on the <a href=/confignet>Network Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Haiwezi kubadilishwa. Hujazwa kwenye kiolesura zote. Inaweza kuzimwa kwenye <a href=/confignet>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao</a>."

msgid "BOB bridge"
msgstr "Daraja la BOB"

msgid "A higher level socket API for clients. Can be enabled/disabled on the <a href=/configclients>Client Configuration page</a>. Can be changed in the <code>bob.config</code> file. [Disabled by default]"
msgstr "API ya socket ya kiwango cha juu kwa wateja. Inaweza kuwashwa/kuzimwa kwenye <a href=/configclients>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mteja</a>. Inaweza kubadilishwa katika faili ya <code>bob.config</code>. [Imezimwa kwa default]"

msgid "HTTP proxy"
msgstr "Proksi ya HTTP"

msgid "Can be disabled or changed in the <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Tunnel Manager</a>. Can also be configured to bind to a specific interface or all interfaces."
msgstr "Inaweza kuzimwa au kubadilishwa katika <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>. Pia inaweza kusanidiwa kujazwa kwenye kiolesura mahususi au kiolesura zote."

msgid "HTTPS proxy"
msgstr "Proksi ya HTTPS"

msgid "IRC proxy"
msgstr "Proksi ya IRC"

msgid "UPnP HTTP TCP event listener"
msgstr "Msikilizaji wa matukio ya UPnP HTTP TCP"

msgid "Binds to the LAN address. Can be changed with advanced config <code>i2np.upnp.HTTPPort=nnnn</code>. Can be disabled on the <a href=/confignet>Network Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Hujazwa kwenye anwani ya LAN. Inaweza kubadilishwa kwa mipangilio ya juu <code>i2np.upnp.HTTPPort=nnnn</code>. Inaweza kuzimwa kwenye <a href=/confignet>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao</a>."

msgid "UPnP SSDP UDP search response listener"
msgstr "Msikilizaji wa majibu ya utafutaji wa UPnP SSDP UDP"

msgid "Binds to all interfaces. Can be changed with advanced config <code>i2np.upnp.SSDPPort=nnnn</code>. Can be disabled on the <a href=/configclients>Client Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Hujazwa kwenye kiolesura zote. Inaweza kubadilishwa kwa mipangilio ya juu <code>i2np.upnp.SSDPPort=nnnn</code>. Inaweza kuzimwa kwenye <a href=/configclients>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mteja</a>."

msgid "I2P Client Protocol port"
msgstr "Bandari ya Itifaki ya Mteja ya I2P"

msgid "Used by client apps. Can be changed to a different port on the <a href=/configclients>Client Configuration page</a> but this is not recommended. Can be bound to a different interface or all interfaces, or disabled, on the <a href=/configclients>Client Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Inatumika na programu za wateja. Inaweza kubadilishwa kuwa bandari nyingine kwenye <a href=/configclients>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mteja</a> lakini hii haipendekezwi. Inaweza kujazwa kwenye kiolesura tofauti au kiolesura zote, au kuzimwa, kwenye <a href=/configclients>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mteja</a>."

msgid "UDP for SAM bridge"
msgstr "UDP kwa daraja la SAM"

msgid "A higher level socket API for clients. Only opened when a SAM V3 client requests a UDP session. Can be enabled/disabled on the <a href=/configclients> Client Configuration page</a>. Can be changed in the <code>clients.config</code> file with the SAM command line option <code>sam.udp.port=nnnn</code>."
msgstr "API ya socket ya kiwango cha juu kwa wateja. Inafunguliwa tu pale mteja wa SAM V3 anapoomba kipindi cha UDP. Inaweza kuwashwa/kuzimwa kwenye <a href=/configclients> kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mteja</a>. Inaweza kubadilishwa katika faili ya <code>clients.config</code> kwa chaguo la amri ya SAM <code>sam.udp.port=nnnn</code>."

msgid "SAM bridge"
msgstr "Daraja la SAM"

msgid "A higher level socket API for clients. Can be enabled/disabled on the <a href=/configclients>Client Configuration page</a>. Can be changed in the <code>clients.config</code> file. [Disabled by default]"
msgstr "API ya socket ya kiwango cha juu kwa wateja. Inaweza kuwashwa/kuzimwa kwenye <a href=/configclients>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mteja</a>. Inaweza kubadilishwa katika faili ya <code>clients.config</code>. [Imezimwa kwa default]"

msgid "I2P Router Console (Web interface)"
msgstr "Konsola ya Routeri ya I2P (kiolesura ya Web)"

msgid "Can be disabled in the <code>clients.config</code> file. Can also be configured to bind to a specific interface or all interfaces. If you make the Router Console available over the network, you might wish to <a href=/configui#passwordheading>enforce an access password</a> to prevent unauthorized access."
msgstr "Inaweza kuzimwa katika faili ya <code>clients.config</code>. Pia inaweza kusanidiwa kujazwa kwenye kiolesura mahususi au kiolesura zote. Ukifanya Konsola ya Routeri ipatikane kwenye mtandao, unaweza kutaka <a href=/configui#passwordheading>kulazimisha nenosiri wa ufikiaji</a> ili kuzuia ufikiaji bila idhini."

msgid "Can be disabled in the <code>clients.config</code> file. Can also be configured to bind to a specific interface or all interfaces in the <code>jetty.xml</code> file."
msgstr "Inaweza kuzimwa katika faili ya <code>clients.config</code>. Pia inaweza kusanidiwa kujazwa kwenye kiolesura mahususi au kiolesura zote katika faili ya <code>jetty.xml</code>."

msgid "Outgoing mail to smtp.postman.i2p"
msgstr "Barua zinazotoka kwa smtp.postman.i2p"

msgid "Incoming mail from pop.postman.i2p"
msgstr "Barua zinazoingia kutoka pop.postman.i2p"

msgid "I2P Router Console (https://)"
msgstr "Konsola ya Routeri ya I2P (https://)"

msgid "Can be enabled in the <code>clients.config</code> file. Can also be configured to bind to a specific interface or all interfaces. If both http and https are enabled, automatic redirection to https is enabled by default. If you make the Router Console available over the network, you might wish to <a href=/configui#passwordheading>enforce an access password</a> to prevent unauthorized access."
msgstr "Inaweza kuwashwa katika faili ya <code>clients.config</code>. Pia inaweza kusanidiwa kujazwa kwenye kiolesura mahususi au kiolesura zote. Ikiwa http na https zote zimewashwa, kuelekezwa kwa kiotomatiki kwa https kunawashwa kwa default. Ukifanya Konsola ya Routeri ipatikane kwenye mtandao, unaweza kutaka <a href=/configui#passwordheading>kulazimisha nenosiri wa ufikiaji</a> ili kuzuia ufikiaji bila idhini."

msgid "Local connection to wrapper control channel port"
msgstr "Muunganisho wa ndani kwenye bandari ya kituo cha udhibiti cha wrapper"

msgid "Outbound to 32000 only, does not listen on this port. Starts at 31000 and will increment until 31999 looking for a free port. To change, see the <a href=https://wrapper.tanukisoftware.com/doc/english/prop-port.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>wrapper documentation</a>."
msgstr "Kutoka kwa 32000 pekee, haisikilizi kwenye bandari hii. Inaanza kwenye 31000 na itaendelea hadi 31999 ikipata bandari ya bure. Kubadilisha, angalia <a href=https://wrapper.tanukisoftware.com/doc/english/prop-port.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>nyaraka za wrapper</a>."

msgid "Local control channel for the service wrapper"
msgstr "Kituo cha udhibiti cha ndani kwa wrapper wa huduma"

msgid "To change, see the <a href=https://wrapper.tanukisoftware.com/doc/english/prop-port.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>wrapper documentation</a>."
msgstr "Kubadilisha, angalia <a href=https://wrapper.tanukisoftware.com/doc/english/prop-port.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>nyaraka za wrapper</a>."

msgid "INTERNET FACING PORTS"
msgstr "BANDARI ZINAZOEKELEA INTERNETI"

msgid "I2P selects a random port between 9000 and 31000 to communicate with other routers when the program is run for the first time, or when your external IP address changes when running in <a href=/confignet#ipchange>Laptop Mode</a>. The <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>selected port</a> is shown on the <a href=/confignet>Network Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "I2P inachagua bandari ya nasibu kati ya 9000 na 31000 ili kuwasiliana na routeri nyingine pale programu inapokelwa kwa mara ya kwanza, au pale anwani yako ya IP ya nje inapobadilika unapofanya kazi katika <a href=/confignet#ipchange>Modi ya laptop</a>. <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>Bandari iliyochaguliwa</a> inaonyeshwa kwenye <a href=/confignet>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao</a>."

msgid "Outbound UDP from the <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>random port</a> noted on the Network Configuration page to arbitrary remote UDP ports, allowing replies."
msgstr "Kutoka kwa UDP kutoka <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>bandari ya nasibu</a> iliyoandikwa kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao kwenda kwenye bandari za UDP za mbali zozote, kuruhusu majibu."

msgid "Outbound TCP from random high ports to arbitrary remote TCP ports."
msgstr "Kutoka kwa TCP kutoka bandari za nasibu za juu kwenda kwenye bandari za TCP za mbali zozote."

msgid "Inbound UDP to the <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>port</a> noted on the Network Configuration page from arbitrary locations (optional, but recommended)."
msgstr "Kuingia kwa UDP kwenye <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>bandari</a> iliyoandikwa kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao kutoka maeneo yoyote (si lazima, lakini inavyopendekezwa)."

msgid "Inbound TCP to the <a href=/confignet#externaltcp>port</a> noted on the Network Configuration page from arbitrary locations (optional, but recommended). <a href=/confignet#tcpconfig>Inbound TCP</a> may be disabled on the Network Configuration page."
msgstr "Kuingia kwa TCP kwenye <a href=/confignet#externaltcp>bandari</a> iliyoandikwa kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao kutoka maeneo yoyote (si lazima, lakini inavyopendekezwa). <a href=/confignet#tcpconfig>TCP ya kuingia</a> inaweza kuzimwa kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao."

msgid "Outbound UDP on port 123, allowing replies: this is necessary for I2P's internal time sync (via SNTP - querying a random SNTP host in <code>pool.ntp.org</code> or <a href=/help/advancedsettings#ntpserverconfig>another server you specify</a>)."
msgstr "Kutoka kwa UDP kwenye bandari 123, kuruhusu majibu: hii inahitajika kwa kusawazisha muda wa ndani ya I2P (kwa njia ya SNTP - kuuliza mashine ya SNTP ya nasibu katika <code>pool.ntp.org</code> au <a href=/help/advancedsettings#ntpserverconfig>seva nyingine unayobainisha</a>)."

msgid "I2P Terminology"
msgstr "Msamiati wa I2P"

msgid "An I2P web application that manages service destinations for the network, mapping B64 hashes to human-readable names. Destinations may be added manually, or via subscriptions to hosts.txt files. Also referred to as SusiDNS. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/naming class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "Programu ya tovuti ya I2P inayosimamia malengo ya huduma kwa mtandao, ikiringanisha hashi za B64 na majina yanayosomeka na binu. Malengo yanaweza kuongezwa kwa mkono, au kupitia usajili wa faili za hosts.txt. Pia inarejewa kama SusiDNS. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/naming class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "Base32 (B32) / Base64 (B64)"
msgstr "Base32 (B32) / Base64 (B64)"

msgid "A <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base32 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Base32</a> link (which always ends with .b32.i2p) is a hash of a <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base64 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Base64</a> destination. For services on the network, the Base64 hash is often mapped to an .i2p domain in the addressbook."
msgstr "Kiungo cha <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base32 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Base32</a> (kinachomalizika kwa .b32.i2p) ni hashi ya lengo la <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base64 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Base64</a>. Kwa huduma kwenye mtandao, hashi ya Base64 mara nyingi huringanishwa na domaini ya .i2p katika kitabu cha anwani."

msgid "B33"
msgstr "B33"

msgid "An address containing an encrypted LeaseSet is informally referred to as a b33 address, an extension of a base32 address with the host's public key and signature type encoded into the address instead of a lookup hash. This address type is required for blinded Leasesets. More information: <a href=https://geti2p.net/spec/b32encrypted class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>B33 Specification</a>"
msgstr "Anwani yenye LeaseSet iliyosimbuziwa hujulikanwa kwa sifa kama anwani ya b33, kiendelezo cha anwani ya base32 ambapo ufafanuzi wa umma wa mashine umewekwa ndani ya anwani, pamoja na aina ya saini, badala ya hashi ya kutatua. Aina hii ya anwani inahitajika kwa LeaseSet zilizofichwa. Taarifa zaidi: <a href=https://geti2p.net/spec/b32encrypted class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Maelezo ya B33</a>"

msgid "BOB"
msgstr "BOB"

msgid "BOB (Basic Open Bridge) is a (now-deprecated) simple application-to-router protocol, superseded by <i>SAM</i>. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/api/bob class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "BOB (Basic Open Bridge) ni itifaki rahisi ya programu-kwa-routeri (ambayo sasa imewekwa pembe), ambayo imechukuliwa na <i>SAM</i>. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/api/bob class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "Clearnet"
msgstr "Clearnet"

msgid "Clearnet normally refers to the publicly accessible internet, the opposite of the darknet that typically describes the encrypted, anonymous services built on I2P, Tor etc. For more information, see the <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clearnet_(networking) class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Wikipedia article</a>."
msgstr "Clearnet kwa kawaida humaanisha Interneti inayofikika na umma, kiwa tofauti na darknet ambayo kwa kawaida hufafanua huduma zilizosimbuziwa, hazitoiwi, zilizoundwa kwenye I2P, Tor na kadhalika. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clearnet_(networking) class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>makala ya Wikipedia</a>."

msgid "The unique cryptographic identity of the inbound endpoint of a tunnel providing access to a service on the I2P network, represented as a Base32 or Base64 hash of the public key. Equivalent to an IP address and port."
msgstr "Utambulisho pekee wa usimbuzi wa kiendelezo cha kuingia cha tuneli inayotoa ufikiaji wa huduma kwenye mtandao wa I2P, ulioonyeshwa kama hashi ya Base32 au Base64 ya ufafanuzi wa umma. Sawa na anwani ya IP na bandari."

msgid "Eepget"
msgstr "Eepget"

msgid "A command-line application supplied with I2P that is used to request URL resources, similar to <a href=https://www.gnu.org/software/wget/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>wget</a> or <a href=https://curl.haxx.se/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>curl</a>. Eepget is also used internally by the router, for example to reseed from remote hosts. By default, eepget uses the HTTP proxy on <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>."
msgstr "Programu ya amri ya mistari inayotolewa na I2P inayotumika kuomba rasilizi za URL, kama <a href=https://www.gnu.org/software/wget/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>wget</a> au <a href=https://curl.haxx.se/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>curl</a>. Eepget pia inatumika ndani ya routeri, kwa mfano kufanya reseed kutoka kwa mashine za mbali. Kwa default, eepget inatumia proksi ya HTTP kwenye <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>."

msgid "Eephead"
msgstr "Eephead"

msgid "A command-line application supplied with I2P+ (Linux/MacOS) that is used to perform a <code>head</code> request on a specified http resource on the network, returning various response headers from the remote server. By default, eephead uses the HTTP proxy on <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>."
msgstr "Programu ya amri ya mistari inayotolewa na I2P+ (Linux/MacOS) inayotumika kufanya ombi la <code>head</code> kwenye rasilizi ya http iliyobainishwa kwenye mtandao, ikirudisha vichwa tofauti vya majibu kutoka kwenye seva ya mbali. Kwa default, eephead inatumia proksi ya HTTP kwenye <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>."

msgid "Eepsite"
msgstr "Eepsite"

msgid "A website hosted on the I2P network. By default, a <a href=https://www.eclipse.org/jetty/about.html class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Jetty webserver</a> is configured and running on <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>http://127.0.0.1:7658/</a>."
msgstr "Tovuti inayohostiwa kwenye mtandao wa I2P. Kwa default, <a href=https://www.eclipse.org/jetty/about.html class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>seva ya tovuti ya Jetty</a> imesanidiwa na inafanya kazi kwenye <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>http://127.0.0.1:7658/</a>."

msgid "Exploratory Tunnel"
msgstr "Tuneli ya Uchunguzi"

msgid "A tunnel used by the router for communicating with other routers to perform various \"housekeeping\" functions such as learning and publishing <i>leasesets</i>, testing client tunnels, and learning about and validating other routers in the network. These tunnels are normally low-bandwidth."
msgstr "Tuneli inayotumika na routeri kwa kuwasiliana na routeri nyingine ili kutekeleza kazi mbalimbali za \"usafi wa nyumba\" kama kujifunza na kuchapisha <i>leasesets</i>, kujaribu tuneli za wateja, na kujifunza kuhusu na kuthibitisha routeri nyingine kwenye mtandao. Tuneli hizi kwa kawaida zina kasi ndogo."

msgid "A router on the network tasked with providing and receiving information about other routers and services on the network. The current minimum share bandwidth for a router to be considered as capable of performing floodfill duties is 128 KBytes/sec, though it's possible to override this requirement and force a router to be a floodfill on the <a href=/configadvanced>Advanced Configuration page</a>. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/how/network-database#floodfill class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "Routeri kwenye mtandao yenye jukumu la kutoa na kupokea taarifa kuhusu routeri nyingine na huduma kwenye mtandao. Kasi ya kushiriki ndogo zaidi ambayo sasa inahitajika ili routeri izingatiewe kuwa na uwezo wa kutekeleza majukumu ya floodfill ni 128 KBytes/sec, ingawa inawezekana kukiuka mahitaji haya na kulazimisha routeri iwe floodfill kwenye <a href=/configadvanced>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Juu</a>. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/how/network-database#floodfill class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "Garlic Routing"
msgstr "Uelekezaji wa Vitunguu"

msgid "A variant of onion routing that encrypts multiple messages together to make it more difficult for attackers to perform traffic analysis and to increase the speed of data transfer. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/how/garlic-routing class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "Aina ya uelekezaji wa vitunguu inayohusimbuzi ujumbe mwingi pamoja ili kufanya iwe vigumu zaidi kwa washambuziaji kufanya uchambuzi wa trafiki na kuongeza kasi ya uhamisho wa data. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/how/garlic-routing class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "Hidden Mode"
msgstr "Modi ya siri"

msgid "A router configured to run in Hidden Mode will not publish its details to the <i>Network Database</i> and will not participate in routing traffic for other routers. Routers operating in countries designated as strict and routers manually configured run in Hidden Mode."
msgstr "Routeri iliyosanidiwa kufanya kazi katika Modi ya siri haitachapisha taarifa zake kwenye <i>Kanzidata ya Mtandao</i> na hayatashiriki katika kuelekeza trafiki kwa routeri nyingine. Routeri zinazofanya kazi katika nchi zilizotenguliwa kama kali na routeri zilizosanidiwa kwa mkono hufanya kazi katika Modi ya siri."

msgid "The I2P Client Protocol (I2CP) enables external applications (clients) to communicate with I2P over single TCP socket, by default using port 7654. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/protocol/i2cp class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "Itifaki ya Mteja ya I2P (I2CP) huwezesha programu za nje (wateja) kuwasiliana na I2P kupitia socket moja ya TCP, kwa kutumia bandari 7654 kwa default. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/protocol/i2cp class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "I2NP"
msgstr "I2NP"

msgid "The I2P Network Protocol (I2NP) manages the routing and mixing of messages between routers, in addition to the transport selection (where more than one is supported) when communicating with a peer. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/protocol/i2np class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "Itifaki ya Mtandao ya I2P (I2NP) inadhibiti uelekezaji na kuchanganya ujumbe kati ya routeri, pamoja na uteuzi wa usafirishaji (mahali ambapo zaidi ya moja zinasaidwa) inapowasiliana na peer. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/protocol/i2np class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "I2P+"
msgstr "I2P+"

msgid "A soft fork of the Java I2P software which retains full compatibility, providing an enhanced user interface and improvements to network performance. See <a href=http://skank.i2p/ class=sitelink target=_blank rel=noreferrer>http://skank.i2p/</a> or <a href=https://i2pplus.github.io class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>https://i2pplus.github.io</a>for more information."
msgstr "Mgao laini la programu ya I2P ya Java linalohifadhi utevu kamili, na kutoa kiolesura bora cha mtumiaji na maboresho ya utendaji wa mtandao. Angalia <a href=http://skank.i2p/ class=sitelink target=_blank rel=noreferrer>http://skank.i2p/</a> au <a href=https://i2pplus.github.io class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>https://i2pplus.github.io</a>kwa taarifa zaidi."

msgid "I2PBote (plugin)"
msgstr "I2PBote (kiendeshaji)"

msgid "An unmaintained I2P plugin that provides serverless, end-to-end encrypted e-mail within the I2P network. For more information, see <a href=http://bote.i2p/ class=sitelink target=_blank rel=noreferrer>http://bote.i2p/</a>. Source code is available on <a href=https://github.com/i2p/i2p.i2p-bote class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."
msgstr "Kiendeshaji cha I2P kisichodumishwa kinachotoa barua pepe zilizosimbuziwa kwa njia ya mwisho-mwisho bila seva ndani ya mtandao wa I2P. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=http://bote.i2p/ class=sitelink target=_blank rel=noreferrer>http://bote.i2p/</a>. Msimbo wa chanzo upo kwenye <a href=https://github.com/i2p/i2p.i2p-bote class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."

msgid "i2pd"
msgstr "i2pd"

msgid "An alternative implementation of an I2P router coded in C++. For more information, see <a href=https://i2pd.website/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>https://i2pd.website/</a> Source code is available on <a href=https://github.com/PurpleI2P/i2pd class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."
msgstr "Utekelezaji mbadala wa routeri ya I2P ulioandikwa kwa C++. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://i2pd.website/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>https://i2pd.website/</a> Msimbo wa chanzo upo kwenye <a href=https://github.com/PurpleI2P/i2pd class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."

msgid "A fork of the <a href=http://www.klomp.org/snark/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Snark BitTorrent client</a> refactored for use on the I2P network. Usually supplied as part of the default suite of applications with Java I2P, and also available as a <a href=http://skank.i2p/#download class=sitelink target=_blank rel=noreferrer>standalone Java application</a>."
msgstr "Mgao wa <a href=http://www.klomp.org/snark/ class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>mteja wa Snark BitTorrent</a> iliyobadilishwa kwa ajili ya matumizi kwenye mtandao wa I2P. Kawaida hutoa kama sehemu ya pakiti chaguo-msaidi ya programu na Java I2P, na pia inapatikana kama <a href=http://skank.i2p/#download class=sitelink target=_blank rel=noreferrer>programu ya Java iliyojitegemea</a>."

msgid "Introducer"
msgstr "Mtumabulishi"

msgid "A router that facilitates the connection to the network of another router that is behind a firewall."
msgstr "Routeri inayorahisha muunganisho kwenye mtandao wa routeri nyingine iliyo nyuma ya firewall."

msgid "Jump Service"
msgstr "Huduma ya Kuvuka"

msgid "A simple CGI application that takes a hostname as a parameter and returns a 301 redirect to the proper URL with a <code>?i2paddresshelper=key</code> string appended. The HTTP proxy will interpret the appended string and use the key as the actual destination. In addition, the proxy will cache the key so the address helper is not necessary until restart, and offer the option to add the resolved address to the addressbook."
msgstr "Programu rahisi ya CGI inayochukua jina la mashine kama kiakili na kurudisha uelekezaji wa 301 kwenye URL inayofaa ikiwa kimefuatawa na mfuatano wa <code>?i2paddresshelper=key</code>. Proksi ya HTTP itasimba mfuatano huo na kutumia ufafanuzi kama lengo halisi. Zaidi ya hayo, proksi itahifadhi ufafanuzi ili msaidia wa anwani usizehitajiki hadi kuanzisha upya, na kutoa chaguo la kuongeza anwani iliyotatuliwa kwenye kitabu cha anwani."

msgid "Laptop Mode"
msgstr "Modi ya laptop"

msgid "An <a href=/confignet#ipchange>optional configuration</a> that automatically changes your <a href=/netdb?show=local>router identity</a> and <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>external port</a> when the public ip address your system is on changes. This can prevent an adversary from correlating your router identity and ip address in scenarios where your ip address may change frequently, for example when you're running I2P on a laptop from multiple locations."
msgstr "Mipangilio ya <a href=/confignet#ipchange>hiari</a> inayobadilisha kiotomatiki <a href=/netdb?show=local>utambulisho wako wa routeri</a> na <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>bandari yako ya nje</a> pale anwani ya ip za umma ambayo mfumo wako upo inabadilika. Hii inaweza kuzuia mpinzani kutoa muhusisho kati ya utambulisho wako wa routeri na anwani ya ip katika hali ambapo anwani yako ya ip inaweza kubadilika mara kwa mara, kwa mfano unapofanya kazi ya I2P kwenye laptop kutoka maeneo mengi."

msgid "Lease"
msgstr "Lease"

msgid "The information that defines the authorization for a particular tunnel to receive messages targeting a <i>Destination</i>."
msgstr "Taarifa zinazodhibiti idhini ya tuneli fulani kupokea ujumbe unaolenga <i>Lengo</i>."

msgid "A group of tunnel entry points (leases) for a <i>destination</i>. Note: A 0-hop server tunnel will only have one lease, regardless of the number of tunnels configured."
msgstr "Kundi la vituo vya kuingia kwa tuneli (lease) vya <i>lengo</i>. Kumbuka: Tuneli ya seva ya 0-hop itaishiwa kuwa na lease moja pekee, bila kujali idadi ya tuneli zilizosanidiwa."

msgid "Monotone / mtn"
msgstr "Monotone / mtn"

msgid "The distributed version control system (DVCS) previously used to maintain I2P's source code, now superseded by git."
msgstr "Mfumo wa udhibiti wa toleo kiliyosambazwa (DVCS) uliotumika awali kudumisha msimbo wa chanzo wa I2P, sasa kimechukuliwa na git."

msgid "Multihoming"
msgstr "Multihoming"

msgid "Services may be hosted on multiple routers simultaneously, by sharing the same private key for the destination. Multihoming can further enhance the security and stability of a server by providing redundancy; if a server is multihomed, when a server in the pool goes offline, the provided service will remain available, making it more difficult to correlate server downtime with a router going offline."
msgstr "Huduma zinaweza kuhostiwa kwenye routeri nyingi kwa wakati mmoja, kwa kushiriki ufafanuzi bina huo kwa lengo. Multihoming inaweza zaidi kuboresha usalama na utulivu wa seva kwa kutoa nakala rudufu; ikiwa seva imewekwa Multihoming, seva moja kati ya zile inapofika kuwa nje ya mtandao basi huduma inayotolewa itaendelea kupatikana, na kufanya iwe vigumu zaidi kutoa muhusisho kati ya muda wa seva kushindwa na muda wa routeri kushindwa."

msgid "A distributed database containing router contact information (RouterInfos) and destination contact information (LeaseSets). A single router maintains its own (partial) database for communicating with other routers on the network; no single router will maintain a list of all routers. The RouterInfos are stored on disk and read into memory when the router starts, or when new RouterInfos are acquired. Also referred to as the <i>NetDb</i>. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/how/network-database class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "Kanzidata iliyosambazwa yenye taarifa za mawasiliano ya routeri (RouterInfos) na taarifa za mawasiliano ya malengo (LeaseSets). Routeri moja inadumisha kanzidata yake (sehemu) kwa kuwasiliana na routeri nyingine kwenye mtandao; hakuna routeri moja itakayodumisha orodha ya routeri zote. RouterInfos huhifadhiwa kwenye diski na kusomwa kwenye kumbukumbu pale routeri inapoanza, au pale RouterInfos mpya inapopatikana. Pia inarejewa kama <i>NetDb</i>. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/how/network-database class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "NTCP / NTCP2"
msgstr "NTCP / NTCP2"

msgid "NTCP (NIO-based TCP) and NTCP2 are TCP-based network transports which use Java's NIO (New I/O) TCP implementation to deliver I2NP messages between routers on the network. NTCP2 improves the resistance of NTCP to various attacks and automated traffic identification methods. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/transport/ntcp class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "NTCP (NIO-based TCP) na NTCP2 ni usafirishaji wa mtandao kwa msingi wa TCP ambao hutumia utekelezaji wa TCP wa NIO (New I/O) wa Java kubeba ujumbe wa I2NP kati ya routeri kwenye mtandao. NTCP2 huboresha uzuiaji wa NTCP kwa mashambuliko mbalimbali na mbinu za utambuzi wa trafiki za moja kwa moja. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/transport/ntcp class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "Orchid (plugin)"
msgstr "Orchid (kiendeshaji)"

msgid "A java implementation of a Tor client, available as an I2P plugin. Can be used as the default <i>outproxy</i> if configured in the relevant SOCKS or HTTP client tunnel in the <i>Tunnel Manager</i>. Available from <a href=http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins class=sitelink>http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins</a>. Source code is available on <a href=https://github.com/i2p/i2p.plugins.orchid class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."
msgstr "Utekelezaji wa Java wa mteja wa Tor, unaopatikana kama kiendeshaji cha I2P. Unaweza kutumika kama <i>outproxy</i> wa default ikiwa umesanidiwa katika tuneli ya mteja ya SOCKS au HTTP inayohusika katika <i>Msimamizi wa Tuneli</i>. Unapatikana kutoka <a href=http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins class=sitelink>http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins</a>. Msimbo wa chanzo upo kwenye <a href=https://github.com/i2p/i2p.plugins.orchid class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."

msgid "Outproxy"
msgstr "Outproxy"

msgid "A service on the network that provides a proxy connection to the <i>clearnet</i>. By default, I2P has an HTTP outproxy configured for web browsing on <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>."
msgstr "Huduma kwenye mtandao inayotoa muunganisho wa proksi kwa <i>clearnet</i>. Kwa default, I2P ina outproxy ya HTTP iliyosanidiwa kwa kuvutua tovuti kwenye <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>."

msgid "Participation"
msgstr "Ushiriki"

msgid "The act of contributing to the network by permitting other routers to build tunnels using your router in a tunnel chain. At least 12KB/s upstream bandwidth (network share) is required to be allocated in order to enable participation. Note that firewalled routers will be limited in how much they contribute to participation, and a router designated as Hidden will not participate at all."
msgstr "Kitendo cha kuchangia kwenye mtandao kwa kuruhusu routeri nyingi kujenga tuneli zinazotumia routeri yako katika mnyororo wa tuneli. Kasi ya upstream ya angalau 12KB/s (ushiriki wa mtandao) inahitajika kutengwa ili kuwezesha ushiriki. Kumbuka kwamba routeri zilizozuliwa na firewall zitakuwa na mipaka jinsi ya zinavyochangia ushiriki, na routeri iliyotenguliwa kuwa ya siri haitaushiriki kabisa."

msgid "The process of acquiring router identities, normally via <i>clearnet</i> servers, to ensure your router can communicate and build tunnels with other routers on the network. When a router has no router identities for other peers (usually immediately after installation), the process of reseeding is also referred to as <i>bootstrapping</i>."
msgstr "Mchakato wa kupata utambulisho wa routeri, kwa kawaida kupitia seva za <i>clearnet</i>, ili kuhakikisha routeri yako inaweza kuwasiliana na kujenga tuneli na routeri nyingine kwenye mtandao. Pale routeri hana utambulisho wa routeri kwa peer nyingine (mara nyingi mara tu baada ya kusakinishwa), mchakato wa reseed pia kinajulikana kama <i>bootstrapping</i>."

msgid "The core I2P software, which routes encrypted packets on the I2P network. All routers by default participate in the network except routers running in countries considered hostile (see <i>Strict Countries</i>), which both helps the network and provides cover traffic for any clients or servers connecting to the I2P network through the router."
msgstr "Programu ya msingi ya I2P, inayopeleka pakiti zilizosimbuziwa kwenye mtandao wa I2P. Routeri zote kwa default zinashiriki kwenye mtandao isipokuwa routeri zinazofanya kazi katika nchi zinazohukuliwa kuwa adimu (tazama <i>Nchi Kali</i>), jambo linalosaidia mtandao na kutoa trafiki ya kuficha kwa wateja au seva wowote unaounganisha kwenye mtandao wa I2P kupitia routeri."

msgid "Router Identity"
msgstr "Utambulisho wa Routeri"

msgid "Information defining the unique identity of a router on the network which includes its IP address (or the IP addresses of intermediate introducers) and listening port, public signing and encryption keys. Router identities correlate to peers in the NetDB. Also referred to as a <i>RouterInfo</i>."
msgstr "Taarifa zinazodhibiti utambulisho pekee wa routeri kwenye mtandao ambazo zinajumuisha anwani yake ya IP (au anwani za IP za watumabulishaji wa kati) na bandari inayosikilizwa, ufafanuzi wa umma wa saini na usimbuzi. Utambulisho wa routeri kinalungana na peer katika NetDB. Pia unarejewa kama <i>RouterInfo</i>."

msgid "SAM (Simple Anonymous Messaging) is a protocol which allows a client application written in any programming language to communicate over I2P, by using a socket-based interface to the I2P router. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/api/samv3 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "SAM (Simple Anonymous Messaging) ni itifaki inayoruhusu programu ya mteja iliyoandikwa katika lugha yoyote ya kuprogramu kuwasiliana kupitia I2P, kwa kutumia kiolesura kinachotumika kwenye socket kwa routeri ya I2P. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/api/samv3 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "Shared Client"
msgstr "Mteja wa Kushiriki"

msgid "In order to use a single set of tunnels for multiple client services, clients can be configured from the <i>Tunnel Manager</i> to operate in <i>Shared Client</i> mode. This mode conserves resources and blends the traffic from multiple clients into a single set of tunnels, making traffic analysis harder. Clients configured as Shared Clients share the same tunnel options."
msgstr "Ili kutumia seti moja ya tuneli kwa huduma nyingi za wateja, wateja wanaweza kusanidiwa kutoka <i>Msimamizi wa Tuneli</i> ili kufanya kazi katika modi ya <i>Mteja wa Kushiriki</i>. Modi hii inhifadhi rasilimali na kuchanganya trafiki kutoka kwa wateja wengi kwenye seti moja ya tuneli, na kufanya uchambuzi wa trafiki kuwa mgumu zaidi. Wateja waliosanidiwa kama Wateja wa Kushiriki wanashiriki vichaguo vile vile vya tuneli."

msgid "SSU (Secure Semi-reliable UDP) is an I2P network transport providing encrypted, connection-oriented, point-to-point connections, in addition to IP address detection and NAT traversal services. For more information, see the <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/transport/ssu class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>online documentation</a>."
msgstr "SSU (Secure Semi-reliable UDP) ni usafirishaji wa mtandao wa I2P unaotoa muunganisho kiliyosimbuziwa, kinachotokana na muunganisho, na muunganisho wa nukta-kwa-nukta, pamoja na huduma za kugundua anwani ya IP na kuvuka NAT. Kwa taarifa zaidi, angalia <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/transport/ssu class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>nyaraka za mtandaoni</a>."

msgid "Strict Countries"
msgstr "Nchi Kali"

msgid "A list of countries derived from the <a href=https://freedomhouse.org/report/countries-world-freedom-2019 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>World Freedom Report</a> with a poor civil liberties reputation. This list is used to place routers running in the specified countries in <i>Hidden Mode</i> to provide enhanced security for users. The following countries are designated as strict: Afghanistan, Azerbaijan, Bahrain, Belarus, Brunei, Burundi, Cameroon, Central African Republic, Chad, China, Cuba, Democratic Republic of the Congo, Egypt, Equatorial Guinea, Eritrea, Ethiopia, Iran, Kazakhstan, Laos, Libya, Myanmar, North Korea, Palestinian Territories, Rwanda, Saudi Arabia, Somalia, South Sudan, Sudan, Eswatini (Swaziland), Syria, Tajikistan, Thailand, Turkey, Turkmenistan, Venezuela, United Arab Emirates, Uzbekistan, Western Sahara, Yemen."
msgstr "Orodha ya nchi iliyotokana na <a href=https://freedomhouse.org/report/countries-world-freedom-2019 class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Ripoti ya Uhuru wa dunia</a> yenye sifa mbaya ya haki za raia. Orodha hii hutumika kwa kuweka routeri zinazofanya kazi katika nchi zilizotajwa katika <i>Modi ya siri</i> ili kutoa usalama ulioimarishwa kwa watumiaji. Nchi zinazotajwa kama kali ni: Afuganisitani, Azabajjani, Bahrain, Belarusi, Brunei, Burundi, Kamerun, Jamhuri ya Afrika ya Kati, Chadi, China, Cuba, Kongo ya Kidemokrasia, Misri, Gine ya Ikweta, Eritrea, Ethiopia, Irani, Kazakistani, Laos, Libya, Myanmar, Korea Kaskazini, Teritoriji za Palestini, Ruanda, Arabia Saudi, Somalia, Sudani Kusini, Sudani, Eswatini (Swaziland), Syria, Tajikistan, Thailand, Turuki, Turkmenistan, Venezuela, Falme za Kiarabu, Uzbekistan, Sahara Magharibi, Yemen."

msgid "A <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/tunnels/unidirectional class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>unidirectional</a> encrypted communication pathway between a client or server on the I2P network. Similar to a circuit in Tor, except that Tor circuits are bidirectional."
msgstr "Njia ya mawasiliano iliyosimbuziwa <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/docs/tunnels/unidirectional class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>moja kwa moja</a> kati ya mteja au seva kwenye mtandao wa I2P. Kama mzunguko katika Tor, isipokuwa mizunguko ya Tor ni ya pande mbili."

msgid "Tunnel Endpoint"
msgstr "Mwisho wa Tuneli"

msgid "The last router in a tunnel, which may be the <i>Outbound Endpoint</i>, where the client's tunnels meet the <i>Inbound Gateway</i> of the destination server's tunnels, or the <i>Inbound Endpoint</i> which is the final router in the chain that connects to the destination server."
msgstr "Routeri ya mwisho katika tuneli, ambacho inaweza kuwa <i>Mwisho wa Kutoka</i>, mahali ambapo tuneli za mteja hukutana na <i>Lango la Kuingia</i> la tuneli za seva lengwa, au <i>Mwisho wa Kuingia</i> ambacho ni routeri ya mwisho katika mnyororo unaounganisha kwa seva lengwa."

msgid "Tunnel Gateway"
msgstr "Lango la Tuneli"

msgid "The first router in a tunnel. For inbound tunnels, this is the one mentioned in the <i>LeaseSet</i> published in the <i>Network Database</i>. For outbound tunnels, the gateway is the originating router."
msgstr "Routeri ya kwanza katika tuneli. Kwa tuneli za kuingia, hii ndiyo iliyotajwa katika <i>LeaseSet</i> iliyochapishwa katika <i>Kanzidata ya Mtandao</i>. Kwa tuneli za kutoka, lango ni routeri ya asili."

msgid "A web application supplied with the router that permits creation and configuration of client and server tunnels. Also referred to as the <i>Hidden Services Manager</i>."
msgstr "Programu ya tovuti inayotolewa na routeri inayoruhusu kuunda na kusanidia tuneli za wateja na za seva. Pia inarejewa kama <i>Msimamizi wa Huduma za Siri</i>."

msgid "Tunnel Participant"
msgstr "Mshiriki wa Tuneli"

msgid "A router in a tunnel not designated as a gateway or endpoint."
msgstr "Routeri katika tuneli isiyotenguliwa kuwa lango au mwisho."

msgid "ZzzOT (plugin)"
msgstr "ZzzOT (kiendeshaji)"

msgid "A Java I2P plugin implementation of a BitTorrent <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opentracker class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Open Tracker</a>. Available from <a href=http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins class=sitelink>http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins</a>. Source code is available on <a href=https://github.com/i2p/i2p.plugins.zzzot class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."
msgstr "Utekelezaji wa kiendeshaji cha I2P cha Java wa <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opentracker class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Tracker ya wazi</a> ya BitTorrent. Unapatikana kutoka <a href=http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins class=sitelink>http://stats.i2p/i2p/plugins</a>. Msimbo wa chanzo upo kwenye <a href=https://github.com/i2p/i2p.plugins.zzzot class='sitelink external' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>github</a>."

msgid "Web Hosting - I2P+"
msgstr "Uhosti wa Tovuti - I2P+"

msgid "Registering an I2P Domain"
msgstr "Kusajili Domaini ya I2P"

msgid "To obtain your own hostname, I2P domain registrars such as <a href=http://stats.i2p/i2p/addkey.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>stats.i2p</a> or <a href=http://reg.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>reg.i2p</a> provide registration services that allow you to register and manage an .i2p hostname or sub-domain which will then be propagated across the network. Some registration sites will require the <i>B64 destination address</i> for the tunnel/service you wish to associate with a hostname, which you should copy from the <i>Local destination</i> section on the <a href='http://127.0.0.1:7657/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>Tunnel Manager Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Kupata jina la mashine lako mwenyewe, wasajili wa domaini za I2P kama <a href=http://stats.i2p/i2p/addkey.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>stats.i2p</a> au <a href=http://reg.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>reg.i2p</a> hutoa huduma za usajili zinazokuwezesha kujisajili na kusimamia jina la mashine la .i2p au la subdomaini ambalo kisha hutambulishwa kote katika mtandao. Baadhi ya tovuti za usajili zitahitaji <i>anwani ya lengo ya B64</i> ya tuneli/huduma unayotaka kuiunganisha na jina la mashine, ambayo unapaswa kunakili kutoka sehemu ya <i>Lengo la ndini</i> kwenye <a href='http://127.0.0.1:7657/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>."

msgid "If a <i>Registration Authentication</i> string is requested, you can find it on the <a href='http://127.0.0.1:7657/i2ptunnel/register?tunnel=3'>Registration Authentication page</a> linked from the <a href='http://127.0.0.1:7657/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>Tunnel Manager Configuration page</a>. Registration authentication ensures only the owner is able to register or otherwise manage the hostname, and is required on stats.i2p and reg.i2p."
msgstr "Ikiwa mfuatano wa <i>Uthibitisho wa Usajili</i> unahitajika, unaweza kuupata kwenye <a href='http://127.0.0.1:7657/i2ptunnel/register?tunnel=3'>kurasa ya Uthibitisho wa Usajili</a> iliyounganishwa kutoka <a href='http://127.0.0.1:7657/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>. Uthibitisho wa usajili kinahakikisha kwamba mmiliki pekee ndiye anayeweza kujisajili au kusimamia vinginevyo jina la mashine, na unahitajika kwenye stats.i2p na reg.i2p."

msgid "If you are in a hurry and can't wait a few hours, you can tell people to use a \"jump\" address helper redirection service. This will usually work within a few minutes of your registering your hostname on the same site. Test it yourself first by entering <code>http://stats.i2p/cgi-bin/jump.cgi?a=<i>yourchosenhostname.i2p</i></code> into your browser. Once it is working, you can tell others to use it."
msgstr "Ikiwa una haraka na huwezi kusubiri saa nyingi, unaweza kuwambia watu watumie huduma ya uelekezaji ya msaidia wa anwani ya \"kuvuka\". Huu kwa kawaida hufanya kazi ndani ya dakika chache baada ya kujisajili jina la mashine kwenye tovuti hiyo hiyo. Jaribu mwenyewe kwanza kwa kuweka <code>http://stats.i2p/cgi-bin/jump.cgi?a=<i>yourchosenhostname.i2p</i></code> kwenye kivinjari chako. Pale inapofanya kazi, unaweza kuwambia wengine watumie."

msgid "Alternatively, you can copy the <i>address helper link</i> for your domain, indicated either on the addressbook list page, or on the details page for your domain e.g. <a href='/dns?details&amp;h=skank.i2p&amp;book=router' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>details for skank.i2p</a>, and paste the link where it's required to share it with others."
msgstr "Hapo pia, unaweza kunakili <i>kiungo cha msaidia wa anwani</i> cha domaini yako, kilichoonyeshwa kwenye ukurasa wa orodha ya kitabu cha anwani, au kwenye ukurasa wa maelezo ya domaini yako kwa mfano <a href='/dns?details&amp;h=skank.i2p&amp;book=router' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>maelezo ya skank.i2p</a>, na kuweka kiungo pale kinapotakiwa ili kukishiriki na wengine."

msgid "Backup your private key!"
msgstr "Hifadhi rudufu ufafanuzi wako wa bina!"

msgid "When a new service tunnel is created, or a service is run for the first time (e.g. the default jetty webserver, plugins), a private encryption key is created which essentially controls the ownership of address. This is usually named <code>&hellip;privKey.dat</code>, or <code>eepPriv.dat</code>, though it's a good idea to change the name to indicate the service it belongs to and then respecify it in the Tunnel Manager server settings. This .dat file should be backed up safely; lose it and you will lose ownership and control of your hostname!"
msgstr "Pale tuneli mpya ya huduma inapotengenezwa, au huduma ikiwa imeendeshwa kwa mara ya kwanza (kwa mfano seva ya tovuti ya jetty ya default, viendeshaji), kuna ufafanuzi bina wa usimbuzi unaotengenezwa, ndio kinachodhibiti kwa msingi umiliki wa anwani. Huu kwa kawaida huitwa <code>&hellip;privKey.dat</code>, au <code>eepPriv.dat</code>, ingawa ni wazo zuri kubadilisha jina ili kuonyesha huduma inayohusiana nayo kisha kuiweka upya katika mipangilio ya seva ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli. Faili hii ya .dat inapaswa kuhifadhiwa rudufu kwa usalama; ukikipotea utapoteza umiliki na udhibiti wa jina la mashine lako!"

msgid "To migrate the key to a new router, or to setup multihoming (running the same service on multiple routers for redundancy and load-balancing), copy the backed up key to your .i2p directory and specify it in the new server tunnel, or replace the default key in the plugin folder (e.g. the zzzot plugin)."
msgstr "Kuhamishia ufafanuzi kwenye routeri mpya, au kusanidi multihoming (kuendesha huduma hiyo hiyo kwenye routeri nyingi kwa nakala rudufu na kusambaza mzigo), nakili ufafanuzi kiliyohifadhiwa rudufu kwenye katalogi yako ya .i2p na uibainishe katika tuneli mpya ya seva, au badilisha ufafanuzi wa default katika folda ya kiendeshaji (kwa mfano kiendeshaji cha zzzot)."

