msgstr "Mifano ya Muunganisho"

msgid "The I2PControl API can be integrated with:"
msgstr "API ya I2PControl inaweza kunganishwa na:"

msgid "Monitoring systems:"
msgstr "Mifumo ya ufuatiliaji:"

msgid "Create custom dashboards for router performance"
msgstr "Tengeneza dashibodi za kipekee za utendaji wa routeri"

msgid "Automation scripts:"
msgstr "Skripti za kiotomatiki:"

msgid "Schedule restarts or configuration changes"
msgstr "Panga miyango ya kuanzishaji upya au mabadiliko ya mipangilio"

msgid "Mobile applications:"
msgstr "Programu za simu:"

msgid "Monitor and manage your router remotely"
msgstr "Fuatilia na simamia routeri yako kwa mbali"

msgid "Network management tools:"
msgstr "Zana za kusimamia mtandao:"

msgid "Integrate I2P status into broader network monitoring"
msgstr "Unganisha hali ya I2P kwenye ufuatiliaji mpana wa mtandao"

msgid "Alerting systems:"
msgstr "Mifumo ya tahadhari:"

msgid "Send notifications based on router status changes"
msgstr "Tuma arifa kulingana na mabadiliko ya hali ya routeri"

msgid "Licensing Information"
msgstr "Taarifa za Leseni"

msgid "Legal &amp; Licensing"
msgstr "Kisheria &amp; Leseni"

msgid "Introduction to I2P"
msgstr "Mwongozo kuhusu I2P"

msgid "Reseeding Your Router"
msgstr "Kufanya reseed ya Routeri Yako"

msgid "Reseeding is the bootstrapping process used to find other routers when you first install I2P, or when your router has too few router references remaining. The default settings will work for most people. Change these only if HTTPS is blocked by a restrictive firewall and reseed has failed."
msgstr "Reseeding ni mchakato wa bootstrap unaotumika kupata routeri nyingine unaposakinisha I2P kwa mara ya kwanza, au pale routeri yako imebakiwa na marejeleo ya routeri wachache sana. Mipangilio ya default itafanya kazi kwa watu wengi. Badilisha mipangilio haya tu ikiwa HTTPS imezuliwa na firewall ya kuzuia na reseed imeshindwa."

msgid "If reseeding has failed, you should first check your network connection."
msgstr "Ikiwa reseeding imeshindwa, unapaswa kwanza kuangalia muunganisho wako wa mtandao."

msgid "If a firewall is blocking your connections to reseed hosts, you may have access to a proxy."
msgstr "Ikiwa firewall inazuia muunganisho wako kwa mashine za reseed, huenda una ufikiaji wa proksi."

msgid "The proxy may be remotely hosted or a service running on your computer (localhost/127.0.0.1)."
msgstr "Proksi inaweza kuhostiriwa kwa mbali au kuwa huduma inayoendesha kwenye kompyuta yako (localhost/127.0.0.1)."

msgid "Reseed Configuration page"
msgstr "Ukurasa wa Mipangilio ya Reseed"

#, java-format
msgid "To use a proxy to reseed, configure the proxy type, hostname, and port on the {0}."
msgstr "Ili kutumia proksi kufanya reseed, sanidia aina ya proksi, jina la mashine, na bandari kwenye {0}."

msgid "If you are running the Tor Browser, you may use its Tor instance by configuring I2P to use: <i>Proxy type:</i> <code>SOCKS 5</code> <i>Host:</i> <code>127.0.0.1</code> <i>Port:</i> <code>9150</code>."
msgstr "Ikiwa unafanya kazi na Kivinjari cha Tor, huenda unaweza kutumia mfano wake wa Tor kwa kusanidia I2P kutumia: <i>Aina ya proksi:</i> <code>SOCKS 5</code> <i>Mashine:</i> <code>127.0.0.1</code> <i>Bandari:</i> <code>9150</code>."

msgid "If you are running a standalone Tor instance locally, you may use it by configuring I2P to use: <i>Proxy type:</i> <code>SOCKS 5</code> <i>Host:</i> <code>127.0.0.1</code> <i>Port:</i> <code>9050</code>."
msgstr "Ikiwa unafanya kazi na mfano wa Tor unaoendesha mwenyewe, huenda unaweza kutumia kwa kusanidia I2P kutumia: <i>Aina ya proksi:</i> <code>SOCKS 5</code> <i>Mashine:</i> <code>127.0.0.1</code> <i>Bandari:</i> <code>9050</code>."

msgid "If you have some peers but need more, you may try the I2P Outproxy option. This will not work for the initial reseed when you have 0 known peers. Selecting this option will use the I2P HTTP outproxy (by default on <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>) or, if configured, the Orchid Tor plugin."
msgstr "Ikiwa una baadhi ya peer lakini unahitaji zaidi, huenda unaweza kujaribu chaguo la Outproxy ya I2P. Hakutafanya kazi kwa reseed ya awali pale una 0 peer zinazozikwa. Kuchagua chaguo hiki kutatumia outproxy ya HTTP ya I2P (kwa default kwenye <code>127.0.0.1:4444</code>) au, ikiwa imesanidiwa, kiendeshaji cha Orchid Tor."

msgid "Then click the <i>Save changes</i> button to confirm the proxy configuration and then the <i>Reseed now</i> button to initiate the reseed process."
msgstr "Kisha bofya kitufe cha <i>Hifadhi mabadiliko</i> kuthibitisha sanidi ya proksi kisha kitufe cha <i>Reseed sasa</i> kuanzisha mchakato wa reseed."

#, java-format
msgid "If you know and trust somebody that runs I2P, ask them to send you a reseed file generated using this page in their router console. Then, select the <i>Reseed from file</i> option on the {0} using the file you received."
msgstr "Ikiwa unamjua na kumwamini mtu anayeendesha I2P, omba akutume faili ya reseed iliyotengenezwa kwa kutumia ukurasa huu kwenye konsola yake ya routeri. Kisha, chagua chaguo cha <i>Reseed kutoka faili</i> kwenye {0} kwa kutumia faili uliyopokea."

#, java-format
msgid "If you know and trust somebody that publishes reseed files, ask them for the URL. Then, click the <i>Reseed from URL</i> button on the {0} to reseed using the URL you received."
msgstr "Ikiwa unamjua na kumwamini mtu anayechapisha faili za reseed, omba URL kutoka kwake. Kisha, bofya kitufe cha <i>Reseed kutoka URL</i> kwenye {0} kufanya reseed kwa kutumia URL uliyopokea."

msgid "How do I reseed manually?"
msgstr "Niinsi ninaweza kufanya reseed kwa mikono?"

msgid "An I2P router usually only needs to be seeded once, to join the network for the first time. However, if the router is running for an extended period without network connectivity it may also need to be reseeded. Reseeding involves fetching multiple \"RouterInfo\" files (bundled into a signed zip-file) from at least two predefined server URLs picked from a volunteer-run group of clearnet HTTPS servers."
msgstr "Routeri ya I2P kwa kawaida inahitaji kufanyiwa reseed mara moja tu, ili kujiunga na mtandao kwa mara ya kwanza. Hata hivyo, ikiwa routeri inafanya kazi kwa muda mrefu bila muunganisho wa mtandao inaweza pia kuhitaji kufanyiwa reseed. Reseeding inahusisha kupakua faili nyingi za \"RouterInfo\" (zilizowekwa ndani ya faili moja ya zip iliyosainiwa) kutoka kwenye URL za seva zilizochaguliwa awali, ambazo zinachukua kutoka kundi la seva za HTTPS za clearnet linalosimuliwa na watu wa kujitisha."

msgid "If the number of known peers drops below 50, I2P will attempt to reseed automatically. If the reseed attempt fails, a notification will appear in the sidebar with an option to manually reseed. A failed reseed attempt can occur if your local firewall limits outbound traffic, you are experiencing network connectivity issues, or if the reseed request is blocked entirely."
msgstr "Ikiwa idadi ya peer zinazozikwa inashuka chini ya 50, mfumo wa I2P utajaribu kufanya reseed kiotomatiki. Ikiwa jaribio la reseed limeshindwa, arifa itaonekana kwenye sidebar yenye chaguo la kufanya reseed kwa mikono. Jaribio la reseed linaweza kushindwa ikiwa firewall yako ya ndani inakomoza trafiki ya kutoka, una matatizo ya muunganisho wa mtandao, au ikiwa ombi la reseed limezuliwa kabisa."

#, java-format
msgid "In the event that you suspect the request is being blocked, you can configure I2P to use a proxy to reseed. Go to the {0} and configure the proxy type, hostname, and port."
msgstr "Ikiwa unashukua kuwa ombi limezuliwa, unaweza kusanidia I2P kutumia proksi kufanya reseed. Nenda kwenye {0} na sanidia aina ya proksi, jina la mashine, na bandari."

msgid "If you are stuck behind an ISP firewall or filter, you can use the following manual method (non-automated technical solution) to join the I2P network."
msgstr "Ikiwa umekwama nyuma ya firewall au chuja ya ISP, unaweza kutumia njia ya mikono iliyotolewa hapa chini (ufafanuzi wa kiakili usio wa kiotomatiki) kujiunga na mtandao wa I2P."

msgid "Joining the I2P Network using a reseed file"
msgstr "Kujiunga na Mtandao wa I2P kwa kutumia faili ya reseed"

msgid "Please contact a known trustworthy friend who has a running I2P router, and ask them for help with reseeding your I2P router. Request that they send you a reseed file exported from their running I2P router. It is vital that the file is exchanged over a secure channel, e.g. encrypted to avoid external tampering (PGP Sign, Encrypt and Verified with a trusted public key). The file itself is unsigned, so please accept files only from known trusted friends. Never import a reseed file if you cannot verify its source."
msgstr "Tafadhali wasiliana na rafiki anayejulikana na kuaminika ambaye ana routeri ya I2P inayoendesha, na umuombe aisaidie kufanya reseed ya routeri yako ya I2P. Omba akutume faili ya reseed iliyotolewa kutoka kwenye routeri yake ya I2P inayoendesha. Ni muhimu kwamba faili hiyo ishambulishwe kupitia njia salama, kwa mfano imezimbuziwa ili kuzuia mabadiliko ya nje (Ishara ya PGP, Usimbuzi na Imethibitishwa kwa kutumia ufafanuzi wa umma unaotumika). Faili yenyewe haijasainiwa, kwa hivyo tafadhali pokea faili kutoka kwa rafiki wanaojulikana na wanaotumika tu. Kamwe usiingize faili ya reseed ikiwa huwezi kuthibitisha chanzo chake."

msgid "To import the received i2preseed.zip file into your local I2P router:"
msgstr "Ili kuingiza faili ya i2preseed.zip uliyopokea kwenye routeri yako ya I2P ya ndani:"

#, java-format
msgid "Go to the {0}"
msgstr "Nenda kwenye {0}"

msgid "Under <i>Select zip or su3 file</i> click <i>Browse&hellip;</i>"
msgstr "Chini ya <i>Chagua faili ya zip au su3</i> bofya <i>Tembelea&hellip;</i>"

msgid "Select the i2preseed.zip file"
msgstr "Chagua faili ya i2preseed.zip"

msgid "Click the <i>Reseed from File</i> button"
msgstr "Bofya kitufe cha <i>Reseed kutoka Faili</i>"

msgid "Service (Wrapper) log"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Huduma (Wrapper)"

#, java-format
msgid "The reseed status will be indicated on the sidebar. You can also check the {0} for the following message: <code>Reseed got 100 router infos from file with 0 errors</code>"
msgstr "Hali ya reseed itaonyeshwa kwenye sidebar. Unaweza pia kuangalia {0} kwa ujumbe ufuatao: <code>Reseed got 100 router infos from file with 0 errors</code>"

msgid "Sharing a reseed file"
msgstr "Kushiriki faili ya reseed"

msgid "For trusted friends you can use your local I2P router to give them a jump start:"
msgstr "Kwa rafiki wako unaowaamini, unaweza kutumia routeri yako ya I2P ya ndani kuwapa mwanzo wa haraka:"

msgid "Under <i>Create Reseed File</i> click the <i>Create reseed file</i> button"
msgstr "Chini ya <i>Tengeneza Faili ya Reseed</i> bofya kitufe cha <i>Tengeneza faili ya reseed</i>"

msgid "Securely send the i2preseed.zip file to your friend"
msgstr "Tuma faili ya i2preseed.zip kwa usalama kwa rafiki yako"

msgid "Do not reveal this file to unknown users, as it contains sensitive data (100 RouterInfo files) from your own I2P router which potentially could be used by an adversary to decloak your identity. In order to protect your anonymity: you should wait for a few hours/days before sharing the file with your trusted friend. It is also advisable to use this procedure sparingly (no more than once a week)."
msgstr "Usiadhihirishie faili hii kwa watumiaji hawajulikani, kwa kuwa ina data nyetela (faili 100 za RouterInfo) kutoka kwenye routeri yako mwenyewe ya I2P ambayo huenda zinaweza kutumika na mtu mpinzani kufichua utambulisho wako. Ili kulinda usiri wako: unapaswa kusubiri saa/chungu siku kabla ya kushiriki faili hiyo na rafiki yako unaotumika. Inashauriwa pia kutumia utaratibu huu kwa uangalifu (si zaidi ya mara moja kwa wiki)."

msgid "General guidelines for manual reseeding of I2P"
msgstr "Maelezo ya jumla ya kufanya reseed ya I2P kwa mikono"

msgid "Do not publicly publish the reseed file or share these files with a friend of a friend!"
msgstr "Usichapishe kwa umma faili ya reseed wala kushiriki faili hizi na rafiki wa rafiki!"

msgid "This file should be used only for a very limited number of friends (less than 3)."
msgstr "Faili hii inapaswa kutumika kwa idadi ndogo sana ya rafiki pekee (chini ya 3)."

msgid "The file will only be valid for a limited time (less than 3 weeks)."
msgstr "Faili hii itakuwa halali kwa muda mdogo tu (chini ya wiki 3)."

msgid "If you're experiencing issues with running I2P+, the following information may help identify and resolve the problem:"
msgstr "Ikiwa unakabiliwa na matatizo unapofanya kazi I2P+, taarifa zilizo hapa chini zinaweza kusaidia kubaini na kutatua tatizo:"

msgid "Be Patient!"
msgstr "Tafadhali subiri!"

msgid "I2P+ may be slow to integrate into network the first time you run it as it bootstraps into the network and learns of additional peers. The longer your I2P+ router is running, the better it will perform, so try and keep your router on as long as you can, 24/7 if possible! If, after 30 minutes, your <i>Active: [connected/recent]</i> count still has less than 10 peers, or your total number of <i>Integrated</i> peers is less than 5, there are several things you can do to check for problems:"
msgstr "I2P+ inaweza kuwa polepole kujiunga na mtandao unapoiendesha kwa mara ya kwanza, kwa kuwa inajenga mwenyewe kwenye mtandao na kujifunza peer zaidi. Muda refu zaidi routeri yako ya I2P+ ikishiriki, ndivyo itakavyofanya vizuri zaidi, kwa hivyo jaribu kuweka routeri yako ikiwa wazi kwa muda mrefu zaidi unaoweza, 24/7 kama inawezekana! Ikiwa, baada ya dakika 30, hesabu yako ya <i>Inavyofanya kazi: [imeunganishwa/ya hivi karibuni]</i> bado ina peer chini ya 10, au jumla ya peer zako za <i>Iliyounganishwa</i> ni chini ya 5, kuna mambo mengi unaweza kufanya kuangalia matatizo:"

msgid "Check your Configuration &amp; Bandwidth Allocation"
msgstr "Angalia Sanidi &amp; Ugawaji wa Kasi Yako"

msgid "I2P+ functions best when you can accurately reflect the speed of your network connection in the <a href=/config>bandwidth configuration section</a>. By default I2P+ is configured with some fairly conservative values that will not suit many use cases, so please take time to review these settings and correct where necessary. The more bandwidth you allocate, <i>specifically</i> upstream bandwidth, the more you will benefit from the network."
msgstr "I2P+ inafanya kazi vizuri zaidi unapoweza kueluza kwa upatanisho kasi ya muunganisho wako wa mtandao kwenye <a href=/config>sehemu ya sanidi ya kasi</a>. Kwa default I2P+ imesanidiwa na thamani baadhi zilizo tahafifu ambazo hazitaafika matumizi mengi, kwa hivyo tafadhali chukua muda wa kupitia mipangilio haya na kuyarekebisha pale inapohitajika. Kiasi cha kasi unachopanga, <i>hasa</i> kasi ya kupakia, ndivyo utakayopata zaidi kutoka kwenye mtandao."

msgid "Firewalls, Modems &amp; Routers"
msgstr "Firewall, Modemu &amp; Routeri"

msgid "Where possible, please ensure I2P+/Java is allowed bi-directional port access from the internet by configuring your modem/router/pc firewall accordingly. If you're behind a prohibitive firewall but have unrestricted outbound access, I2P+ can still function; you can turn off inbound access and rely on <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/udp.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>SSU IP Address Detection</a> (<a href=https://wikipedia.org/wiki/Hole_punching target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>firewall hole punching</a>) to connect you to the network, and your network status in the side panel will indicate \"Status: Firewalled\". For optimal performance, please ensure I2P's <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>external port</a> is visible from the internet (see below for more information)."
msgstr "Pale inapowezekana, tafadhali hakikisha kwamba I2P+/Java imeruhusiwa ufikiaji wa bandari wa pande mbili kutoka kwenye Internet kwa kusanidia firewall yako ya modemu/routeri/pc ipasavyo. Ikiwa uko nyuma ya firewall isiyoruhusu, lakini una ufikiaji wa kutosha wa kutoka, I2P+ bado inaweza kufanya kazi; unaweza kuzima ufikiaji wa kuingia na kuitegemea <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/udp.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>Utambuzi wa Anwani ya IP ya SSU</a> (<a href=https://wikipedia.org/wiki/Hole_punching target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>hole punching ya firewall</a>) ili kukuunganisha na mtandao, na hali yako ya mtandao kwenye paneli ya pembeni itaonyesha \"Hali: Imezuliwa na firewall\". Kwa utendaji bora, tafadhali hakikisha kwamba <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>bandari ya nje</a> ya I2P inaonekana kutoka kwenye Internet (tazama hapa chini kwa taarifa zaidi)."

msgid "Check Your Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Angalia Mipangilio ya Proksi Yako"

msgid "If you cannot see any websites at all (not even <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>i2p-projekt.i2p</a>), make sure your browser's proxy is set to access http traffic (<i>not</i> https, <i>not</i> socks) via <code>127.0.0.1 port 4444</code>. If you need some help, there's <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/about/browser-config target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>a guide</a> to configuring your browser for I2P use."
msgstr "Ikiwa huwezi kuona tovuti yoyote hata (hata <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>i2p-projekt.i2p</a>), hakikisha kwamba proksi ya kivinjari chenu imesanidiwa kufikia trafiki ya http (<i>si</i> https, <i>si</i> socks) kupitia <code>127.0.0.1 port 4444</code>. Ikiwa unahitaji msaada fulani, kuna <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/about/browser-config target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>mwongozo</a> wa kusanidia kivinjari chako kwa matumizi ya I2P."

msgid "Check Your Logs"
msgstr "Angalia Kumbukumbu Zako"

msgid "<a href=/logs>Logs</a> may help resolve a problem. You may wish to paste excerpts in a <a href=http://i2pforum.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>forum</a> for help, or perhaps <a href=http://cake.i2p/pastebin/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>paste</a> it instead and reference the link on IRC for help."
msgstr "<a href=/logs>Kumbukumbu</a> zinaweza kusaidia kutatua tatizo. Huenda ungependa kubandika vipande vyake kwenye <a href=http://i2pforum.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>foruma</a> ili kupata msaada, au pengine <a href=http://cake.i2p/pastebin/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>kuviweka</a> badala yake na kurejelea kiungo kwenye IRC ili kupata msaada."

msgid "Verify Java is Up to Date"
msgstr "Hakikisha Kwamba Java Imesasishwa"

msgid "Ensure your Java is up to date. Version 1.8 or higher is required; version 11 or higher is recommended. Check your Java version at the top of <a href=/info>the router information page</a>."
msgstr "Hakikisha kwamba Java yako imesasishwa. Inahitaji toleo la 1.8 au la juu; inashauriwa toleo la 11 au la juu. Angalia toleo lako la Java juu ya <a href=/info>kurasa ya taarifa za routeri</a>."

msgid "Problems running on Legacy Hardware"
msgstr "Matatizo ya Kuendeshwa kwenye Vifaa vya Zamani"

msgid "[Linux/Unix/Solaris] If you can't start the router with <code>i2p/i2prouter start</code> try the <code>runplain.sh</code> script in the same directory. Root privileges are never required to run I2P+. If you need to compile the <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/jbigi.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer>jBigi library</a> (which is necessary in rare cases), consult the documentation, visit the forums, or visit <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/saltR class=chatlink>the I2P+ channel</a> or <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p-dev class=chatlink>IRC developer channel</a>."
msgstr "[Linux/Unix/Solaris] Ikiwa huwezi kuanza routeri kwa <code>i2p/i2prouter start</code>, jaribu skripti ya <code>runplain.sh</code> katika katalogi ileile. Haki za mizizi hazihitajiki kamwe kuendesha I2P+. Ikiwa unahitaji kusanya <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/jbigi.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer>maktaba ya jBigi</a> (ambayo inahitajika katika hali nadra), washa nyaraka, tembelea foruma, au tembelea <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/saltR class=chatlink>safu ya I2P+</a> au <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p-dev class=chatlink>safu ya waendelezaji wa IRC</a>."

msgid "Enable Universal Plug and Play (UPnP)"
msgstr "Washa Universal Plug and Play (UPnP)"

msgid "Your modem or router may support <a href=https://wikipedia.org/wiki/Universal_Plug_and_Play target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Universal Plug &amp; Play</a> (UPnP), which permits automatic port forwarding. Ensure UPnP support for I2P+ is enabled on the <a href=/confignet>config page</a>, then try to activate UPnP on your modem/router and possibly your computer also. Now try restarting the <a href=/>I2P+ router</a>. If successful, I2P+ should report \"Status: OK\" in the side panel once the I2P+ router completes initial connectivity tests."
msgstr "Modemu yako au routeri inaweza kusaidia <a href=https://wikipedia.org/wiki/Universal_Plug_and_Play target=_blank rel=noreferrer>Universal Plug &amp; Play</a> (UPnP), ambayo inaruhusu kuelekeza bandari kiotomatiki. Hakikisha kwamba usaidizi wa UPnP kwa I2P+ umewashwa kwenye <a href=/confignet>ukurasa wa sanidi</a>, kisha jaribu kuwasha UPnP kwenye modemu/routeri yako na pengwe pia kwenye kompyuta yako. Sasa jaribu kuanzisha upya <a href=/>routeri ya I2P+</a>. Ikiwa itafanikiwa, I2P+ ionyeshe \"Hali: Vizuri\" kwenye paneli ya pembeni baada ya routeri ya I2P+ kukamilisha majaribio ya awali ya muunganisho."

msgid "Port Forwarding"
msgstr "Kuelekeza Bandari"

msgid "Open <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>I2P+'s port</a> on your modem, router and/or firewall(s) for better connectivity (ideally both UDP and TCP). More information on how to go about port forwarding can be found at <a href=http://portforward.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>portforward.com</a>, in addition to our forums and IRC channels listed below. Note that I2P does not support connecting to the internet via an http or socks proxy [patches welcome!], though you can connect to proxies via I2P itself once connected to the network."
msgstr "Fungua <a href=/confignet#udpconfig>bandari ya I2P+</a> kwenye modemu, routeri na/au firewall zako ili kwa muunganisho bora (kwa wastani UDP na TCP zote). Taarifa zaidi kuhusu jinsi ya kuelekeza bandari zinaweza kupatikana kwenye <a href=http://portforward.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>portforward.com</a>, pamoja na foruma zetu na safu za IRC zilizoorodheshwa hapa chini. Kumbuka kwamba I2P haishughuliki kuunganisha kwenye Internet kupitia proksi ya http au socks [tunzo za marekebusho karibuni!], ingawa unaweza kuunganisha kwenye proksi kupitia I2P yenyewe baada ya kuunganishwa kwenye mtandao."

msgid "Getting Support Online"
msgstr "Kupata Msaada Mtandaoni"

msgid "You may also want to review the information on the <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>I2P website</a>, post messages to the <a href='http://i2pforum.i2p/viewforum.php?f=8' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>I2P discussion forum</a> or swing by <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/saltR class=chatlink>#saltR</a> or <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p class=chatlink>#i2p-dev</a> on I2P's internal IRC network."
msgstr "Huenda pia ungependa kupitia taarifa kwenye <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer>tovuti ya I2P</a>, ujumbe kwenye <a href='http://i2pforum.i2p/viewforum.php?f=8' target=_blank rel=noreferrer>foruma ya majadiliano ya I2P</a> au tembelea <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/saltR class=chatlink>#saltR</a> au <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p class=chatlink>#i2p-dev</a> kwenye mtandao wa ndani wa IRC wa I2P."

msgid "Reporting Bugs"
msgstr "Kuripoti Hitilafu"

msgid "If you'd like to report a bug, please file a ticket on <a href=https://github.com/I2PPlus/i2pplus/issues target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>github.com/I2PPlus/i2pplus/issues</a>. For developer-related discussions, please visit <a href=http://zzz.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>zzz's developer forums</a> or come and visit the <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p-dev class=chatlink>developer channel</a> on I2P's IRC network."
msgstr "Ikiwa ungependa kuripoti hitilafu, tafadhali fungua tikiti kwenye <a href=https://github.com/I2PPlus/i2pplus/issues target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>github.com/I2PPlus/i2pplus/issues</a>. Kwa majadiliano yanayohusiana na waendelezaji, tafadhali tembelea <a href=http://zzz.i2p/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=sitelink>foruma za waendelezaji za zzz</a> au tembelea <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p-dev class=chatlink>safu ya waendelezaji</a> kwenye mtandao wa IRC wa I2P."

msgid "Further assistance is available here:"
msgstr "Msaada zaidi unapatikana hapa:"

msgid "I2P Support Forum"
msgstr "Foruma ya Msaada ya I2P"

msgid "I2P Developers' Forum"
msgstr "Foruma ya Waendelezaji wa I2P"

msgid "I2P Wiki"
msgstr "Wiki ya I2P"

msgid "The FAQ on <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/en/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer>i2p-projekt.i2p</a> or <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer>geti2p.net</a>"
msgstr "Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara kwenye <a href=http://i2p-projekt.i2p/en/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer>i2p-projekt.i2p</a> au <a href=https://geti2p.net/en/faq target=_blank rel=noreferrer>geti2p.net</a>"

msgid "You may also try <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/saltR class=chatlink>#saltR</a> or <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p-dev class=chatlink>#i2p</a> on I2P's IRC network."
msgstr "Unaweza pia kujaribu <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/saltR class=chatlink>#saltR</a> au <a href=irc://127.0.0.1:6668/i2p-dev class=chatlink>#i2p</a> kwenye mtandao wa IRC wa I2P."

msgid "Introduction to Tunnel Filtering"
msgstr "Mwongozo kuhusu Kichujaji cha Tuneli"

msgid "Server tunnels, configurable in the <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Tunnel Manager</a>, provide a number of ways to limit access to the hosted service. Destination whitelisting, blacklisting, connection throttling, and tunnel filtering are methods provisioned to mitigate denial of service attacks, grant exclusive access to known I2P destinations, and manage traffic to the server."
msgstr "Tuneli za seva, zinazosanidiwa katika <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>, zinatoa njia nyingi za kudhibiti ufikiaji wa huduma inayohostiriwa. Orodha nyeupe za malengo, orodha nyeusi, udhibiti wa kasi wa muunganisho, na kuchuja tuneli ni mbinu zilizopewa kudhibiti mashambulizi ya kukatala huduma (denial of service), kutoa ufikiaji wa kipekee kwa malengo ya I2P yanayozikwa, na kusimamia trafiki kwa seva."

msgid "A tunnel filter can provide protection against denial of service attacks, without otherwise interrupting the service for genuine users, either in conjunction with the tunnel throttler or as an alternative strategy. It can also be used to log access to a hosted service to determine if the server is under attack, or simply to log all visitors by I2P destination. Additionally, a filter can function simultaneously as a whitelist and blacklist making it more flexible than the Tunnel Manager's access list controls. Note that multiple server tunnels can share a single filter file if you wish to implement a global filter."
msgstr "Kichujaji cha tuneli kinaweza kutoa ulinzi dhidi ya mashambulizi ya kukatala huduma (denial of service), bila kukatisha huduma kwa watumiaji wa kweli, aidha kwa kushirikana na kidhibiti cha kasi cha tuneli au kama mbinu mbadala. Kinaweza pia kutumika kurekodi ufikiaji wa huduma inayohostiriwa ili kubaini ikiwa seva inashambulizwa, au tu kurekodi wote wageni kwa lengo la I2P. Zaidi ya hayo, kichujaji kinaweza kutumika kwa wakati mmoja kama orodha nyeupe na orodha nyeusi, hivyo kikifanyika kuwa na utendaji rahisi kuliko vikwazo vya orodha za ufikiaji za Msimamizi wa Tuneli. Kumbuka kwamba tuneli nyingi za seva zinaweza kushiriki faili moja ya kichujaji ikiwa unataka kutekeleza kichujaji cha kila mahali."

msgid "A filter is a text file that can contain one or more declarations. Blank lines and lines beginning with <i class=example>#</i> are ignored."
msgstr "Kichujaji ni faili ya maandishi inayoweza kuwa na tangazo moja au zaidi. Mistari tupu na mistari inayoanza na <i class=example>#</i> hubataliwi."

msgid "A declaration will contain a directive (keyword) with parameters to define the scope of the declaration, and can represent one of the following:"
msgstr "Tangazo litatambua maelekezo (neno muhimu) yenye vigezo vinavyofafanua upeo wa tangazo hilo, na linaweza kuwa mojawapo ya yafuatayo:"

msgid "A default threshold to apply to all remote destinations not listed in the containing file or any of the referenced files"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha kawaida kinachotumika kwa malengo yote ya mbali yaliyototolewa kwenye faili inayohusika au kwenye faili yoyote inayorejewa"

msgid "A threshold to apply to a specific remote destination"
msgstr "Kizingiti kinachotumika kwa lengo maalum la mbali"

msgid "A threshold to apply to remote destinations listed in a file"
msgstr "Kizingiti kinachotumika kwa malengo ya mbali yaliyoorodheshwa kwenye faili"

msgid "A threshold that if breached will cause the offending remote destination to be recorded in a specified file"
msgstr "Kizingiti ambacho kikichovukiwa kitasukia lengo la mbali lenye makosa kurekodiwa kwenye faili maalum"

msgid "Note: The order of the declarations matters. The first threshold declaration for a given destination (whether explicit or listed in a referenced file) overrides any future thresholds for the same destination, whether explicit or listed in a file. Note: to apply a new filter file, the tunnel must be restarted after the location has been specified in the tunnel manager. Once configured, a definition file can be updated without requiring a restart of the target tunnel, although destinations that are blocked will persist until the tunnel is restarted."
msgstr "Kumbuka: mpangilio wa matangazo una umuhimu. Tangazo la kwanza la kizingiti kwa lengo fulani (limeelezwa moja kwa moja au limeorodheshwa kwenye faili inayorejewa) linafuta madaraka ya vizingiti vyote vilivyofuata kwa lengo hilo, iliyleelezwa moja kwa moja au kiorodheshwa kwenye faili. Kumbuka: ili kutumia faili mpya ya kichujaji, tuneli lazima ianzishwe upya baada ya mahali kutajwa katika msimamizi wa tuneli. Mara tu inaposanidiwa, faili ya ufafanuzi inaweza kusasishwa bila kuhitaji kuanzishaji upya kwa tuneli lengwa, ingawa malengo yaliyozuiwa yatabaki hadi tuneli ianzishwe upya."

msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Vizingiti"

msgid "A threshold is defined by the number of connection attempts a remote destination is permitted to perform over a specified number of seconds before a \"breach\" occurs."
msgstr "Kizingiti hufafanuliwa na idadi ya majaribio ya muunganisho ambayo lengo la mbali linaruhusu kufanya kwa idadi maalum ya sekunde kabla ya \"kuvukiwa\" kutokea."

msgid "A threshold declaration can be expressed in one of the following ways:"
msgstr "Tangazo la kizingiti linaweza kuwasilishwa kwa mojawapo ya njia zifuatazo:"

msgid "Numeric definition of the number of connection attempts in the period specified (in seconds) e.g. <i class=example>15/5</i>, <i class=example>60/60</i> etc."
msgstr "Ufafanuzi wa kamba wa idadi ya majaribio ya muunganisho katika kipindi kilichotajwa (kwa sekunde) kwa mfano <i class=example>15/5</i>, <i class=example>60/60</i> n.k."

msgid "Note that if the number of connections is 1 (e.g. <i class=example>1/60</i>), the first connection attempt will result in a breach."
msgstr "Kumbuka kwamba ikiwa idadi ya muunganisho ni 1 (kwa mfano <i class=example>1/60</i>), jaribio la kwanza la muunganisho litasababisha kuvukiwa."

msgid "The keyword <i class=example>allow</i>. This threshold is never breached, i.e. an infinite number of connection attempts is permitted."
msgstr "Neno muhimu <i class=example>allow</i>. Kizingiti hiki hikivukiwi kamwe, yaani idadi ya majaribio ya muunganisho isiyo na mipaka inaruhusiwa."

msgid "The keyword <i class=example>deny</i>. This threshold is always breached, i.e. no connection attempts will be allowed."
msgstr "Neno muhimu <i class=example>deny</i>. Kizingiti hiki kinavukiwa kila wakati, yaani hakuna jaribio lolote la muunganisho lililoruhusiwa."

msgid "Default Threshold"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha Default"

msgid "The <i class=example>default</i> threshold applies to any remote destination not explicitly listed in the definition or in any of the referenced files. To set a default threshold use the keyword <i class=example>default</i>."
msgstr "Kizingiti cha <i class=example>default</i> kinatumika kwa lengo lolote la mbali ambacho hajaorodheshwa moja kwa moja kwenye ufafanuzi au kwenye faili zozote zinazorejewa. Ili kuweka kizingiti cha default, tumia neno muhimu <i class=example>default</i>."

msgid "The following threshold definition <i class=example>180/60</i> specifies that the same remote destination is allowed to make 179 connection attempts during a 60 second period. If it makes one more attempt within the same period, the threshold will be breached and further connection attempts will be rejected until the end of the period:"
msgstr "Ufafanuzi ufuatao wa kizingiti <i class=example>180/60</i> unaonyesha kwamba lengo hilo la mbali linaruhusu kufanya majaribio 179 ya muunganisho katika kipindi cha sekunde 60. Likifanya jaribio lingine moja ndani ya kipindi kile kile, kizingiti kitavukiwa na majaribio ya muunganisho yaliyoendelea yatatupiliwa mbali hadi mwisho wa kipindi:"

msgid "To allow all unspecified client destinations:"
msgstr "Ili kuruhusu malengo yote ya mteja ambayo hayajawekwa:"

msgid "Or to deny all unspecified destinations:"
msgstr "Au kukataa malengo yote ambayo hayajawekwa:"

msgid "Note that there can only be a single reference to the <i class=example>default</i> keyword in a filter file. If unstated, all connections are permitted unless explicitly forbidden. Errors in the filter file will prevent a stopped tunnel from starting, so be sure to double check the syntax before deployment."
msgstr "Kumbuka kwamba kunaweza kuwa na kumbukumbu moja tu ya neno muhimu <i class=example>default</i> katika faili ya kichujaji. Ikiwa hakieleweki, muunganisho wote unaruhusiwa isipokuwa umeombwa vikomyo. Hitilafu katika faili ya kichujaji zitazuia tuneli iliyositishwa kuanza, kwa hivyo hakikisha mara mbili sintaksia kabla ya kutumia."

msgid "Explicit Thresholds"
msgstr "Vizingiti vya Wazi"

msgid "Using the <i class=example>explicit</i> directive, a threshold can be applied to a remote destination listed in the definition itself, with the option to specify custom thresholds for multiple destinations. Remote destinations can also be excluded from the default threshold using the <i class=example>allow</i> keyword, or permanently blocked using the <i class=example>deny</i> keyword:"
msgstr "Kwa kutumia maelekezo ya <i class=example>explicit</i>, kizingiti kinaweza kutumika kwa lengo la mbali lililoorodheshwa kwenye ufafanuzi wenyewe, kwa chaguo la kubaini vizingiti vinavyotumika kwa malengo mengi. Malengo ya mbali pia yanaweza kuchukuliwa nje ya kizingiti cha default kwa kutumia neno muhimu <i class=example>allow</i>, au kuzuiwa kwa muda mrefu kwa kutumia neno muhimu <i class=example>deny</i>:"

msgid "Bulk Thresholds"
msgstr "Vizingiti vya Kundi"

msgid "For convenience you can maintain a list of destinations in a file and define a threshold for all of them in bulk:"
msgstr "Kwa urahisi, unaweza kudumisha orodha ya malengo kwenye faili na kufafanua kizingiti kwa vyote kwa kundi:"

msgid "Recorders"
msgstr "Virekodi"

msgid "Recorders keep track of connection attempts made by a remote destination, and if that breaches the defined threshold, the destination gets logged in the specified file. Multiple recorders can be specified:"
msgstr "Virekodi vinafuata majaribio ya muunganisho yaliyofanywa na lengo la mbali, na ikiwa hilo linavukiwa kizingiti kilichofafanuliwa, lengo hilo hurekodiwa katika faili maalum. Virekodi vingi vinaweza kubainwa:"

msgid "You can use a recorder to log the destinations of aggressive clients to a specified file, and then use that same file to throttle them. The following snippet defines a filter that initially allows all connection requests, but if any single destination exceeds 180 requests in 60 seconds, it gets throttled down to 30 requests every 60 seconds:"
msgstr "Unaweza kutumia kirekodi kurekodi malengo ya wateja wabishi kwenye faili maalum, kisha kutumia faili ile ile kuzidhibiti. Kipande kilicho hapa chini kinafafanua kichujaji ambacho kinaanza kuruhusu maombi yote ya muunganisho, lakini ikiwa lengo lolote moja lijazidi maombi 180 kwa sekunde 60, linadhibitiwa hadi maombi 30 kwa kila sekunde 60:"

msgid "by default there are no limits"
msgstr "kwa default hakuna vikomo"

msgid "but log overly aggressive destinations"
msgstr "lakini rekodi malengo yaliyo mabishi mno"

msgid "and any that end up in that file will get throttled in the future"
msgstr "na yoyote itakayomalikia kwenye faili hiyo itadhibiwa baadaye"

msgid "To log all unique remote destinations connecting to a server, and also log aggressive connection attempts:"
msgstr "Ili kurekodi malengo yote ya mbali yaliyomo wa pekee unaounganisha kwa seva, na pia kurekodi majaribio ya muunganisho ya mabishi:"

msgid "log all unique destinations"
msgstr "rekodi malengo yote yaliyomo wa pekee"

msgid "log visitors making 90 or more connections a minute"
msgstr "rekodi wageni wanaofanya muunganisho 90 au zaidi kwa dakika moja"

msgid "You can use a recorder in one tunnel that writes to a file that another tunnel, or multiple tunnels, can use for throttling. These files can also be edited by hand."
msgstr "Unaweza kutumia kirekodi katika tuneli moja inayoiandika kwenye faili ambayo tuneli nyingine, au tuneli nyingi nyingi, inaweza kutumia kwa kudhibiti kasi. Faili hizi pia zinaweza kuhaririwa kwa mkono."

msgid "The following filter definition applies some throttling by default, no throttling for destinations in the file <i class=example>friends.txt</i>, forbids any connections from destinations in the file <i class=example>enemies.txt</i>, and logs any aggressive behavior in a file called <i class=example>suspicious.txt</i>:"
msgstr "Ufafanuzi ufuatao wa kichujaji unatumia kudhibiti kasi fulani kwa default, hakuna kudhibiti kasi kwa malengo yaliyo kwenye faili <i class=example>friends.txt</i>, huzuia muunganisho wowote kutoka kwa malengo yaliyo kwenye faili <i class=example>enemies.txt</i>, na kurekodi tabaraka ya mabishi katika faili inayoitwa <i class=example>suspicious.txt</i>:"

msgid "Note that the full path to the output files must be accessible before deploying the filter. If the target directory does not exist, the destinations will not be recorded and an error will appear in the router logs. The files will be created as required. The examples provided above are not recommendations; your configuration should be tuned according to the amount of content (number and size of files) your site is serving, the speed of the server, and the frequency with which the site is updated. Configuring recorders and monitoring the resulting files will help you fine tune the settings."
msgstr "Kumbuka kwamba njia kamili kwenye faili za matokeo lazima iwe inapatikana kabla ya kutumia kichujaji. Ikiwa katalogi lengwe haipo, malengo hayatarekodiwa na hitilafu itaonekana katika kumbukumbu za routeri. Faili zitaundwa kama inavyohitajika. Mifano iliyotolewa hapo juu si mapendekezo; sanidi yako inapaswa kubadilishwa kulingana na kiasi cha maudhui (idadi na ukubwa wa faili) ambacho tovuti yako inahudumia, kasi ya seva, na mara nyingine tovuti inaposasishwa. Kusanidi virekodi na kufuatilia faili zinazotokana kutakusaidia kubadilisha mipangilio kwa ustadi zaidi."

msgid "User Interface Help"
msgstr "Msaada wa Kiolesura cha Mtumiaji"

msgid "Note: Many of the labels and options in the console have tooltips that indicate purpose or explain the meaning. Hover over the label or option to activate the tooltip."
msgstr "Kumbuka: lebo nyingi na vichaguo kwenye konsola vina maelekezo madogo (tooltips) yanayoonyesha madhumuni au kueleza maana. Weka kijiko chako juu ya lebo au chaguo ili kuwezesha maelekezo hayo."

msgid "Theme Overrides"
msgstr "Mabadiliko ya Mandhari"

msgid "I2P+ supports custom theme overrides for the console, the tunnel manager, I2PSnark, SusiDNS and Susimail, permitting changes to the themes which are persistent after upgrades. In order to activate an override, create a css file named <code>override.css</code> with your theme modifications and place it in the relevant theme directory of the theme you wish to change, or rename one of the example files, and then hard refresh the browser. Note that the tunnel manager and the console share the same override.css. To deactivate an override, delete or rename the <code>override.css</code> file and then hard refresh the browser (usually Control + Shift + R)."
msgstr "I2P+ inaunga mabadiliko ya mandhari ya kipekee kwa konsola, msimamizi wa tuneli, I2PSnark, SusiDNS na Susimail, ikiruhusu mabadiliko ya mandhari ambayo yanadumu baada ya sasisho. Ili kuanisha mabadiliko, tengeneza faili ya css yenye jina <code>override.css</code> yenye mabadiliko yako ya mandhari na uiweke kwenye katalogi inayofaa ya mandhari unayotaka kubadilisha, au badilisha jina faili mojawapo za mifano, kisha uonyeshe upya kwa nguvu kivinjari. Kumbuka kwamba msimamizi wa tuneli na konsola wanashiriki faili ileile ya override.css. Ili kusitisha mabadiliko, futa au badilisha jina faili ya <code>override.css</code> kisha uonyeshe upya kwa nguvu kivinjari (mara nyingi Control + Shift + R)."

msgid "The themes directory is located in the I2P application directory under <code>docs/themes</code>. There are example override files in the console and I2PSnark theme sub-directories."
msgstr "Katalogi ya mandhari iko kwenye katalogi ya programu ya I2P chini ya <code>docs/themes</code>. Kuna faili za mifano za mabadiliko kwenye katalogi ndogo za mandhari za konsola na I2PSnark."

msgid "Sidebar Information"
msgstr "Taarifa za Sidebar"

msgid "Many of the stats on the sidebar may be <a href='/configstats'>configured</a> to be <a href='/graphs'>graphed</a> for further analysis. You may also customize the sections that appear on the Sidebar and their positioning on the <a href='/configsidebar'>Sidebar Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Takwimu nyingi kwenye sidebar zinaweza <a href='/configstats'>kusanidiwa</a> ili <a href='/graphs'>kuonyeshwa kwenye grafi</a> kwa uchambuzi zaidi. Unaweza pia kubadilisha sehemu zinazoonekana kwenye Sidebar na nafasi yake kwenye <a href='/configsidebar'>ukurasa wa Sanidi ya Sidebar</a>."

msgid "Local Identity"
msgstr "Utambulisho wa Ndani"

msgid "If you hover over the <i>Router Info</i> heading, your truncated router identity will be shown (the first four characters (24 bits) of your 44-character (256-bit) Base64 router hash). The full hash is shown on your <a href='netdb?show=local'>Network Database entry</a>. Never reveal this to anyone, as your router identity is uniquely linked to your IP address in the network database."
msgstr "Ikiwa unalinganya kidole chako juu ya kichwa cha <i>Taarifa za Routeri</i>, utaonyeshwa utambulisho wako wa routeri uliofupishwa (herufi nne za kwanza (biti 24) za hash yako ya routeri yenye herufi 44 (biti 256) katika Base64). Hash kamili ya routeri yako inaonyeshwa kwenye <a href='netdb?show=local'>Rekodi ya Kanzidata ya Mtandao</a>. Usimweze mtu yeyote, kwa sabuti utambulisho wako wa routeri unaunganishwa kwa kipekee na anwani yako ya IP kwenye kanzidata ya mtandao."

msgid "The version of the I2P software you are running. If a new version is available, you will be notified in the Sidebar. It is recommended to keep your router up to date to ensure optimal performance and security. Router updates are usually made available on average every 2-3 months."
msgstr "Hii ndiyo toleo la programu ya I2P unayoendesha. Ikiwa toleo jipya linapatikana, utaarifiwa kwenye Sidebar. Inashauriwa kuweka routeri yako upya ili kuhakikisha utendaji na usalama bora. Sasisho za routeri zinapatikana kwa wastani kila miezi 2-3."

msgid "The skew (offset) of your computer's clock relative to the network-synced time (if known). I2P requires your computer's time be accurate. If the skew is more than a few seconds, please correct the problem by adjusting your computer's time. If I2P cannot connect to the internet, a reading of 0ms may be indicated. Note: This is only displayed in the <i>Router Information (advanced)</i> section. You may add this section to your Sidebar on the <a href='/configsidebar'>Sidebar Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Ukingo (tofauti) wa saa ya kompyuta yako kuhusu muda uliosawazishwa na mtandao (kama unajua). I2P inahitaji muda wa kompyuta yako kuwa sahihi. Ikiwa kingo ni zaidi ya sekunde chache, tafadhali sahihisha tatizo kwa kurekebisha muda wa kompyuta yako. Ikiwa I2P haiwezi kunganisha na intaneti, thamani ya 0ms inaweza kuonyeshwa. Kumbuka: Hii inaonyeshwa tu katika sehemu ya <i>Taarifa za Routeri (za Juu)</i>. Unaweza kuongeza sehemu hii kwenye Sidebar yako kwenye <a href='/configsidebar'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Sidebar</a>."

msgid "This indicates the amount of RAM I2P is using, and the total amount available, allocated by Java. If the usage is consistently high relative to the available RAM, this may indicate that you need to increase the ram allocated to the JVM. You can allocate more RAM by editing your <code>wrapper.config</code> file which is normally located in the I2P application directory. You will need to edit the <code>wrapper.java.maxmemory</code> parameter, which by default is set to 256(MB) for I2P, or 384 for I2P+. Note: if the memory bar is enabled, the memory entry in the router info section will be suppressed."
msgstr "Hii inaonyesha kiasi cha RAM ambacho I2P inatumia, na jumla ya kiasi kinachopatikana, kilichotolewa na Java. Ikiwa matumizi yako ni ya juu mara kwa mara ikilinganishwa na RAM inayopatikana, hii inaweza kuonyesha kwamba unahitaji kuongeza RAM iliyotolewa kwa JVM. Unaweza kutoa RAM zaidi kwa kuhariri faili yako ya <code>wrapper.config</code> ambayo kwa kawaida iko kwenye katalogi ya programu ya I2P. Utahitaji kuhariri kipimo cha <code>wrapper.java.maxmemory</code>, ambacho kwa chaguo-msingi limewekwa 256(MB) kwa I2P, au 384 kwa I2P+. Kumbuka: ikiwa upau wa kumbukumbu umewashwa, ingizo la kumbukumbu katika sehemu ya taarifa za routeri litafichwa."

msgid "The first number is the number of peers your router has sent or received a message from in the last few minutes. This may range from 8-10 to several hundred, depending on your total bandwidth, shared bandwidth, and locally-generated traffic. The second number is the number of peers seen in the last hour or so. Do not be concerned if these numbers vary widely. <a href='/configstats#router.activePeers'>[Enable graphing]</a>."
msgstr "Idadi ya kwanza ni idadi ya peer ambazo routeri yako imetumia ujumbe kwenda au imepokea ujumbe kutoka kwao katika dakika chache zilizopita. Hii inaweza kuanzia 8-10 hadi miaa chache, kutegemea kasi yako kamili, kasi inayoshirikiwa, na trafiki inayotengenezwa ndani. Idadi ya pili ni idadi ya peer zilizoonekana katika saa moja au hivyo. Usiwe na wasiwasi ikiwa nambari hizi zinatofautiana sana. <a href='/configstats#router.activePeers'>[Washa grafi]</a>."

msgid "This is the number of peers your router has available for building client tunnels. It is generally in the range 8-30. Your fast peers are shown on the <a href='/profiles'>Profiles page</a>. <a href='/configstats#router.fastPeers'>[Enable graphing]</a>"
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya peer ambazo routeri yako ina za kujenga tuneli za wateja. Kwa kawaida iko katika kiwango cha 8-30. Peer zako za haraka zinaonyeshwa kwenye <a href='/profiles'>kurasa ya Wasifu</a>. <a href='/configstats#router.fastPeers'>[Washa grafi]</a>"

msgid "This is the number of peers your router has available for building your exploratory tunnels which are used to determine network performance. It is generally in the range 8-75. The fast peers are included in the high capacity tier. Your high capacity peers are shown on the <a href='/profiles'>Profiles page</a>. <a href='/configstats#router.highCapacityPeers'>[Enable graphing]</a>"
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya peer ambazo routeri yako ina za kujenga tuneli zako za uchunguzi zinazotumika kubainisha utendaji wa mtandao. Kwa kawaida iko katika kiwango cha 8-75. Peer za haraka zimejumuishwa katika tabaka la uwezo mkubwa. Peer zako zenye uwezo mkubwa zinaonyeshwa kwenye <a href='/profiles'>kurasa ya Wasifu</a>. <a href='/configstats#router.highCapacityPeers'>[Washa grafi]</a>"

msgid "This is the number of peers your router will use for network database inquiries. These are usually the <i>floodfill</i> routers which are responsible for maintaining network integrity. Your well integrated peers are shown on the bottom of the <a href='/profiles'>Profiles page</a>."
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya peer ambazo routeri yako itatumia kwa utafutaji kwenye kanzidata ya mtandao. Kwa kawaida hizi ni routeri za <i>floodfill</i> ambazo zinawajibika kudumisha uadilifu wa mtandao. Peer zako zilizounganishwa vizuri zinaonyeshwa chini kwenye <a href='/profiles'>kurasa ya Wasifu</a>."

msgid "This is the total number of peers that are known by your router. They are listed on the <a href='/netdb'>Network Database page</a>. This may range from under 100 to 1000 or more. This number is not the total size of the network; it may vary widely depending on your total bandwidth, shared bandwidth, and locally-generated traffic. I2P does not require a router to know every other router in the network."
msgstr "Hii ni jumla ya peer ambazo routeri yako inazijua. Zimeorodheshwa kwenye <a href='/netdb'>kurasa ya Kanzidata ya Mtandao</a>. Hii inaweza kuanzia chini ya 100 hadi 1000 au zaidi. Nambari hii si jumla ya ukubwa wa mtandao; inaweza kutofautiana sana kutegemea kasi yako kamili, kasi inayoshirikiwa, na trafiki inayotengenezwa ndani. I2P haihitaji routeri kujua kila routeri nyingine kwenye mtandao."

msgid "Bandwidth In/Out"
msgstr "Kasi In/Kutoka"

msgid "This section indicates your average bandwidth speeds and total usage for the session. All values are in bytes per second. You may change your bandwidth limits on the <a href='/config'>Bandwidth Configuration page</a>. The more bandwidth you make available, the more you help the network and improve your own anonymity, so please take the time to review the settings. If you are unsure of your network's speed, using a service such as <a href='http://speedtest.net/'>SpeedTest</a> or similar will give you a good indication of your bandwidth capability. Your upstream share amount (KBps Out) will determine your overall contribution to the network. Bandwidth is <a href='/graphs'>graphed</a> by default."
msgstr "Sehemu hii inaonyesha kasi wastani zako na matumizi kamili ya kipindi hiki. Thamani zote ziko kwa baiti kwa sekunde. Unaweza kubadilisha vikomo vyako vya kasi kwenye <a href='/config'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Kasi</a>. Kiasi cha kasi unachopapa ndivyo kinakusaidia mtandao zaidi na kuboresha usiri wako mwenyewe, kwa hiyo tafadhali chagua muda wa kupitia mipangilio. Ikiwa huna uhakika kuhusu kasi ya mtandao wako, kutumia huduma kama <a href='http://speedtest.net/'>SpeedTest</a> au huduma zinazofanana kutakupa wazo zuri kuhusu uwezo wako wa kasi. Kiasi chako cha kushirikiwa kwa kutoka (KBps Out) kitamua mchango wako kamili kwa mtandao. Kasi inachorwa kwenye <a href='/graphs'>grafi</a> kwa chaguo-msingi."

msgid "Local Destinations"
msgstr "Malengo ya Ndini"

msgid "These are the local services provided by your router. They may be clients started through the <a href='/i2ptunnelmgr'>Tunnel Manager</a> or external programs connecting through SAM, BOB, or directly to I2CP. By default, most of your client services (mail, http proxy, IRC) will share the same set of tunnels and be listed as <i>Shared Clients</i> and <i>Shared Clients(DSA)</i>, which enhances anonymity by blending the traffic from all shared services, and reduces the overhead required to build and maintain tunnels. However, if you experience a tunnel failure, all your services will go offline at the same time, so in some scenarios you may wish to configure client services to use their own set of tunnels. This can be done by unchecking the <i>Share tunnels with other clients&hellip;</i> option listed under <i>Shared Clients</i> on the configuration page of the relevant client service in the Tunnel Manager, after which you will need to restart the client service from the <a href='/i2ptunnelmgr'>main Tunnel Manager page</a>."
msgstr "Hizi ni huduma za ndani zinazotolewa na routeri yako. Zinaweza kuwa wateja wanaoanzishwa kupitia <a href='/i2ptunnelmgr'>Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a> au programu za nje zinazounganisha kupitia SAM, BOB, au moja kwa moja kwenye I2CP. Kwa chaguo-msingi, huduma nyingi za wateja zako (barua pepe, proksi ya http, IRC) zinashiriki seti moja ya tuneli na kuorodheshwa kama <i>Wateja Walioshirikiwa</i> na <i>Wateja Walioshirikiwa(DSA)</i>, jambo linaboresha usiri kwa kuchanganya trafiki kutoka kwenye huduma zote zinazoshirikwa, na kupunguza mzigo unaohitajika kujenga na kudumisha tuneli. Walakini, ikiwa unapata hitilafu ya tuneli, huduma zako zote zitaondoka mtandaoni kwa wakati mmoja, hivyo katika hali fulani unaweza kutaratibu huduma za wateja zako zitumie seti yao wenyewe ya tuneli. Hii inaweza kufanywa kwa kuondoa alama ya kukagua kwenye chaguo <i>Shiriki tuneli na wateja wengine&hellip;</i> lililorodheshwa chini ya <i>Wateja Walioshirikiwa</i> kwenye kurasa ya mipangilio ya huduma inayohusika ya mteja katika Msimamizi wa Tuneli, baadaye utahitaji kuanzisha upya huduma ya mteja kutoka <a href='/i2ptunnelmgr'>kurasa kuu ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>."

msgid "The actual tunnels are shown on the <a href='/tunnels'>Tunnels page</a>."
msgstr "Tuneli halisi zinaonyeshwa kwenye <a href='/tunnels'>kurasa ya Tuneli</a>."

msgid "Tunnels built by your router and used for communication with the floodfill peers, building new tunnels, and testing existing tunnels."
msgstr "Tuneli zilizojengwa na routeri yako na zinazotumika kwa mawasiliano na peer za floodfill, kujenga tuneli mpya, na kujaribu tuneli zilizopo."

msgid "Tunnels built by your router for each client's use."
msgstr "Tuneli zilizojengwa na routeri yako kwa matumizi ya kila mteja."

msgid "Participating"
msgstr "Zinashiriki"

msgid "Tunnels built by other routers through your router. This may vary widely depending on network demand, your shared bandwidth, and amount of locally-generated traffic. The recommended method for limiting participating tunnels is to change your share percentage on the <a  href='/config'>Bandwidth Configuration page</a>. You may also limit the total number by setting <code>router.maxParticipatingTunnels=nnn</code> on the <a href='/configadvanced'>Advanced configuration page</a>. <a href='/configstats#tunnel.participatingTunnels'>[Enable graphing]</a>."
msgstr "Tuneli zilizojengwa na routeri wengine kupitia routeri yako. Hii inaweza kutofautiana sana kutegemea mahitaji ya mtandao, kasi yako inayoshirikiwa, na kiasi cha trafiki inayotengenezwa ndani. Njia inayopendekezwa ya kudhibiti tuneli zinazoshirikiwa ni kubadilisha asilimia yako ya kushirika kwenye <a  href='/config'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Kasi</a>. Unaweza pia kudhibiti jumla ya idadi kwa kuweka <code>router.maxParticipatingTunnels=nnn</code> kwenye <a href='/configadvanced'>kurasa ya mipangilio za juu</a>. <a href='/configstats#tunnel.participatingTunnels'>[Washa grafi]</a>."

msgid "Share Ratio"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Kushiriki"

msgid "The number of participating tunnels you route for others, divided by the total number of hops in all your exploratory and client tunnels. A number greater than 1.00 means you are contributing more tunnels to the network than you are using."
msgstr "Idadi ya tuneli zinazoshirikiwa unazoshiriki kwa wengine kwa njia ya routeri yako, ikigawanywa na jumla ya idadi ya hop katika tuneli zako zote za uchunguzi na za mteja. Nambari kubwa kuliko 1.00 inamaanisha kwamba unachangia tuneli nyingi zaidi kwenye mtandao kuliko unavyotumia."

msgid "Some basic indications of router overload:"
msgstr "Mashaidiku mache ya msongamano wa routeri:"

msgid "How long jobs are waiting before execution. The job queue is listed on the <a href='/jobs'>Jobs page</a>. Unfortunately, there are several other job queues in the router that may be congested, and their status is not available in the router console. The job lag should generally be zero. If it is consistently higher than 500ms, your computer is very slow, your network is experiencing connectivity issues, or the router has serious problems. <a href='/configstats#jobQueue.jobLag'>[Enable graphing]</a>."
msgstr "Muda ambao kazi zinasubiri kabla ya kutekelezwa. Foleni ya kazi inarodheshwa kwenye <a href='/jobs'>kurasa ya Kazi</a>. Kwa bahati mbaya, kuna foleni nyingine nyingi za kazi kwenye routeri ambazo zinaweza kuwa na msongamano, na hali zao hazipatikani kwenye konsola ya routeri. Ucheleweshaji wa kazi kwa kawaida unapaswa kuwa sifuri. Ikiwa kwa njia za juu kuliko 500ms kwa muda mrefu, kompyuta yako ni ya polepole sana, mtandao wako una tatizo la muunganisho, au routeri ina matatizo mawili. <a href='/configstats#jobQueue.jobLag'>[Washa grafi]</a>."

msgid "Message Delay"
msgstr "Ucheleweshaji wa Ujumbe"

msgid "How long an outbound message waits in the queue. This should generally be a few hundred milliseconds or less. If it is consistently higher than 1000ms, your computer is very slow, or you should adjust your bandwidth limits, or your (BitTorrent?) clients may be sending too much data and should have their transmit bandwidth limit reduced. <a href='/configstats#transport.sendProcessingTime'>[Enable graphing]</a> (transport.sendProcessingTime)."
msgstr "Muda ambao ujumbe wa kutoka unasubiri kwenye foleni. Kwa kawaida huwa ni mamia ya milisekunde au kidogo zaidi. Ikiwa kwa njia za juu kuliko 1000ms kwa muda mrefu, kompyuta yako ni ya polepole sana, au unapaswa kurekebisha vikomo vyako vya kasi, au wateja wako wa (BitTorrent?) wanaweza kutuma data nyingi sana na wanapaswa kupunguzwa kikomo chao cha kasi ya kutuma. <a href='/configstats#transport.sendProcessingTime'>[Washa grafi]</a> (transport.sendProcessingTime)."

msgid "This is the number of pending requests from other routers to build a participating tunnel through your router. It should usually be close to zero. If it is consistently high, your computer is too slow, and you should reduce your share bandwidth limits."
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya maombi yaliyosubiri kutoka kwa routeri wengine ya kujenga tuneli inayoshirikiwa kupitia routeri yako. Kwa kawaida inapaswa kuwa karibu na sifuri. Ikiwa ni ya juu kwa muda mrefu, kompyuta yako ni ya polepole sana, na unapaswa kupunguza vikomo vyako vya kasi inayoshirikiwa."

msgid "Accepting/Rejecting"
msgstr "Inakubali/Inatupilia mbali"

msgid "Your router's status on accepting or rejecting requests from other routers to build a participating tunnel through your router. Your router may accept all requests, accept or reject a percentage of requests, or reject all requests for a number of reasons, to control the bandwidth and CPU demands and maintain capacity for local clients. <b>Note"
msgstr "Hal ya routeri yako kuhusu kukubali au kutupilia mbali maombi kutoka kwa routeri wengine ya kujenga tuneli inayoshirikiwa kupitia routeri yako. Routeri yako inaweza kukubali maombi yote, kukubali au kutupilia mbali asilimia fulani ya maombi, au kutupilia mbali maombi yote kwa sababu nyingi, ili kudhibiti mahitaji ya kasi na CPU na kuweka uwezo kwa wateja wa ndani. <b>Kumbuka"

msgid "It will take at least 10 minutes from your router starting for it to accept building participating tunnels in order to ensure your router is stable and successfully bootstrapped to the network."
msgstr "Itachukua angalia dakika 10 tangu routeri yako ianze kabla ya kukubali kujenga tuneli zinazoshirikiwa, ili kuhakikisha kwamba routeri yako ni thabiti na imeunganishwa kwa mafanikio na mtandao."

msgid "<b>Note"
msgstr "<b>Kumbuka"

msgid "This section is not enabled by default unless <a href='/help/configuration#advancedconsole'>Advanced Console mode</a> is enabled. You may enable it on the <a href='/configsidebar'>Sidebar Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Sehemu hii haijawezeshwa kwa chaguo-msingi isipokuwa <a href='/help/configuration#advancedconsole'>modi ya Konsola ya Juu</a> imewashwa. Unaweza kuiwasha kwenye <a href='/configsidebar'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Sidebar</a>."

msgid "Reachability Help"
msgstr "Msaada wa Upatikani"

msgid "If you think you have opened up your firewall and I2P still thinks you are firewalled, remember that you may have multiple firewalls, for example both software packages and external hardware routers."
msgstr "Ikiwa unadhani kwamba umefungua firewall yako na I2P bado inadhani kwamba umezuliwa na firewall, kumbuka kwamba unaweza kuwa na firewall nyingi nyingi, kwa mfano pakiti za programu na routeri za nje za vifaa."

msgid "If there is an error, the <a href=\"/logs\">logs</a> may also help diagnose the problem."
msgstr "Ikiwa kuna hitilafu, <a href=\"/logs\">kumbukumbu</a> zinaweza pia kusaidia kuchungua tatizo."

msgid "Your UDP port does not appear to be firewalled."
msgstr "Bandari yako ya UDP haionekani kuwa imezuliwa na firewall."

msgid "Firewalled"
msgstr "Imezuliwa na firewall"

msgid "Your UDP port appears to be firewalled."
msgstr "Bandari yako ya UDP inaonekana kuwa imezuliwa na firewall."

msgid "As the firewall detection methods are not 100% reliable, this may occasionally be displayed in error."
msgstr "Kwa sabuti njia za kugundua firewall hazieleweki 100%, hiki kinaweza kuonyeshwa kosa kwa mara kwa mara."

msgid "However, if it appears consistently, you should check whether both your external and internal firewalls are open for your port."
msgstr "Walakini, ikiwa inaonekana kwa njia za juu, unapaswa kuangalia kama firewall zako za nje na za ndani zimefunguliwa kwa bandari yako."

msgid "I2P will work fine when firewalled, there is no reason for concern. When firewalled, the router uses \"introducers\" to relay inbound connections."
msgstr "I2P itafanya kazi vizuri ikiwa imezuliwa na firewall, hakuna sababu ya wasiwasi. Ikiwa imezuliwa na firewall, routeri hutumia «watumabulishaji» kupeleka muunganisho wa kuingia."

msgid "However, you will get more participating traffic and help the network if you open your firewall."
msgstr "Walakini, utapata trafiki zaidi inayoshirikiwa na utamsaidia mtandao ikiwa utafungua firewall yako."

msgid "If you think you have already done so, remember that you may have both a hardware and a software firewall, or be behind an additional, institutional firewall you cannot control."
msgstr "Ikiwa unadhani kwamba umefanya hivyo tayari, kumbuka kwamba unaweza kuwa na firewall ya vifaa na ya programu, au kuwa nyuma ya firewall nyingine ya taasisi ambayo huwezi kudhibiti."

msgid "Also, some routers cannot correctly forward both TCP and UDP on a single port, or may have other limitations or bugs that prevent them from passing traffic through to I2P."
msgstr "Zaidi, baadhi ya routeri haziwezi kuelekeza kwa kawaida TCP na UDP kwenye bandari moja, au zinaweza kuwa na mipaka au hitilafu nyingine zinazozuia kupitisha trafiki kwenye I2P."

msgid "The router is currently testing whether your UDP port is firewalled."
msgstr "Routeri ina jaribu kwa sasa kama bandari yako ya UDP imezuliwa na firewall."

msgid "The router is not configured to publish its address, therefore it does not expect incoming connections."
msgstr "Routeri haijasakinishwa kuchapisha anwani yake, kwa hiyo haitarajii kupokea muunganisho unaoingia."

msgid "Hidden mode is automatically enabled for added protection in certain countries."
msgstr "Modi ya siri huwashwa kiotomatiki kwa ulinzi zaidi katika nchi fulani."

msgid "WARN - Firewalled and Fast"
msgstr "ONYO - Imezuliwa na firewall na Haraka"

msgid "You have configured I2P to share more than 128KBps of bandwidth, but you are firewalled."
msgstr "Umusanidi I2P kushiriki kasi zaidi ya 128KBps, lakini umezuliwa na firewall."

msgid "While I2P will work fine in this configuration, if you really have over 128KBps of bandwidth to share, it will be much more helpful to the network if you open your firewall."
msgstr "Ingawa I2P itafanya kazi vizuri katika mipangilio hii, ikiwa kwa kweli una kasi zaidi ya 128KBps ya kushiriki, itakuwa yenye manufaa mengi zaidi kwa mtandao ikiwa utafungua firewall yako."

msgid "WARN - Firewalled and Floodfill"
msgstr "ONYO - Imezuliwa na firewall na Floodfill"

msgid "You have configured I2P to be a floodfill router, but you are firewalled."
msgstr "Umusanidi I2P kuwa routeri ya floodfill, lakini umezuliwa na firewall."

msgid "For best participation as a floodfill router, you should open your firewall."
msgstr "Kwa ushiriki bora kama routeri ya floodfill, unapaswa kufungua firewall yako."

msgid "WARN - Firewalled with Inbound TCP Enabled"
msgstr "ONYO - Imezuliwa na firewall na TCP ya Kuingia Imewashwa"

msgid "You have configured inbound TCP, however your UDP port is firewalled, and therefore it is likely that your TCP port is firewalled as well."
msgstr "Umusanidi TCP ya kuingia, walakini bandari yako ya UDP imezuliwa na firewall, kwa hiyo kuna uwezekano mkubwa kwamba bandari yako ya TCP pia imezuliwa na firewall."

msgid "If your TCP port is firewalled with inbound TCP enabled, routers will not be able to contact you via TCP, which will hurt the network."
msgstr "Ikiwa bandari yako ya TCP imezuliwa na firewall huku TCP ya kuingia ikiwa imewashwa, routeri hazitaweza kukusikiliza kupitia TCP, na hiyo itadhuru mtandao."

msgid "Please open your firewall or disable inbound TCP above."
msgstr "Tafadhali fungua firewall yako au zima TCP ya kuingia iliyo juu."

msgid "WARN - Firewalled with UDP Disabled"
msgstr "ONYO - Imezuliwa na firewall na UDP Imezimwa"

msgid "You have configured inbound TCP, however you have disabled UDP."
msgstr "Umusanidi TCP ya kuingia, walakini umezima UDP."

msgid "You appear to be firewalled on TCP, therefore your router cannot accept inbound connections."
msgstr "Unaonekana kuwa umezuliwa na firewall kwenye TCP, kwa hiyo routeri yako haiwezi kukubali muunganisho unaoingia."

msgid "Please open your firewall or enable UDP."
msgstr "Tafadhali fungua firewall yako au washa UDP."

msgid "ERR - Clock Skew"
msgstr "HITILAFU - Ukingyuzi wa Saa"

msgid "Your system's clock is skewed, which will make it difficult to participate in the network."
msgstr "Saa ya mfumo wako imekingwa, na hiyo itafanya iwe vigumu kushiriki kwenye mtandao."

msgid "Correct your clock setting if this error persists."
msgstr "Sahihisha mipangilio ya saa yako ikiwa hitilafu hii inaendelea."

msgid "ERR - Private TCP Address"
msgstr "HITILAFU - Anwani ya TCP Bina"

msgid "You must never advertise an unroutable IP address such as 127.0.0.1 or 192.168.1.1 as your external address."
msgstr "Usipendekeze kamwe anwani ya IP isiyoweza kuelekezwa kama 127.0.0.1 au 192.168.1.1 kama anwani yako ya nje."

msgid "Correct the address or disable inbound TCP on the Network Configuration page."
msgstr "Sahihisha anwani au zima TCP ya kuingia kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao."

msgid "ERR - SymmetricNAT"
msgstr "HITILAFU - SymmetricNAT"

msgid "I2P detected that you are firewalled by a Symmetric NAT."
msgstr "I2P imegundua kwamba umezuliwa na firewall ya NAT Symmetric."

msgid "I2P does not work well behind this type of firewall. You will probably not be able to accept inbound connections, which will limit your participation in the network."
msgstr "I2P haifanyi kazi vizuri nyuma ya aina hii ya firewall. Huenda usiweze kukubali muunganisho unaoingia, na hiyo itaorodhesha ushiriki wako kwenye mtandao."

msgid "ERR - UDP Port In Use - Set i2np.udp.internalPort=xxxx in advanced config and restart"
msgstr "HITILAFU - Bandari ya UDP Inatumika - Weka i2np.udp.internalPort=xxxx kwenye mipangilio za juu na uanzishe upya"

msgid "I2P was unable to bind to the configured port noted on the advanced network configuration page ."
msgstr "I2P haikuweza kushikilia bandari iliyosanidiwa iliyoandikwa kwenye kurasa ya mipangilio za juu ya mtandao ."

msgid "Check to see if another program is using the configured port. If so, stop that program or configure I2P to use a different port."
msgstr "Angalia ili kuona kama programu nyingine inatumia bandari iliyosanidiwa. Kama ndivyo, sitisha programu hiyo au sanidi I2P kutumia bandari tofauti."

msgid "This may be a transient error, if the other program is no longer using the port."
msgstr "Hii inaweza kuwa hitilafu ya muda mfupi, ikiwa programu nyingine haitumii tena bandari."

msgid "However, a restart is always required after this error."
msgstr "Walakini, uanzishaji upya unahitajika kila wakati baada ya hitilafu hii."

msgid "ERR - UDP Disabled and Inbound TCP host/port not set"
msgstr "HITILAFU - UDP Imezimwa na Mashine/Bandari ya TCP ya Kuingia Haijawekwa"

msgid "You have not configured inbound TCP with a hostname and port on the Network Configuration page, however you have disabled UDP."
msgstr "Hujusanidi TCP ya kuingia pamoja na jina la mashine na bandari kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao, walakini umezima UDP."

msgid "Therefore your router cannot accept inbound connections."
msgstr "Kwa hiyo routeri yako haiwezi kukubali muunganisho unaoingia."

msgid "Please configure a TCP host and port on the Network Configuration page or enable UDP."
msgstr "Tafadhali sanidi mashine na bandari ya TCP kwenye kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mtandao au washa UDP."

msgid "ERR - Client Manager I2CP Error - check logs"
msgstr "HITILAFU - Hitilafu ya Msimamizi wa Mteja ya I2CP - angalia kumbukumbu"

msgid "This is usually due to a port 7654 conflict. Check the logs to verify."
msgstr "Hii kwa kawaida husababishwa na mgongano wa bandari 7654. Angalia kumbukumbu kuthibitisha."

msgid "Do you have another I2P instance running? Stop the conflicting program and restart I2P."
msgstr "Je, una mfano mwingine wa I2P unaoendeshwa? Sitisha programu inayotia tatizo na uanzishe upya I2P."

msgid "The skew (offset) of your computer's clock relative to the network-synced time."
msgstr "Ukingo (tofauti) wa saa ya kompyuta yako kuhusu muda uliosawazishwa na mtandao."

msgid "I2P requires your computer's time be accurate."
msgstr "I2P inahitaji muda wa kompyuta yako kuwa sahihi."

msgid "If the skew is more than a few seconds, please correct the problem by adjusting your computer's time."
msgstr "Ikiwa kingo ni zaidi ya sekunde chache, tafadhali sahihisha tatizo kwa kurekebisha muda wa kompyuta yako."

msgid "If I2P cannot connect to the internet, a reading of 0ms may be indicated."
msgstr "Ikiwa I2P haiwezi kunganisha na intaneti, thamani ya 0ms inaweza kuonyeshwa."

msgid "Web hosting on I2P"
msgstr "Kuhosti Tovuti kwenye I2P"

msgid "Introduction to Hosting Websites on I2P"
msgstr "Mwongozo wa Kuhosti Tovuti kwenye I2P"

msgid "By default, I2P is supplied with a webserver to host your own anonymized website (traditionally referred to as an <i>eepsite</i>). Both the site and the I2P Router Console are running on a streamlined version of <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jetty_(web_server)' target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Jetty</a>, customized for I2P."
msgstr "Kwa chaguo-msingi, I2P inatolewa pamoja na seva ya tovuti ya kuhosti tovuti yako tuli mwenyewe (kwa kawaida inaitwa <i>eepsite</i>). Tovuti na Konsola ya Routeri ya I2P zote zinaendesha kwenye toleo rahisi la <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jetty_(web_server)' target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Jetty</a> lililobadilishwa kwa I2P."

msgid "To serve your own static content, you only need to edit or replace the files in the webserver's root directory, and the site will be available on the I2P network after you've followed the instructions below. Additionally, cgi and python scripts can be run from the <code>cgi-bin</code> directory immediately above <code>docroot</code> if you have <a href=https://www.perl.org/about.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>perl</a> and <a href=https://www.python.org/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>python</a> installed."
msgstr "Ili kuhudumia maudhui yako tuli, unahitaji tu kuhariri au kubadilisha faili zilizo kwenye katalogi kuu ya seva ya tovuti, na tovuti itapatikana kwenye mtandao wa I2P baada ya kufuata maagizo yaliyo hapa chini. Zaidi, michangato ya cgi na python zinaweza kuendeshwa kutoka katalogi ya <code>cgi-bin</code> iliyo mara moja juu ya <code>docroot</code> ikiwa umesakinisha <a href=https://www.perl.org/about.html target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>perl</a> na <a href=https://www.python.org/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>python</a>."

msgid "Directory listings (sometimes referred to as virtual directories) are enabled by default, so you can host files from a sub-directory of <code>docroot</code> without providing a page with links to the files. You can also serve content that exists outside of <code>docroot</code> by using a <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symbolic_link target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>symbolic link</a> to the desired directory."
msgstr "Orodha za katalogi (mara kwa mara zinarejeleuliwa kama katalogi za ndani) huwashwa kwa chaguo-msingi, hivyo unaweza kuhosti faili kutoka katalogi ndogo ya <code>docroot</code> bila kutoa kurasa yenye viungo vya faili. Unaweza pia kuhudumia maudhui yaliyo nje ya <code>docroot</code> kwa kutumia <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symbolic_link target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>kiungo cha alama</a> (symbolic link) hadi katalogi unayotaka."

msgid "You can override the <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/help/images/>default appearance</a> of the directory listing by supplying an edited <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/.resources/jetty-dir.css>jetty-dir.css</a> file to set a global appearance. Note that this file will not be displayed in the webserver's directory listing. Files and directories prefixed with . and files named favicon.ico or files ending with ~ or .bak or .old will also be hidden from view (though still accessible). Note: To create hidden files with a . prefix on Windows, add a trailing . to the file or directory e.g. <code>.hidden.</code>; Windows explorer will then save the file with the correct name, removing the trailing dot in the process."
msgstr "Unaweza kubadilisha <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/help/images/>muonekano wa default</a> wa orodha za katalogi kwa kutoa faili iliyohaririwa ya <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/.resources/jetty-dir.css>jetty-dir.css</a> ili kweka muonekano wa jumla. Kumbuka kwamba faili hii haitaonyeshwa kwenye orodha za katalogi ya seva ya tovuti. Faili na katalogi zinazoanza na . pamoja na faili zinazoitwa favicon.ico au faili zinazomalizika na ~ au .bak au .old pia zitafichwa kuonekana (ingawa bado zinapatikana). Kumbuka: Ili kuunda faili zilizofichwa zenye mwanzo wa . kwenye Windows, ongeza nukta ya . mwishoni mwa faili au katalogi kwa mfano <code>.hidden.</code>; Windows explorer kisha itahifadhi faili kwa jina sahihi, kuondoa nukta ya mwisho katika mchakato huo."

msgid "To disable directory listings, find the entry for <code>org.eclipse.jetty.servlet.Default.dirAllowed</code> in the <code>base-context.xml</code> file, located in the <code>eepsite/contexts</code> folder (just above docroot folder), and change 'true' to 'false' immediately underneath. To apply the change immediately, stop and restart the <i>I2P Webserver</i> client on the <a href=/configclients>Client Configuration page</a>. You can also drop an empty <code>index.html</code> file in any exposed directory to suppress directory listings for that location."
msgstr "Ili kuzima orodha za katalogi, pata ingizo la <code>org.eclipse.jetty.servlet.Default.dirAllowed</code> katika faili ya <code>base-context.xml</code>, iliyoko kwenye folda ya <code>eepsite/contexts</code> (mara moja juu ya folda ya docroot), na badilisha 'true' kuwa 'false' mara moja chini yake. Ili kutumia mabadiliko hayo mara moja, sitisha na uanzishe upya mteja wa <i>I2P Webserver</i> kwenye <a href=/configclients>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Mteja</a>. Unaweza pia kuweka faili tupu ya <code>index.html</code> kwenye katalogi yoyote iliyo wazi ili kuzima orodha za katalogi mahali pale."

msgid "Location of the I2P webserver root directory"
msgstr "Eneo la katalogi kuu ya seva ya tovuti ya I2P"

msgid "Standard Java installation"
msgstr "Sakinishaji wa kawaida la Java"

msgid "Package/repository installation"
msgstr "Sakinishaji wa pakiti/kanzidata"

msgid "On the I2P network, remotely hosted services can be accessed using a <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base32 target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Base32</a> address ending in \".b32.i2p\", a <i>destination</i> represented as a long <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base64 class='sitelink external'>Base64</a> string, or more usually by using an .i2p domain. A destination is I2P's equivalent to an IP address, and is shown on the <a href='/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>Tunnel Manager Configuration page</a>. You can share your b32.i2p address to allow others to access to your website until you've registered your own .i2p domain."
msgstr "Kwenye mtandao wa I2P, huduma zinazohostiriwa kwa mbali zinaweza kufikia kwa kutumia anwani ya <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base32 target=_blank rel=noreferrer class='sitelink external'>Base32</a> inayomalizika na \".b32.i2p\", <i>lengo</i> linalowakilishwa kwa mfuatano mrefu wa <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base64 class='sitelink external'>Base64</a>, au zaidi kwa kawaida kwa kutumia domaini ya .i2p. Lengo ni sawa na I2P kwa anwani ya IP, na linaonyeshwa kwenye <a href='/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>. Unaweza kushiriki anwani yako ya b32.i2p ili kuruhusu wengine kufikia tovuti yako hadi usajilie domaini yako ya .i2p."

msgid "Setting up &amp; announcing your website"
msgstr "Kusanidi &amp; kutangaza tovuti yako"

msgid "Your webserver is running by default at <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/>http://127.0.0.1:7658</a>, but is not accessible by others until you start the <i>I2P Webserver</i> tunnel. After starting the tunnel, your site will be difficult for other people to find. You could just tell people the destination or the Base32 address, but thankfully I2P has an address book to store domain names, and various services where you can <a href=/help/hostnameregistration>register a new .i2p domain</a> for free."
msgstr "Seva yako ya tovuti inaendesha kwa chaguo-msingi kwenye <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/>http://127.0.0.1:7658</a>, lakini haipatikani na wengine hadi uanzishe tuneli ya <i>I2P Webserver</i>. Baada ya kuanzisha tuneli, tovuti yako itakuwa vigumu kwa watu wengine kuipata. Unaweza tu kuwaambia watu namba ya lengo au anwani ya Base32, lakini kwa furaha I2P ina kitabu cha anwani kuhifadhi majina ya domaini, na huduma mbalimbali ambapo unaweza <a href=/help/hostnameregistration>usajili domaini mpya ya .i2p</a> bila malipo."

msgid "Choose a name for your website (<i>hostname</i>.i2p), using lower-case. To verify that the hostname is available, check <a href=http://notbob.i2p/ target=_blank>notbob.i2p</a> or <a href=http://reg.i2p target=_blank>reg.i2p</a> before you decide. Enter the new name for your website on the <a href='/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>Tunnel Manager Configuration page</a> where it says <i>Website name</i>, replacing the default <i>mysite.i2p</i> placeholder. If you want your website to be available when I2P starts, enable <i>Auto Start</i> and then click <i>Save</i>."
msgstr "Chagua jina kwa tovuti yako (<i>jina la mashine</i>.i2p), kwa kutumia herufi ndogo. Ili kuthibitisha kwamba jina la mashine linapatikana, angalia <a href=http://notbob.i2p/ target=_blank>notbob.i2p</a> au <a href=http://reg.i2p target=_blank>reg.i2p</a> kabla ya kuamua. Weka jina mpya ya tovuti yako kwenye <a href='/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a> mahali inaposema <i>Jina la tovuti</i>, ukibadilisha nafasi ya default <i>mysite.i2p</i>. Ikiwa unataka tovuti yako ipatikane I2P ianze, washa <i>Anza Kiotomatiki</i> kisha bofya <i>Hifadhi</i>."

msgid "Click the <i>Start</i> button for your webserver tunnel on the <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr/>main Tunnel Manager page</a>. You should now see it listed under <i>Service Tunnels</i> on the <a href=/>Router Console</a> sidebar. A green star displayed next to the tunnel name (<i>I2P Webserver</i> by default) indicates that your website is active on the I2P network."
msgstr "Bofya kitufe cha <i>Anza</i> kwa tuneli ya seva yako ya tovuti kwenye <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr/>kurasa kuu ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>. Sasa unapaswa kuiona imeorodheshwa chini ya <i>Tuneli za Huduma</i> kwenye sidebar ya <a href=/>Konsola ya Routeri</a>. Nyota ya kijani inayoonyeshwa karibu na jina la tuneli (<i>I2P Webserver</i> kwa chaguo-msingi) inaonyesha kwamba tovuti yako inafanya kazi kwenye mtandao wa I2P."

msgid "Highlight and copy the entire <i>Local destination</i> on the <a href='/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>Tunnel Manager Configuration page</a>."
msgstr "Chagua na nakili <i>Lengo la Ndani</i> nzima kwenye <a href='/i2ptunnel/edit?tunnel=3'>kurasa ya Mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>."

msgid "Enter the name and paste the destination into your <a href='/dns?book=router&amp;filter=none'>address book</a>. Click <i>Add</i> to save the new entry."
msgstr "Weka jina na bandiki lengo kwenye <a href='/dns?book=router&amp;filter=none'>kitabu cha anwani</a> yako. Bofya <i>Ongeza</i> kuhifadhi ingizo jipya."

msgid "In the web browser you have configured for I2P usage, browse to your website name (<i>chosenhostname</i>.i2p) and you should be returned to this page."
msgstr "Kwenye kivinjari cha tovuti ulichosanidi kwa matumizi ya I2P, tembea hadi jina la tovuti yako (<i>jinalakachaguliwa</i>.i2p) na unapaswa kurudiwa kwenye kurasa hii."

msgid "Before you tell the world about your new website, you should add some content. Go to the server's root directory <a href=#rootdir>listed above</a> and replace the <i>index.html</i> redirect page with your own content. If you need a template for a basic site, feel free to adapt <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/help/pagetemplate.html>this page</a>. If you're returned to this page after editing the content, try clearing your browser's web cache."
msgstr "Kabla ya kumwambia dunia kuhusu tovuti yako mpya, unapaswa kuongeza maudhui. Nenda kwenye <a href=#rootdir>katalogi kuu ya seva iliyoorodheshwa hapo juu</a> na badilisha kurasa ya kuelekeza <i>index.html</i> kwa maudhui yako mwenyewe. Ikiwa unahitaji kielelezo cha tovuti ya msingi, uhuru kubadilisha <a href=http://127.0.0.1:7658/help/pagetemplate.html>kurasa hii</a>. Ikiwa urudi kwenye kurasa hii baada ya kuhariri maudhui, jaribu kufuta cache ya tovuti ya kivinjari chako."

msgid "Content Optimization"
msgstr "Urekebishaji wa Maudhui"

msgid "In order to provide the best experience for visitors to your site, there are various additional steps you may wish to consider once your site is up and running:"
msgstr "Ili kutoa uzoefu bora kwa wageni wa tovuti yako, kuna hatua mbalimbali za ziada unazoweza kuzingatia baada ya tovuti yako kuanza kufanya kazi:"

msgid "Optimize your images"
msgstr "Rekebisha picha zako"

msgid "If you want your site to feel responsive, image compression is essential when hosting large images. Using a service like <a href=https://tinypng.com/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>tinypng.com</a> to compress your png and jpeg images will often result in much smaller files with minimal loss of quality. In some situations the webp format can best jpegs, generating smaller files with approximately the same or better visual fidelity, and has wide browser support. Also consider using svgs instead of bitmaps for icons and illustrations - they're often smaller than the equivalent bitmap file (run them through a service like <a href=https://vecta.io/nano target=_blank class='sitelink external'>Nano SVG Optimizer</a> to remove unneeded cruft), scale without loss of quality, and can be gzipped by your webserver."
msgstr "Ikiwa unataka tovuti yako kuhisi kuwa inajibu, kukandwa picha ni muhimu unapohosti picha kubwa. Ikiwa unatumia huduma kama <a href=https://tinypng.com/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>tinypng.com</a> kukandwa picha zako za png na jpeg, mara nyingi faili zako zinakuwa ndogo sana zenye hasara kidogo ya ubora. Katika hali fulani muundo wa webp unaweza kuwa bora kwa jpegs, kutengeneza faili ndogo zenye ufanisi wa macho karibu au bora zaidi, na una msaada mpana wa kivinjari. Pia fikiri kutumia svgs badala ya bitmaps kwa aikoni na michoro - mara nyingi ni ndogo kuliko faili ya bitmap inayolingana (ziendeshe kupitia huduma kama <a href=https://vecta.io/nano target=_blank class='sitelink external'>Nano SVG Optimizer</a> ili kuondoa taka isiyohitajika), zinapoweza kupimishwa bila kupoteza ubora, na zinaweza kubandwa na seva yako ya tovuti."

msgid "Use separate files for multi-use assets"
msgstr "Tumia faili tofauti kwa vipengeleo vinavyotumika mara nyingi"

msgid "Wherever possible, assets that are used repeatedly on your site should be loaded from an external file and not inlined. If you're using the same CSS on several pages, create a separate css file and load that in the <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> section of your pages. This will make styling updates to your site easier to manage, and will also allow the file to be cached in the visitor's browser, resulting in less bandwidth demands on your webserver and faster page loads for your visitors."
msgstr "Popote inapowezekana, vipengeleo vinavyotumika mara kwa mara kwenye tovuti yako vinapaswa kupakiwa kutoka faili ya nje na siyo kuingizwa ndani. Ikiwa unatumia CSS ile ile kwenye kurasa nyingi, tengeneza faili tofauti ya css na ipakiwe katika sehemu ya <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> ya kurasa zako. Hii itafanya mabadiliko ya mtindo wa tovuti yako yawe rahisi kusimamia, na pia itaruhusu faili kuhifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari cha mgenzi, hivyo kupunguza mahitaji ya kasi kwenye seva yako ya tovuti na kurasa zako kupakiwa haraka kwa wageni wako."

msgid "Consider using a backend cache"
msgstr "Fikiri kutumia cache ya nyuma"

msgid "If you're running a dynamic site handling a large number of concurrent users, content caching can often improve the time taken to deliver pages. For content that rapidly changes, a <a href=https://blog.stackpath.com/glossary-micro-caching/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>micro-caching strategy</a> may still yield some benefits. The <a href=https://www.nginx.com/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>Nginx webserver</a> provides a competent caching sub-system, or for a more heavy-weight solution, have a look at <a href=https://varnish-cache.org/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>Varnish</a>."
msgstr "Ikiwa unaendesha tovuti inayobadilika na inashughulikia idadi kubwa ya watumiaji wanaotumia kwa wakati mmoja, kuhifadhi maudhui kunaweza kuboresha muda unaohitajika kutoa kurasa. Kwa maudhui yanayobadilika haraka, <a href=https://blog.stackpath.com/glossary-micro-caching/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>mkakato wa kuhifadhi kwa muda mfupi</a> bado unaweza kutoa faida fulani. <a href=https://www.nginx.com/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>Seva ya tovuti ya Nginx</a> inatoa mfumo wa kuhifadhi unaofaa, au kwa suluhisho zito zaidi, angalia <a href=https://varnish-cache.org/ target=_blank class='sitelink external'>Varnish</a>."

msgid "Using an alternative webserver"
msgstr "Kutumia seva ya tovuti mbadala"

msgid "To configure an alternative webserver for use on I2P, you can either use the existing webserver tunnel and <a href=/configclients>disable the default webserver</a> from running, or create a new HTTP Server tunnel in the <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Tunnel Manager</a>. Ensure that the webserver's <i>listening port</i> is also configured in the Tunnel Manager settings. For example, if your webserver is listening by default on address 127.0.0.1 port 80, you'd also need to ensure that the <i>Target port</i> in the Tunnel Manager settings page for the service is also configured to port 80."
msgstr "Ili kusanidi seva ya tovuti mbadala ya matumizi kwenye I2P, unaweza kutumia tuneli ya seva ya tovuti iliyopo na <a href=/configclients>kuzima seva ya tovuti ya default</a> isiyokuwa inafanya kazi, au kunda tuneli mpya ya Seva ya HTTP kwenye <a href=/i2ptunnelmgr>Msimamizi wa Tuneli</a>. Hakikisha kwamba <i>bandari inayosikilizwa</i> ya seva yako ya tovuti imesanidiwa pia katika mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli. Kwa mfano, ikiwa seva yako ya tovuti inasikiliza kwa chaguo-msingi kwenye anwani 127.0.0.1 bandari 80, unapaswa pia kuhakikisha kwamba <i>Bandari lengwa</i> katika kurasa ya mipangilio ya Msimamizi wa Tuneli kwa huduma hiyo imesanidiwa pia kuwa bandari 80."

msgid "To preserve anonymity, make sure that the webserver is not publicly available outside of the I2P network, which is normally achieved by configuring the webserver to listen on localhost (127.0.0.1) rather than all interfaces (0.0.0.0)."
msgstr "Ili kudumisha usiri, hakikisha kwamba seva yako ya tovuti haipatikani kwa umma nje ya mtandao wa I2P, jambo linalofanyika kwa kawaida kwa kusanidi seva ya tovuti kusikiliza kwenye localhost (127.0.0.1) badala ya kiolesura zote (0.0.0.0)."

msgid "Be aware that a poorly configured webserver or web appplication can leak information such as your real IP address or server details that may reduce your anonymity or assist a hacker. If using an alternative platform, be sure to secure it before putting it online. If in doubt, consult online guides about web server and web application hardening, for example:"
msgstr "Zingatia kwamba seva ya tovuti au programu ya tovuti iliyosanidiwa vibaya inaweza kuvuja taarifa kama anwani yako halisi ya IP au maelezo ya seva ambayo yanaweza kupunguza usiri wako au kumsaidia mhacker. Ikiwa unatumia jukwaa mbadala, hakikisha umeilinda kabla ya kuiweka mtandaoni. Ikiwa huna uhakika, wasiliana na miongozo mtandaoni kuhusu kuimarisha seva za tovuti na programu za tovuti, kwa mfano:"

msgid "Apache Web Server Security Guide"
msgstr "Mwongozo wa Usalama wa Seva ya Tovuti ya Apache"

msgid "Nginx Web Server Security Guide"
msgstr "Mwongozo wa Usalama wa Seva ya Tovuti ya Nginx"

msgid "How to Harden Your WordPress Site"
msgstr "Jinsi ya Kuimarisha Tovuti Yako ya WordPress"

msgid "<b>Note:</b> On some Apache installations, the <a href=https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_status.html target=_blank class='sitelink external'>mod_status</a> and <a href=https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_info.html target=_blank class='sitelink external'>mod_info</a> modules are enabled by default. It is important to disable these, or otherwise protect access to the urls, to avoid compromising the anonymity and security of your server."
msgstr "<b>Kumbuka:</b> Kwenye baadhi ya masakinisho ya Apache, moduli za <a href=https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_status.html target=_blank class='sitelink external'>mod_status</a> na <a href=https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_info.html target=_blank class='sitelink external'>mod_info</a> zinawashwa kwa chaguo-msingi. Ni muhimu kuzizima, au kuzilinda kwa njia nyingine upatikanaji wa urls, ili kuepuka kuhatarisha usiri na usalama wa seva yako."

