msgid "Your I2P+ router by default contributes to the network by routing internal, end-to-end encrypted traffic for other routers, known as <i>participation</i>. Bandwidth participation improves the anonymity level of all users on the network and maximizes your download speed."
msgstr "Routeri yenu ya I2P+ kwa kawaida inachangia kwa mtandao kwa kuelekeza trafiki ya ndani iliyosimbuziwa kutoka mwisho hadi mwisho kwa routeri nyingine, inayoitwa <i>ushiriki</i>. Kushiriki kwa kasi kunaboresha kiwango cha usiri kwa watumiaji wote kwenye mtandao na kuongeza kasi yenu ya kupakuliwa."

msgid "For the best experience, it's recommended to configure your bandwidth settings to match the values provided by your ISP. If you are unsure of your bandwidth, you can run a test to determine your download and upload speeds."
msgstr "Kwa uzoefu bora zaidi, inashauriwa kusanidi mipangilio yenu ya kasi ili kulingana na thamani zinazotolewa na ISP yenu. Ikiwa kasi yenu haijulikani, mnaweza kuendesha jaribio kubaini kasi yenu ya kupakuliwa na kasi yenu ya kupakia."

msgid "Bandwidth Test"
msgstr "Jaribio la Kasi"

msgid "I2P+ will now test your internet connection to identify the optimal speed settings."
msgstr "I2P+ sasa itajaribu muunganisho wenu wa Internet ili kubaini mipangilio bora ya kasi."

msgid "This is done using the third-party M-Lab service."
msgstr "Hivi ndivyo inavyofanywa, kwa kutumia huduma ya M-Lab ya mtu wa tatu."

msgid "Please review the M-Lab privacy policies linked below."
msgstr "Tafadhali pitia sera za usiri za M-Lab zilizounganishwa hapa chini."

msgid "If you do not wish to run the M-Lab bandwidth test, you may skip it by clicking the button below."
msgstr "Kama hamtaki kuendesha jaribio la kasi la M-Lab, mnaweza kuruka kwa kubofya kitufe hapa chini."

msgid "M-Lab Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Sera ya Usiri ya M-Lab"

msgid "M-Lab Name Server Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Sera ya Usiri ya Seva ya Majina ya M-Lab"

msgid "The bandwidth test is now running and will take around 60 seconds to complete, after which you should be forwarded to the results page."
msgstr "Jaribio la kasi sasa linafanya kazi na litachukua takriban sekunde 60 kumalika, baada ya hapo mtapelezwa kwenye kurasa ya matokeo."

msgid "Bandwidth Test in progress"
msgstr "Jaribio la Kasi Linafanya Kazi"

msgid "Javascript is disabled - wait 60 seconds for the bandwidth test to complete and then click Next"
msgstr "Javascript imezimwa - subira sekunde 60 ili jaribio la kasi likamilike, kisha bofya Ifuatayo"

msgid "Bandwidth Test Results"
msgstr "Matokeo ya Jaribio la Kasi"

msgid "Test running?"
msgstr "Je, jaribio linafanya kazi?"

msgid "Test complete?"
msgstr "Je, jaribio limekamilika?"

msgid "Test server location"
msgstr "Eneo la seva ya jaribio"

msgid "Completion status"
msgstr "Hali ya ukamilishaji"

